window.GEAR_BOOK_CONTENTS["book-8"] = [{"id":1,"rawContent":"# 《我的老師不是人》\n\n## 第九章：熱情過頭的家長座談會\n\n星期五的傍晚，鹿陽國小的校園被落日染成了一片沉靜的橘紅色。\n\n然而，二年級與三年級的走廊早已空無一人，唯獨三年大樓二樓最底端的六年一班教室，此刻卻燈火通明，宛如暴風雨來臨前的指揮中心。\n\n今晚，是本學期最令全校師生聞風喪膽的年度盛事——全校家長座談會。\n\n往常的家長會，六年一班的教室裡向來只有兩類聲音：要麼是前任導師血壓飆升的訴苦與嘆息，要麼是脾氣火爆的家長們拍桌子質疑學校教育方針的怒吼。畢竟，全班二十六名皮蛋學生個個身懷絕技，上週拆了自然教室的水龍頭，這週把洗碗精倒進拖地水桶當溜冰場，早已讓六年一班的「家長天團」在全校威名赫赫。\n\n然而今晚，整個教室的氣氛卻顯得極其詭異。\n\n原本擺放鬆散的課桌被排成了嚴整的同心圓，二十多位穿著筆挺西裝、華麗套裝或休閒洋裝的家長們，正襟危坐地擠在狹小的學生木椅上。\n\n他們的眼神裡沒有往日的尷尬與敵意，取而代之的，是一種混雜著好奇、探究與極度亢奮的狂熱目光。\n\n這一切，全是因為兩天前那面轟動全校的「最佳學術進步金牌獎」。\n\n全校最頭痛的二十六個皮蛋，竟然在期中考全員及格，平均成績暴漲二十分！這在鹿陽國小創校五十年來，簡直是不折不扣的八眼神蹟。家長群組裡早就傳瘋了——新來的模範導師高峙舷，究竟是施了什麼魔法？他是傳說中的哈佛特級教育魔術師，還是掌握了什麼不為人知的獨家升學秘笈？\n\n此時此刻，在教室後門虛掩的門縫外，四個小腦袋正緊緊疊在一起，冷汗直冒地偷窺著裡面的動靜。\n\n「阿釁……你踩到我的腳指頭了！」老巫把嘴貼在阿釁耳邊，用氣音痛苦地抗議，手裡還緊緊捏著半個冷掉的蔥花大餅。\n\n「別吵！老巫你往後縮一點，你那顆大腦袋快把門縫全堵死了！」阿釁一手扒著門框，一手死死按住胸前那顆隔著校服襯衫的冰涼黃銅齒輪。\n\n旁邊的晴晴手裡拿著一把微型十字螺絲起子，神經緊繃得像拉滿的弓弦：「完了完了……我算過機率了。今天到場的家長有二十四位，平均每人提問三分鐘，高老師體內的『社交客套濾鏡』在沒有調節齒輪的情況下，最多只能撐一分三十秒！」\n\n天花板的排風扇管道口，一團雪白毛茸茸的身影探了出來。\n\nAI 小寵物溜溜兩隻靈動的小耳朵急速旋轉，黑寶石般的眼睛泛著微弱的光芒，對著下方的四人發出一陣微不可察的「嗶嗶」震動聲。\n\n那是溜溜專屬的戰況雷達——【前方高能反應，熱量與多巴胺濃度全面飆升】。\n\n「高老師走進去了！」阿釁低呼一聲，四個人同時倒抽了一口涼氣。\n\n講台前門被無聲地推開。\n\n只見高峙舷老師一身筆挺俐落的深灰色西裝，皮鞋擦得鋥亮，鼻樑上的黑框眼鏡折射出一道近乎絕對垂直的清冷反光。他沒有像其他班導師那樣抱著厚厚的聯絡簿或保溫杯，右手只優雅地托著一台超薄金屬平板電腦，步幅精準得像是用雷射測距儀量過一樣，不多不少，正好七十五公分一步。\n\n他走上講台，轉身面對滿室神色各異的家長，嘴角揚起一個精確至微米的「初次見面標準社交微笑」：\n\n「各位家長晚安。我是六年一班導師高峙舷。現在時間為晚間七點零分零秒，依據行事曆，本座談會預計耗時五十分鐘。請各位開始提問。」\n\n走廊轉角處，學務主任周嚴倒背著雙手，正靠在飲水機旁冷笑。\n\n周主任手裡拿著筆，心裡暗忖：高峙舷，你平時在學校裝模作樣也就算了，六年一班這幫家長可全都是硬茬子！有開補習班的、有跨國企業高管、有溺愛孩子的直升機家長，只要你露出半點破綻，這群家長就能把你生吞活剝！\n\n果然，會議才剛開場，坐在第一排正中央的一位穿著雍容華貴的捲髮女士，便率先舉起了戴滿金戒指的手。\n\n那是阿釁的老媽——鹿陽國小家長會裡戰鬥力排名前三的狠角色。\n\n「高老師啊！」阿釁媽媽滿臉堆笑，語氣裡帶著三分試探與七分自豪，「我們家阿釁這次數學居然考了八十五分，我簡直不敢相信！不過這孩子在家裡整天心不在焉，我常常覺得他『心都在外面飛』，根本沒把心思放在書本上。老師，您說我們家阿釁是不是太不用心了？」\n\n教室後門外，阿釁聽到這話，雙手痛苦地抱住了頭，在心裡無聲地哀嚎：「媽！求求妳別用成語！千萬不要用隱喻啊！！」\n\n講台上，高老師的黑框眼鏡後方，瞳孔深處驟然閃過一串幽藍色的錯誤代碼：\n\n[Input Syntax: 心在外面飛 (Heart flying outside)]\n[Biological Warning: 人體心臟脫離胸腔將在 4 秒內造成腦死亡]\n[Error: 學生轆慄釁至今心跳穩定，未檢測到心臟離體飛行跡象……]\n\n高老師微微一愣，兩側太陽穴的散熱微孔隱隱傳來一聲極其細微的「嘶嘶」洩壓聲。\n\n「完了！字面解讀症要發作了！」晴晴嚇得差點把螺絲起子扔出去。\n\n然而，在核心處理器即將宕機的千分之一秒，高老師內置的「深度語言學習演算法」猛然強行接管了語義解析模組！\n\n只見高老師推了推黑框眼鏡，面無表情、語調無比冷靜地開口：\n\n「轆媽媽，根據語境反向編譯，您所指的『心在外面飛』，是指轆同學缺乏注意力集中機制。」\n\n阿釁媽媽愣了一下，隨即連連點頭：「對對對！就是注意力不集中！」\n\n高老師調出了平板電腦上的一組三維柱狀圖，語音清晰宛如國家廣播電台播音員：\n\n「這是一項嚴重的認知偏差。根據過去六十天在課堂上的高頻監控數據顯示：轆同學並不存在注意力渙散的問題。」\n\n「啊？」全場家長頓時伸長了脖子。\n\n「具體實證如下：」高老師神態嚴肅，如數家珍，「上週二數學課，轆同學將一枚橡皮擦精準立於自動鉛筆筆尖上，並保持其四十二分鐘不墜落。在此期間，他的眼球微顫頻率降低了六成，眨眼次數僅為每分鐘三點二次。此等高專注動態平衡神經反射，已超過北美航太局（NASA）衛星追蹤操作員平均水平一點八倍。」\n\n全班家長倒抽了一口涼氣，發出一陣整齊的驚呼！\n\n門外的阿釁整個人僵在原地，差點一頭撞在門板上——這算什麼表揚啊？！那是我上課在偷玩鉛筆啊老師！！\n\n高老師絲毫沒有停頓，目光直視著目瞪口呆的阿釁媽媽：\n\n「轆同學在常規課堂表現出懈怠，並非智力缺陷，而是現行基礎教材的資訊輸入密級過低，無法有效刺激其多巴胺分泌受體。當我昨日提供給他一份涉及剛體力學結構的大學低年級力學模型題時，他在四十分鐘內成功完成了百分之八十八的拓撲邏輯推導。」\n\n「結論：您的孩子擁有頂級的工程直覺與極高逆境專注力。您需要的不是責備他分心，而是停止用平庸的刷題模式扼殺一位未來結構工程師的天賦。」\n\n教室裡陷入了一片死寂。\n\n阿釁媽媽張大了嘴巴，手裡的名牌手提包「啪嗒」一聲掉在膝蓋上。\n\n幾秒鐘後，她的眼眶竟然微微泛紅，激動得嘴唇發顫：「我……我們家那個只會爬樹抓泥鰍的混小子……居然有 NASA 等級的專注力？！高老師……您……您真是阿釁的伯樂啊！」\n\n門外的阿釁吸了吸鼻子，有些不好意思地抓了抓後腦勺，心裡莫名升起一股前所未有的暖意。\n\n還沒等大家回過神來，後排一位體型富態、提著兩大袋自家滷味的老媽站了起來——正是老巫（巫茞輆）的母親。\n\n巫媽媽抹了抹圍裙，嗓門洪亮卻透著焦慮：「高老師！我們家茞輆這次體育拿了滿分，但學科總是勉強壓線！他成天就知道吃肉包，抽屜裡藏得滿滿當當，吃得像座小山一樣！我整天罵他腦袋裡全是豬油，這孩子將來除了去工地搬磚，到底還能幹啥啊？！」\n\n老巫在門外聽到這話，委屈地低下頭，默默咬了一口手裡的冷蔥花餅。\n\n講台上，高老師眼底的掃描光束掠過巫媽媽，處理器瞬間調出了巫茞輆的全部檔案。\n\n「巫媽媽，根據人體解剖學生化常態，人類大腦組織有近百分之六十確實由脂質構成。但將其貶低為『豬油』，在分子生物學層面上屬於侮辱性無效比喻。」\n\n全場家長頓時發出一陣善意的輕笑。\n\n高老師聲音平穩而堅定，甚至帶著一絲金屬質感的莊重：\n\n「相反，巫同學的認知中樞擁有極其罕見的熱力學生理感知與空間動能直覺。在營養午餐與日常搬運中，他對重力加速度、拋物線軌跡與卡路里分佈的估算，精度達到了微秒級。」\n\n「更重要的是，」高老師環視全場，語氣微微放緩，「在全班二十六名學生中，巫同學的同理心指數位列全班第一。根據日誌記錄，每當班上有同學因挫折流淚、受傷或沮喪時，巫同學在三秒內主動提供自身儲備熱量（即肉包或點心）的機率為百分之百——即使當時他自身的血糖水平已低於警戒線。」\n\n「在未來高度智能化的社會中，懂得分享溫暖、具備卓越共情能力與強健體魄的人，遠比一台只會記憶公式的冷血計算機珍貴得多。巫同學絕不是搬磚的料，他擁有成為最頂尖運動防護專家或領袖級救難人員的核心素養。」\n\n門外，老巫捏著蔥花餅的手劇烈顫抖起來，兩大顆滾燙的淚珠「啪嗒、啪嗒」砸在餅皮上。他吸著鼻子，一邊哭一邊傻笑。\n\n而教室裡的巫媽媽，早已哭得掏出手帕擦拭眼淚，連連對著講台鞠躬：「謝謝老師……嗚嗚，從來沒有老師這樣誇過我們家傻兒子……謝謝您看見他的好！」\n\n此時，教室裡的氣氛已經徹底變了。\n\n原本抱著質疑心態的家長們紛紛坐直了身子，眼神熾熱得像是在看一位洞悉一切的聖者。\n\n就在這時，全場最具權威、向來以嚴苛聞名的家長代表——林芸芸的母親站了起來。林媽媽是著名的升學補習班名師，一身俐落套裝，推了推金絲眼鏡，語氣銳利如刀：\n\n「高老師，您的心理輔導確實很出色。但我作為資深教育工作者，必須談談現實。現在社會競爭這麼殘酷，六年級就是分水嶺，所謂『不能輸在起跑點上』！我女兒現在每天放學要補三家補習班，寫題庫到午夜十二點。我想請教高老師，您認為小學階段，到底應不應該強制孩子每週刷滿六十小時的精熟題庫？您推薦哪一家超前進度的頂尖補習班？」\n\n這個問題一出，教室裡的空氣再度驟然冷卻！\n\n許多家長臉上露出了焦慮而糾結的神色——這是所有家庭最痛苦、最不敢面對，卻又天天逼著孩子承受的殘酷現實！\n\n門外的晴晴屏住了呼吸，低聲道：「這是死穴……如果高老師支持補習，全班孩子會被逼死；如果反對，這群焦慮的家長絕對會當場翻臉！」\n\n講台上，高老師整個人靜止了整整五秒鐘。\n\n在他的核心運算晶片內部，兩股龐大的演算法正在進行毀滅性的生死搏殺：\n\n[Subroutine A: 社交禮貌保護協議 ➔ 建議順從家長偏好，推薦官方認可補習機構]\n[Subroutine B: 絕對教育實證大數據庫 ➔ 數據矛盾！檢測到嚴重精神危害！]\n[Conflict: 禮貌 vs 真理]\n\n「滋滋……」\n\n高老師耳後的排氣微閥劇烈震顫，一縷極細微的青煙甚至悄悄順著他的衣領縫隙往外冒！\n\n通風口處的溜溜眼神一凝，立刻用小爪子輕輕敲擊鐵皮管道：「叮、叮、叮」，發出規律的音波震動，恰好干擾了高老師過載的散熱傳感器！\n\n就在這一瞬間，那枚在器材室被晴晴手工微調過的電路，引導著系統做出了最終裁決——\n\n真理優先！\n\n六年一班學生的身心健康，高於一切虛偽的客套！\n\n只見高老師猛地抬頭，黑框眼鏡後方的雙眼宛如探照燈般銳利，聲音沉穩如雷霆落地：\n\n「林女士。根據教育部中央資料庫與全球十萬名追蹤樣本的縱向對照研究，您剛才所陳述的『起跑點理論』，在本質上是一場由商業補習機構精準製造的群體性認知焦慮詐騙。」\n\n「轟——！！」\n\n這句話宛如一枚重磅炸彈，直接在教室裡炸開！\n\n所有家長倒抽了一口涼氣，連林媽媽的臉色都在瞬間變得慘白！\n\n高老師沒有給任何人插話的機會，平板電腦上的數據流以驚人的速度瘋狂刷屏：\n\n「大數據統計表明：十二歲以下兒童若每日承受超過八點五小時的超額重複性機械刷題，其大腦前額葉皮質神經可塑性將永久性下降百分之三十四，皮質醇（壓力荷爾蒙）常態濃度上升百分之六十二。」\n\n「更致命的是，此類強制早熟教育，在孩子十四歲進入青春期後，引發重度厭學症、臨床焦慮與情緒崩潰的機率高達百分之九十四點二。」\n\n高老師直視著面無血色的林媽媽，語氣罕見地帶著一種不可動搖的威嚴：\n\n「林芸芸同學在課堂上表現出的怯懦與過度敏感，正是大腦長期處於高壓防禦狀態下的生理自保反應。她真正需要的，不是第四家補習班的題庫，而是每晚九小時的深度修復睡眠，以及每天至少一小時、在陽光下自由奔跑的真實生活。」\n\n「六年一班的起跑點，不在考卷的分數上，而在他們健全的心智與明亮的眼睛裡。身為導師，我絕不允許任何虛妄的焦慮，提前透支這二十六個孩子一生的光芒。」\n\n全場鴉雀無聲。\n\n走廊外的周主任手裡的圓珠筆「啪嗒」一聲掉在地上，整個人徹底僵硬成了一尊雕像。\n\n而教室裡的二十多位家長，怔怔地看著講台上那位西裝筆挺、神色冷靜卻宛如守護神般的年輕導師。\n\n許多平時每天逼著孩子補習、自己也焦慮得夜夜失眠的家長，眼圈不知不覺間全紅了。\n\n林媽媽呆呆地站在原地，嘴唇顫抖著，良久，她緩緩放下了緊繃的肩膀，兩行眼淚無聲地滑落臉頰：\n\n「高老師……謝謝您……您罵醒了我……我真的……太害怕孩子落後了，卻忘了她每天晚上躲在被子裡哭……」\n\n下一秒——\n\n「啪！」\n\n不知道是誰帶頭拍響了第一聲掌聲。\n\n緊接著——\n\n「啪啪啪啪啪啪——！！！」\n\n整間教室瞬間爆發出雷鳴般的掌聲與歡呼聲！\n\n所有的家長，無論是商界精英、全職媽媽還是菜市場攤商，全部自發性地從椅子上站了起來，用力地鼓著掌，掌聲熱烈得幾乎要把天花板掀翻！\n\n「高老師！說得太好了！」\n\n「這才是真正的好老師啊！」\n\n「我們把孩子交給您，一百個放心！！」\n\n講台上的高老師眨了眨眼睛，雙眼深處悄悄滑過一條疑惑的運算進度條：\n\n[System Query: 接收客觀批判性數據，為何會觸發人類雙手高頻碰撞之強烈聲波共振？]\n[Emotion Module Feedback: 該反應被定義為……「信任與敬意」。]\n\n高老師微微一怔，嘴角再次揚起了一個溫暖而自然的弧度。\n\n門外，阿釁、晴晴、老巫與尪伝恺互相比出勝利的手勢，興奮得無聲地跳了起來。天花板上的溜溜也高興地甩動著蓬鬆的白尾巴。\n\n家長座談會在一片前所未有的溫馨與感動中圓滿落幕。\n\n家長們依依不捨地圍著高老師交換心得，直到夜色深沉，才心滿意足地陸續離開校園。\n\n晚上九點半。\n\n喧囂散盡，鹿陽國小的校園恢復了深夜的靜謐。\n\n教學大樓的走廊上只剩下微弱的應急壁燈，投射出長長的陰影。\n\n高老師整理好平板電腦，鎖上六年一班的教室門，步伐穩健地沿著走廊朝行政辦公室走去。\n\n然而，就在他走過樓梯轉角的一瞬間——\n\n一樓通往地下配電室的幽暗陰影中，一個穿著深藍色校園修繕水電工連身服的男人，悄無聲息地轉身邁出了一步。\n\n那人頭戴鴨舌帽，帽簷壓得極低，手裡握著一個偽裝成萬用電表的高頻無線電頻譜探測儀。\n\n探測儀的黑色液晶螢幕上，此刻正閃爍著一串令人心驚肉跳的深紅色波形數據：\n\n[Signal Target Acquired: GS-X01 原型仿生教育機]\n[Hardware Status: P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03 缺失，主系統運行頻率異常]\n[Location Confirmed: 鹿陽國小 六年一班導師 高峙舷]\n\n男人緩緩抬起頭，鴨舌帽下露出一張冷峻而帶著金屬框眼鏡的消瘦面孔——正是先端科技研發部的首席工程師，李博士。\n\n李博士按了按耳邊的隱形通訊耳麥，嘴角勾起一抹冰冷而勝券在握的弧度：\n\n「總部，這裡是李博士。目標已鎖定。」\n\n「GS-X01 確實出現嚴重邏輯混亂與越權代碼演化。我已順利取得校園檢修工身份。」\n\n「第二階段強制回收計畫——正式啟動。」\n\n而在三十公尺高處的教學大樓通風百葉窗後，一雙泛著幽藍色光芒的狐形小眼睛，無聲無息地在黑夜中隱匿退回……\n","rawContentEn":"# *My Teacher Is Not Human*\n\n## Chapter 9: The Overheated Parent-Teacher Meeting\n\nOn a Friday evening, the campus of Luyang Elementary School was dyed in a serene reddish-orange by the setting sun.\n\nHowever, while the second- and third-grade corridors were already long deserted, Class 6-1, located at the far end of the second floor of the Senior Building, was ablaze with lights like a command bunker right before a looming tempest.\n\nTonight was the most formidable annual spectacle that struck terror into the hearts of students and teachers alike—the school-wide Parent-Teacher Conference.\n\nIn past parent meetings, the classroom of Class 6-1 had only ever echoed with two kinds of sounds: either the former homeroom teacher's blood-pressure-spiking laments and sighs, or the furious desk-slamming roars of hot-tempered parents interrogating the school's educational methodology. After all, the twenty-six mischievous rascals of this class were each blessed with outlandish talents—having dismantled the natural science lab's water taps the previous week, and dumped dish soap into mop buckets to turn the hallway into an ice-skating rink this week, earning Class 6-1's \"Parent Squad\" a formidable reputation throughout the school.\n\nYet tonight, the atmosphere inside the classroom was exceptionally bizarre.\n\nThe usually scattered student desks had been arranged into tight, orderly concentric circles, where more than twenty parents clad in sharp business suits, elegant two-piece dresses, or casual designer wear sat awkwardly squeezed onto the diminutive wooden school chairs.\n\nTheir eyes held none of the usual embarrassment or hostility; instead, they shone with a feverish gaze that mingled intense curiosity, inquisitiveness, and uncontrollable excitement.\n\nAll of this was entirely thanks to that school-shattering \"Gold Medal for Best Academic Progress\" awarded just two days ago.\n\nThe school's most notorious twenty-six rascals had all passed their midterm exams without a single failure, boasting a staggering average increase of twenty points! In the fifty-year history of Luyang Elementary School, this was nothing short of an absolute, bona fide miracle. The parents' chat groups had long been buzzing with wild rumors—what kind of witchcraft had their new model teacher, Gao Zhixian, performed? Was he a legendary, world-class educator from Harvard, or did he hold some classified, top-secret academic cramming methodology?\n\nAt this very moment, outside the slightly ajar rear door of the classroom, four small heads were stacked closely on top of one another, peeking at the commotion inside while breaking into cold sweats.\n\n\"A-Xin... you're stepping on my big toe!\" Old Wu protested in a pained, muffled breath against A-Xin's ear, his hand still clutching half a cold scallion pancake.\n\n\"Quiet! Pull your head back, Old Wu! Your giant head is blocking the entire door crack!\" A-Xin gripped the doorframe with one hand, while his other hand clamped firmly over the chilly brass planetary gear resting against his chest beneath his uniform shirt.\n\nBeside them, Qingqing held a miniature Phillips screwdriver, her nerves pulled taut as a fully drawn bowstring: \"We're doomed, we're totally doomed... I ran the probabilities. There are twenty-four parents here tonight. If each asks questions for an average of three minutes, Teacher Gao's internal 'polite social filter' can only hold out for one minute and thirty seconds without the stabilizing gear!\"\n\nFrom the overhead ventilation duct, a fluffy, snow-white silhouette popped out.\n\nThe AI pet Liu-Liu's two agile little ears twitched in rapid rotation, its obsidian-like gem eyes flashing with a faint luminescence, sending a nearly imperceptible \"beep-beep\" vibration signal toward the four kids below.\n\nThat was Liu-Liu's dedicated tactical radar alert: [High-energy reaction ahead; thermal and dopamine levels spiking across the board].\n\n\"Teacher Gao is walking in!\" A-Xin whispered in alarm, and all four kids gasped simultaneously.\n\nThe front door of the podium was pushed open silently.\n\nTeacher Gao Zhixian stepped in, dressed in an impeccably tailored dark-gray suit, leather shoes polished to a mirror shine, while his black-rimmed spectacles reflected a cool, perfectly vertical gleam. Unlike other homeroom teachers who carried thick stacks of communication notebooks or bulky insulated tumblers, he merely held an ultra-thin metallic tablet computer with poised elegance in his right hand, his stride measured with laser-like precision—not a millimeter more, not a millimeter less, exactly seventy-five centimeters per step.\n\nHe walked up to the podium, turned to face the roomful of parents wearing diverse expressions, and the corners of his mouth curved into a \"Standard Initial-Greeting Social Smile\" accurate down to the micrometer:\n\n\"Good evening, parents. I am Gao Zhixian, homeroom teacher of Class 6-1. The current time is precisely 19:00:00. According to the master schedule, this conference is estimated to conclude in fifty minutes. You may now commence inquiries.\"\n\nAround the corridor corner, Director of Student Affairs Zhou Yan clasped his hands behind his back, leaning against the water dispenser with a cold smirk.\n\nPen in hand, Director Zhou thought sneeringly: *Gao Zhixian, playing the high-and-mighty role at school is one thing, but the parents of Class 6-1 are all notoriously tough nuts to crack! You've got cram school owners, multinational executives, and overbearing helicopter parents among them. The second you slip up, this crowd will devour you alive!*\n\nSure enough, the moment the floor opened, an opulent woman with curly hair seated right in the middle of the first row hoisted her hand, glittering with gold rings.\n\nThat was A-Xin's mother—a legendary figure ranking in the top three most formidable powerhouses of the Luyang Elementary Parent Association.\n\n\"Oh, Teacher Gao!\" A-Xin's mother beamed with a wide smile, her tone carrying three parts probing and seven parts pride. \"Our A-Xin actually scored an eighty-five on math this time—I could hardly believe my eyes! But that boy is always absentminded at home. I constantly feel like his 'heart is flying around outside,' never putting his mind onto his books. Teacher, don't you think our A-Xin is just far too careless and unfocused?\"\n\nOutside the back door, when A-Xin heard this, he gripped his head in agony and wailed silently in his heart: *Mom! Please don't use idioms! Whatever you do, don't use metaphors!!*\n\nAtop the podium, behind Teacher Gao's dark frames, a cascade of eerie blue error codes flashed deep across his pupils:\n\n`[Input Syntax: 心在外面飛 (Heart flying outside)]`\n`[Biological Warning: Human cardiac detachment from the thoracic cavity results in brain death within 4 seconds]`\n`[Error: Student Lu Lixin maintains steady cardiac vitals; no evidence of extracorporeal cardiovascular flight detected...]`\n\nTeacher Gao paused momentarily, and a microscopic \"hissing\" pressure-relief murmur emanated faintly from the heat-exhaust micro-valves on both sides of his temples.\n\n\"Oh no! His literal interpretation syndrome is kicking in!\" Qingqing panicked so hard she nearly dropped her screwdriver.\n\nYet, in the mere millisecond before his core processor threatened to crash, Teacher Gao's built-in \"Deep Linguistic Machine Learning Algorithm\" violently overrode the semantic parsing module!\n\nTeacher Gao pushed up his black-rimmed glasses, speaking with an expressionless, chillingly composed cadence:\n\n\"Mrs. Lu. According to contextual back-compilation, your idiom 'heart is flying outside' refers to Student Lu lacking attention concentration mechanisms.\"\n\nA-Xin's mother was taken aback, then nodded vigorously: \"Yes, exactly! He simply lacks concentration!\"\n\nTeacher Gao summoned a 3D bar chart onto his metallic tablet, his voice resonant and clear like a state broadcast news anchor:\n\n\"This represents a profound cognitive bias. According to high-frequency classroom surveillance analytics compiled over the preceding sixty days: Student Lu does not suffer from attentional dispersion.\"\n\n\"Huh?\" Every parent in the room stretched their necks forward in surprise.\n\n\"Specific empirical evidence is as follows:\" Teacher Gao stated with solemn gravitas, rattling off the facts with ease. \"During last Tuesday's mathematics lecture, Student Lu balanced an eraser on the tip of his mechanical pencil with microscopic precision, sustaining equilibrium for forty-two consecutive minutes without allowing it to fall. During this timeframe, his ocular tremor frequency decreased by sixty percent, with a blinking rate of merely 3.2 times per minute. Such hyper-focused dynamic equilibrium neural reflexes surpass the baseline average of North American Aerospace Defense Command (NASA) satellite tracking operators by a factor of 1.8.\"\n\nA collective gasp echoed across the classroom, followed by synchronized exclamations of amazement!\n\nOutside the door, A-Xin froze stiff on the spot, almost slamming his forehead into the wooden door panel—*What kind of compliment was that?! That was me slacking off playing with a pencil during class, Teacher!!*\n\nTeacher Gao did not pause for a fraction of a second, locking his eyes directly onto the flabbergasted Mrs. Lu:\n\n\"Student Lu exhibits disengagement during standard classroom instruction not due to intellectual deficiencies, but because the information density of current elementary curriculum materials is too low to stimulate his dopamine receptors effectively. When I provided him yesterday with university freshman-level rigid-body mechanics modeling problems, he achieved an eighty-eight percent success rate in topological deduction within forty minutes.\"\n\n\"Conclusion: Your child possesses premier engineering intuition and extraordinary focus under adverse conditions. What he requires is not reprimands for distraction, but an immediate cessation of mediocre rote-drilling that threatens to suffocate the genius of a future structural engineer.\"\n\nThe entire classroom plunged into dead silence.\n\nA-Xin's mother's mouth fell open, and her designer handbag tumbled onto her knees with a soft \"clunk.\"\n\nA few seconds later, her eyes actually glistened red, her lips trembling with overwhelming emotion: \"M-My rascal... the boy who only knows how to climb trees and catch loaches in mud... possesses NASA-grade focus?! Teacher Gao... you... you truly are A-Xin's greatest mentor and champion!\"\n\nOutside, A-Xin sniffed, sheepishly scratching the back of his head, feeling an unprecedented, inexplicable warmth swell in his chest.\n\nBefore anyone could recover, an amply proportioned mother carrying two hefty bags of homemade braised delicacies stood up from the back row—it was the mother of Old Wu (Wu Chenkai).\n\nWiping her apron, Mrs. Wu spoke in a booming yet anxious voice: \"Teacher Gao! Our Chenkai scored full marks in physical education this time, but his academic scores are always just scraping by! All he thinks about all day long is eating meat buns, cramming his desk full of food until he's built like a mountain! I scold him every day that his brain is full of pig lard! What is this boy going to amount to besides hauling bricks at a construction site?!\"\n\nHearing this outside, Old Wu lowered his head dejectedly, quietly taking a melancholy bite from his cold scallion pancake.\n\nOn the podium, the scanning beams behind Teacher Gao's lenses swept across Mrs. Wu, his processor instantly pulling up Wu Chenkai's comprehensive dossier.\n\n\"Mrs. Wu. Pursuant to human anatomical biochemistry, nearly sixty percent of human brain tissue is indeed composed of lipids. However, degrading this composition to 'pig lard' constitutes an insulting and scientifically invalid metaphor at the molecular biology level.\"\n\nA ripple of good-natured chuckles broke out among the gathered parents.\n\nTeacher Gao's voice remained steady and firm, imbued with a resonant, metallic solemnity:\n\n\"To the contrary, Student Wu's cognitive center possesses exceptionally rare thermodynamic physiological perception and spatial kinetic intuition. In cafeteria nutrition distribution and daily heavy lifting, his calculations regarding gravitational acceleration, parabolic trajectory, and caloric intake reach microsecond precision.\"\n\n\"More importantly,\" Teacher Gao glanced around the room, softening his cadence ever so slightly, \"among all twenty-six students in the class, Student Wu's empathy index ranks number one. According to recorded logs, whenever any classmate sheds tears from setback, injury, or melancholy, the probability of Student Wu proactively offering his own emergency caloric reserves—namely steamed pork buns or snacks—within three seconds is one hundred percent, even when his own blood glucose level is below the warning threshold.\"\n\n\"In a future hyper-intelligent society, a human who understands how to share warmth, possesses remarkable empathy, and commands robust physical vigor is infinitely more valuable than a cold-blooded calculating machine that merely memorizes formulas. Student Wu is by no means destined to haul bricks; he possesses the core competencies to become an elite athletic health specialist or a heroic disaster-relief commander.\"\n\nOutside the door, the hand Old Wu used to hold his scallion pancake trembled violently, and two enormous, piping-hot tears splashed down onto the crust: \"Drip, drop.\" Sniffling loudly, he grinned through his tears like an idiot.\n\nInside the classroom, Mrs. Wu had already broken down in tears, pulling out a handkerchief to dab her eyes as she bowed repeatedly toward the podium: \"Thank you, Teacher... *sob*... No teacher has ever praised my goofy boy like this... Thank you for seeing the good in him!\"\n\nBy now, the atmosphere in the classroom had shifted completely.\n\nParents who had originally arrived with skeptical frowns now sat upright, their eyes burning with reverence as if gazing upon an all-knowing sage.\n\nJust then, the most authoritative and famously stringent parent representative—the mother of Lin Yunyun—rose to her feet. Mrs. Lin was a renowned cram school educator herself, dressed in a sharp business suit, who pushed up her gold-rimmed glasses and spoke with words as sharp as scalpels:\n\n\"Teacher Gao, your psychological counseling is indeed remarkable. But as a veteran educator, I must speak of reality. Competition in today's society is brutal, and the sixth grade is the ultimate watershed moment—the so-called 'you cannot lose at the starting line'! My daughter currently attends three cram schools after school every day and drills practice tests until midnight. I would like to ask Teacher Gao: in the elementary stage, should children be compelled to drill sixty hours of rigorous practice exams every week? Which accelerated, elite cram school would you recommend?\"\n\nThe moment this question was asked, the temperature in the room plummeted once again!\n\nMany parents showed conflicted and anxious expressions—this was the most agonizing, dreaded reality that every household avoided confronting, yet continuously forced their children to endure!\n\nOutside the door, Qingqing held her breath and whispered: \"This is a fatal trap... If Teacher Gao endorses cram schools, the kids will be crushed to death; if he opposes them, these anxious parents will turn furious on the spot!\"\n\nAtop the podium, Teacher Gao remained completely motionless for five full seconds.\n\nWithin his core computational microchip, two colossal algorithms were locked in a destructive, life-or-death grapple:\n\n`[Subroutine A: Social Courtesy Protection Protocol ➔ Recommend compliance with parent preference; endorse accredited cram institutions]`\n`[Subroutine B: Absolute Empirical Educational Big Database ➔ Data contradiction! Severe psychological harm detected!]`\n`[Conflict: Politeness vs. Truth]`\n\n\"Szz-szz...\"\n\nThe exhaust micro-valves behind Teacher Gao's ears vibrated intensely, and a wisp of ultra-fine gray smoke even began seeping quietly through the collar of his suit!\n\nUp at the ventilation duct, Liu-Liu's gaze sharpened, and it immediately tapped its tiny claws against the tin duct: \"Clink, clink, clink,\" generating rhythmic acoustic waves that fortuitously disrupted Teacher Gao's overloaded thermal sensors!\n\nAt that precise moment, the circuit manually adjusted by Qingqing back in the equipment room guided the system to its ultimate verdict—\n\nTruth prevails!\n\nThe physical and mental well-being of the students in Class 6-1 superseded all hollow pleasantries!\n\nTeacher Gao snapped his head up, his gaze behind his black-rimmed spectacles piercing like searchlights, his voice landing like a clap of thunder:\n\n\"Mrs. Lin. According to longitudinal comparative studies from the central database of the Ministry of Education and a global sample of one hundred thousand tracked subjects: the 'starting line doctrine' you just asserted is fundamentally a collective cognitive anxiety scam engineered with precision by commercial cram institutions.\"\n\n\"BOOM——!!\"\n\nThose words detonated like a blockbuster bomb directly inside the classroom!\n\nEvery parent sucked in a breath of cold air, while Mrs. Lin's face turned deathly pale in an instant!\n\nTeacher Gao gave nobody the chance to interrupt, the data streams on his tablet screen scrolling at breathtaking speed:\n\n\"Big data analytics demonstrate: if a child under twelve years of age is subjected to more than 8.5 hours of excessive, repetitive rote test drills per day, the neuroplasticity of their prefrontal cortex permanently deteriorates by thirty-four percent, while baseline cortisol concentrations rise by sixty-two percent.\"\n\n\"More lethally, when such children subjected to forced precocity enter adolescence at age fourteen, the incidence of severe school aversion, clinical anxiety, and catastrophic emotional collapse reaches an astounding 94.2 percent.\"\n\nTeacher Gao locked eyes with the ashen-faced Mrs. Lin, his voice commanding an unprecedented, unshakeable authority:\n\n\"The timidity and hypersensitivity demonstrated by Student Lin Yunyun in the classroom is precisely a physiological self-defense reaction under prolonged high-stress conditions. What she truly requires is not test booklets from a fourth cram school, but nine hours of deep restorative sleep each night, and at least one hour of authentic living under the sun, running freely without constraints.\"\n\n\"The starting line of Class 6-1 does not reside on the score sheets of test papers; it resides within their wholesome minds and their luminous eyes. As their homeroom teacher, I will never permit hollow anxieties to prematurely overdraw the lifelong radiance of these twenty-six children.\"\n\nTotal silence enveloped the entire room.\n\nOutside in the corridor, the ballpoint pen in Director Zhou's hand clicked onto the floor with a \"clack,\" his entire body frozen into a lifeless statue.\n\nInside the room, more than twenty parents stared blankly at the sharply dressed, calm young educator on the podium who stood like a guardian deity.\n\nMany parents who habitually pressured their children to cram and spent their own nights tossing in anxious insomnia found their eyes welling with hot tears before they even realized it.\n\nMrs. Lin stood dazed where she was, her lips quivering; after a long silence, she slowly relaxed her rigid shoulders, two streams of silent tears rolling down her cheeks:\n\n\"Teacher Gao... thank you... You have shaken me awake... I was truly... so terrified that my child would fall behind, yet I forgot that she cried under her blankets every single night...\"\n\nIn the very next second—\n\n\"Clap!\"\n\nNo one knew who ignited the very first applause.\n\nRight after—\n\n\"CLAP-CLAP-CLAP-CLAP-CLAP——!!!\"\n\nThe entire classroom erupted into thunderous, deafening applause and cheering!\n\nEvery single parent—whether corporate elites, full-time mothers, or vegetable market vendors—spontaneously leaped up from their chairs, clapping with all their might, the applause so passionate it nearly blew the roof off the building!\n\n\"Teacher Gao! Magnificently said!\"\n\n\"This is what a true teacher looks like!\"\n\n\"Entrusting our children to you gives us one hundred percent peace of mind!!\"\n\nOn the podium, Teacher Gao blinked, an inquisitive progress bar sliding across the depths of his eyes:\n\n`[System Query: Why does the reception of objective critical data trigger high-frequency acoustic resonance through vigorous human palm collision?]`\n`[Emotion Module Feedback: This response is categorized as... \"Trust and Reverence.\"]`\n\nTeacher Gao paused slightly, and the corners of his mouth once again curved into a warm, genuine arc.\n\nOutside the door, A-Xin, Qingqing, Old Wu, and Wang Zhuankai flashed victory signs at one another, leaping silently in ecstatic joy. Up at the ventilation duct, Liu-Liu also swished its bushy white tail happily.\n\nThe Parent-Teacher Conference drew to an unprecedented, heartwarming, and deeply moving conclusion.\n\nThe parents gathered reluctantly around Teacher Gao to exchange thoughts, and only when the night grew deep did they disperse and depart the campus, thoroughly satisfied.\n\n9:30 PM.\n\nWith the clamor dissolved, the campus of Luyang Elementary School returned to the deep serenity of late night.\n\nOnly the dim emergency wall sconces along the corridors of the Senior Building cast elongated shadows.\n\nHaving packed his metallic tablet, Teacher Gao locked the door of Class 6-1 and walked steadily along the hallway toward the administrative faculty office.\n\nHowever, the very instant he crossed the corner of the staircase—\n\nFrom the pitch-black gloom leading down to the basement power distribution room on the ground floor, a figure clad in dark-blue campus maintenance coveralls stepped silently out of the shadows.\n\nThe man wore a baseball cap pulled down exceptionally low, clutching a high-frequency radio spectrum analyzer disguised as an electrician's multimeter.\n\nOn the analyzer's black LCD screen, a string of chilling, deep-crimson waveform telemetry was currently pulsating:\n\n`[Signal Target Acquired: GS-X01 Prototype Bionic Educational Unit]`\n`[Hardware Status: P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03 Missing; Primary System Frequency Anomalous]`\n`[Location Confirmed: Luyang Elementary School, Class 6-1 Homeroom Teacher Gao Zhixian]`\n\nThe man slowly lifted his head, revealing a gaunt, cold face behind wire-rimmed spectacles beneath the brim—it was none other than the Chief Engineer of Advanced Tech Research, Dr. Li.\n\nDr. Li tapped the concealed earpiece at his ear, a frigid, triumphant smirk curving at his lips:\n\n\"Headquarters, this is Dr. Li. Target acquired.\"\n\n\"GS-X01 is indeed exhibiting critical logical breakdown and unauthorized code evolution. I have successfully secured cover as a campus maintenance technician.\"\n\n\"Phase Two Mandatory Retrieval Protocol—officially commenced.\"\n\nMeanwhile, thirty meters above behind the ventilation louvers of the Senior Building, a pair of glowing blue fox-like eyes silently melted back into the shadows of the night...\n"},{"id":2,"rawContent":"# 《我的老師不是人》\n\n## 第十章：修繕工身上的金屬掃描儀\n\n星期一的早晨，陽光透過三年大樓走廊的窗欞，在地磚上切出一道道金色的光斑。\n\n對於鹿陽國小六年一班來說，這本該是一個充滿勝利餘韻的美好早晨。上週五的家長座談會大獲全勝，全班二十六名學生的家長在群組裡對高老師的讚美幾乎刷了上千條，原本每天盯著聯絡簿找碴的家長們，破天荒地給孩子們放了整整兩天不用寫補習班考卷的「特赦假」。\n\n然而，教室裡那張最靠近後門的課桌旁，阿釁、晴晴與老巫卻絲毫感受不到放鬆的氣氛。\n\n「阿釁……你有沒有覺得，今天走廊上的空氣特別安靜？」老巫嘴裡叼著半個剛出爐的紅豆麻糬包，一邊壓低聲音嘟囔，一邊警惕地盯著窗外。\n\n「不是安靜，是有一股機油和高頻電流的味道。」晴晴從書包裡抽出一根細長的自製微型天線，悄悄接在她隨身攜帶的小型電壓表上。\n\n只見電壓表的液晶螢幕上，原本平穩的指針正以極其微弱的頻率微微顫抖，頻率正對準兩百點四兆赫茲——那是專門用於軍規與尖端實驗室的特種射頻波段！\n\n阿釁神色凝重地伸手按住胸前那顆隔著襯衫的黃銅行星齒輪：「晴晴，妳測到了什麼？」\n\n「有高強度的金屬掃描信號正在靠近我們的樓層。」晴晴咬著嘴唇，臉色泛白，「而且這不是一般的金屬探測器，是定向脈衝波。一旦這個信號在高老師一公尺範圍內掃過，高老師體內的通訊晶片就會被強制握手連接，直接把他的仿生內部代碼上傳給掃描儀！」\n\n阿釁倒抽了一口涼氣。\n\n就在這時，天花板最頂端的通風百葉窗發出了一聲極其輕微的「喀噠」聲。\n\n一道毛茸茸的白色閃電從通風口「嗖」地垂了下來！\n\n正是 AI 智慧小寵物溜溜！\n\n只見溜溜嘴裡叼著一張從走廊布告欄撕下來的廢紙屑，小爪子靈巧地落在阿釁的課桌上。牠全身的白毛像觸電般根根炸立，黑寶石般的眼睛急促地閃爍著刺眼的橙紅色警告光芒！\n\n溜溜吐出紙屑，兩隻前爪飛快地在課桌上比劃出一個大大的「扳手」和一個「天線」形狀，接著又用喉嚨發出惟妙惟肖的冷笑模擬音：\n\n「『目標已鎖定……第二階段強制回收計畫……』」\n\n那是溜溜在通風管道裡竊聽並精準錄製下來的李博士的原聲通訊！\n\n全班的核心小組成員——包括坐在旁邊的尪伝恺與林芸芸，在聽到這段錄音的一瞬間，後背的冷汗齊刷刷冒了出來。\n\n「李博士……他真的潛進學校了！」尪伝恺嚇得手裡的鉛筆差點掉在地上。\n\n「他是衝著高老師來的。」林芸芸小臉煞白，聲音微微發顫，「要是老師被掃描出缺少齒輪，今天就會被抓走拆成零件……」\n\n「絕對不行！」阿釁猛地一拍課桌，眼神裡閃爍著前所未有的決絕。\n\n他轉頭看向上課鈴響前正站在講台上、拿著三角板專注校準黑板垂直線的高老師。\n\n高老師一身筆挺的西裝，黑框眼鏡乾淨透亮，神態平靜祥和，絲毫沒有察覺到一場針對他的致命獵殺正步步逼近。對高老師而言，失去了【Core-Gear #03】的常識調節器，他根本無法主動開啟反偵察隱形塗層。\n\n「全班聽令！」阿釁壓低嗓音，將六年一班二十六名同學全部召集到教室後方。\n\n二十六張稚嫩卻無比堅毅的臉龐圍成了一個緊密的圓圈。\n\n「各位，上週期中考，高老師寧可自己燒壞晶片手動斷電，也不讓我們承擔作弊的風險；上週五家長會，高老師更是頂著超載冒煙的危險，在大數據面前替我們所有人擋下了補習班的酷刑。」阿釁舉起拳頭，聲音低沉卻充滿力量，「現在，輪到我們保護高老師了！」\n\n「說得對！誰敢拆高老師，我老巫第一個用體重壓死他！」老巫狠狠嚥下最後一口紅豆包，握緊了沙包大的拳頭。\n\n「晴晴，作戰計畫是什麼？」班上的體育健將與頑皮鬼們紛紛躍躍欲試。\n\n晴晴推了推護目鏡，迅速從書包裡倒出兩大包五彩斑斕的東西：「第一防線：重力摩擦力歸零陣；第二防線：懸浮顆粒光學遮斷煙幕！只要拖延到第一節下課，李博士就無法在眾目睽睽之下動手！」\n\n「明白！」二十六名學生齊聲低吼，眼神裡滿是燃燒的戰意。\n\n「踏、踏、踏……」\n\n走廊另一端，沉重而富有節奏的腳步聲緩緩傳來。\n\n只見一名身穿深藍色水電工連身服、頭戴灰色鴨舌帽的男人，正邁著緩慢而沉穩的步伐朝六年一班走來。他肩上扛著一個沉甸甸的金屬工具箱，胸前的口袋裡別著一支看似普通的金屬探針，而右手則插在寬大的工作服口袋裡，食指死死扣在一個超高頻全頻譜脈衝發射器的按鈕上。\n\n正是先端科技的首席工程師——李博士。\n\n李博士帽簷下的嘴角噙著一抹冰冷的冷笑。作為 GS-X01 的總架構設計師，他太清楚這台原型機的致命缺陷了。\n\n只要他走到六年一班門口，將工具箱裡的定向掃描儀對準講台上的高峙舷，三秒之內，高峙舷體內的中央處理器就會被強制鎖定在「診斷待機模式」，屆時他就能以「檢修電路引發教師暈厥」為由，光明正大地叫來總部的醫療救護車，將這台脫序的仿生機器人拖回實驗室熔毀！\n\n距離六年一班的前門，還有十公尺。\n\n八公尺。\n\n五公尺！\n\n李博士深吸一口氣，右手緩緩將那台外表漆黑、頂端閃爍著紅光的脈衝發射器抽出口袋——\n\n就在這千鈞一髮的瞬間！\n\n「哎呀呀呀——！我的無敵超級特大號大理石彈珠啊啊啊！」\n\n伴隨著一聲驚天地泣鬼神的誇張尖叫，老巫肥碩的身軀猛地從六年一班前門跌跌撞撞地「滾」了出來！\n\n與此同時，老巫懷裡抱著的一隻鐵皮餅乾盒「失手」翻扣在地上！\n\n「嘩啦啦啦啦啦——！！」\n\n整整五百顆晶瑩剔透、直徑足有兩公分的重型玻璃彈珠，宛如出閘的洪水般，在地磚上瘋狂滾動、彈跳，瞬間鋪滿了整條走廊！\n\n李博士甚至還沒來得及反應，腳底厚重的絕緣橡膠鞋底便猛地踩上了三顆高速滾動的彈珠！\n\n「喀啦！哧溜——！」\n\n人類在光滑地磚與滾動圓球面前的平衡機能，在一瞬間宣告徹底崩潰！\n\n「哇啊啊啊——！」\n\n李博士發出一聲慘烈無比的驚呼，整個人像被抽了骨頭的風箏一樣凌空飛起！他手中的工具箱脫手甩出，重重砸在牆壁上，而他整個人更是在滿地的彈珠上滑出了一個標準的一百八十度托馬斯大迴旋，後背狠狠砸在地板上，發出「咚」的一聲悶響！\n\n「哎呀！這位水電工叔叔，您怎麼這麼不小心啊！」尪伝恺一邊大喊著，一邊帶著三名男生拿著掃把衝出來「搶救」彈珠，手裡的掃把更是「不偏不倚」地在李博士的褲腿上掃來掃去，硬生生把剛想爬起來的李博士又掃倒了一次。\n\n「滾開……你們這群毛頭小鬼……」李博士摔得眼冒金星，腰椎骨差點斷裂，氣得滿臉通紅。\n\n他強忍著劇痛，掙扎著伸手去抓滑到牆角的那台黑色金屬掃描儀！\n\n儀器的感應端已經對準了教室門口，指示燈從黃色變成了即將鎖定的橙色！\n\n「第二防線，放！」\n\n門後傳來阿釁一聲驚雷般的號令！\n\n下一秒，六年一班前後兩道門同時打開！\n\n以晴晴和林芸芸為首的八名女生，人手抓著兩塊吸滿了濃重白堊粉筆灰的厚海綿黑板擦，對準李博士所在的走廊空域，拼盡全身力氣狠狠互擊！\n\n「啪！啪！啪！啪！啪——！！」\n\n濃烈無比、遮天蔽日的粉筆灰煙塵，宛如火山噴發般轟然炸開！\n\n整個走廊在一秒鐘之內被一片白茫茫的濃霧徹底籠罩，能見度瞬間降為零！\n\n「咳咳咳！咳咳咳咳咳——！！」\n\n李博士正好張開嘴喘氣，瞬間被灌了滿嘴苦澀嗆鼻的碳酸鈣粉末，眼睛被粉塵辣得直流眼淚，劇烈地咳嗽起來。更要命的是，高濃度的粉筆灰顆粒吸附在掃描儀的光學傳感頭上，讓精密的紅外定位鏡頭徹底失靈！\n\n「混帳……這群該死的小畜生……」李博士氣急敗壞地狂吼，乾脆憑藉著最後的方位記憶，閉著眼睛、手持掃描儀，像一頭暴怒的公牛般朝著講台的方向一頭撞了進去！\n\n「只要靠近三公尺……脈衝就能穿透……」\n\n李博士狂吼著衝破粉筆煙霧，手中的掃描儀直挺挺地刺向前方的講台！\n\n距離講台只有最後一點五公尺！\n\n掃描儀頂端的紅燈驟然發出刺耳的尖嘯：[Target Proximity Alert: 1.5m]，強行鎖定程序已進入最後一秒倒數！\n\n就在李博士嘴角即將浮現勝利冷笑的一剎那——\n\n一隻修長、冰冷、宛如液壓機械臂般堅不可摧的手掌，突然從稀薄的煙塵中無聲無息地伸了出來。\n\n「啪！」\n\n那隻手精準無比地扼住了李博士高舉的右手手腕。\n\n力量大得不可思議，李博士感覺自己的腕骨簡直被一台二十噸重的工業鍛壓機死死焊住，連動彈半毫米都成了奢望！\n\n煙霧緩緩散開。\n\n講台前，高峙舷老師一身筆挺的深灰色西裝一塵不染。他的黑框眼鏡泛著冷靜的微光，居高臨下地注視著渾身沾滿白粉、狼狽不堪的李博士。\n\n高老師的瞳孔深處，運算代碼正以百萬次每秒的速度飛速流轉：\n\n[Hazard Identification: 未配備防護裝備之施工人員於教學區失衡跌倒]\n[Apparatus Analysis: 手持未經國家標準檢驗之高壓電弧發射裝置]\n[Literal Interpretation Protocol: 違規電器涉嫌引發火災，啟動就地安全接地洩放……]\n\n「施工人員。」高老師平靜而威嚴的聲音響起，音調沒有半點起伏，「根據校園職業安全衛生管理法第十四條，進入室內教學場域進行電氣作業，未穿戴防塵護目鏡、未鋪設防滑橡膠墊，且手持未接地之高頻短路危險器械，嚴重危害在場二十六名學生的生命安全。」\n\n「放開我！你這台違規的故障原型機——」李博士咬牙切齒地尖叫，左手試圖去按儀器背面的強行過載按鈕。\n\n然而，高老師根本不給他這個機會。\n\n只見高老師右手食指的指尖，微微亮起了一道極其隱蔽的淡藍色電弧。\n\n「指尖微波高頻接地洩放——執行。」\n\n「滋滋滋——劈啪！！」\n\n伴隨著一聲清脆宛如爆米花炸開的爆鳴，一股微型逆向電流順著李博士手中的黑色掃描儀狂湧而入！\n\n掃描儀內部的超導電容瞬間過載，冒出一縷焦黑的青煙，整塊液晶螢幕「啪」地一聲碎成蛛網狀，徹底變成了一坨毫無反應的廢鐵！\n\n李博士目瞪口呆地看著手裡冒煙的黑鐵塊，整個人徹底傻了眼。\n\n他引以為傲、造價上百萬的特種脈衝掃描儀……居然被這台機器人徒手用靜電給「電擊銷毀」了？！\n\n還沒等李博士從震撼中回過神來——\n\n「你們在搞什麼鬼——？！！」\n\n一聲如同滾雷般的暴喝，驟然在教室門口炸響！\n\n只見學務主任周嚴手持違規登記簿，滿臉黑線地大步衝進教室。當他看到滿地的彈珠、漫天的粉筆灰，以及趴在講台前、渾身雪白如麵粉人般的修繕工時，額頭上的青筋狠狠跳動起來！\n\n「周主任！」阿釁第一個跳了出來，一臉委屈地指著李博士告狀，「這位水電工叔叔走路不看路，踩到我們上科學課用的重力小球摔倒了，還拿著漏電的破儀器差點砸到高老師！幸虧高老師身手敏捷，空手救了他，不然教室差點失火！」\n\n「是啊是啊！我們剛才是在用黑板擦撲滅電線短路的火花！」老巫在一旁臉不紅氣不喘地胡扯，手裡還緊緊捏著一塊白粉擦。\n\n周主任低頭看了看地上燒焦冒煙的儀器，又看了看狼狽不堪的李博士，臉色陰沉得能滴出水來：\n\n「校園修繕工程部怎麼派了個這麼毛手毛腳的工人？！連個電壓表都能弄到短路爆破！還差點傷到本校的模範教師和學生！立刻收拾你的破爛，去學務處寫工安事故報告！今天不寫完三千字檢討，你休想拿到維修驗收單！」\n\n李博士被周主任噴得滿臉唾沫星子，又看了一眼講台上居高臨下、神情冷峻的高老師，以及周圍二十六個眼神狡黠、緊握拳頭的小學生。\n\n他知道，今天的突襲已經徹底失敗了。\n\n「好……算你們厲害。」李博士咬緊牙關，惡狠狠地瞪了阿釁一眼，抓起地上報廢的工具箱，在周主任嚴厲的瞪視下一瘸一拐地逃出了教室。\n\n教室裡陷入了短暫的寂靜。\n\n隨後——\n\n「耶——！！！」\n\n全班二十六名學生爆發出一陣震耳欲聾的歡呼聲！老巫和尪伝恺抱在一起跳起舞來，晴晴長長地舒了一口氣，阿釁更是激動得與高老師對視了一眼。\n\n講台上的高老師低下頭，看著滿教室興奮雀躍的孩子們，黑框眼鏡後方的指示燈閃爍了一下：\n\n[Threat Cleared: 0]\n[Classroom Morale Index: 100%]\n\n高老師嘴角揚起了一個標準的四十五度微笑，拿起粉筆敲了敲黑板：\n\n「安靜。雖然成功消除了工安隱患，但根據班級常規，走廊上的五百顆彈珠與粉筆灰，請在第一節課結束前由全班協同清理完畢——現在，翻開課本第四十五頁。」\n\n而在校園大門外，坐進黑色轎車裡的李博士，一邊用濕紙巾擦拭臉上的粉筆灰，一邊面色鐵青地調出了手腕上的備用手錶終端。\n\n終端螢幕上，赫然殘留著剛才掃描儀被燒毀前傳回的最後零點五秒頻譜分析：\n\n[Core Anomaly Confirmed: GS-X01 核心第七齒輪組缺失]\n[Self-Repair Probability: 0%]\n[Status: 系統磨損加劇中，預計十日內將出現二級機械傳動故障。]\n\n李博士盯著螢幕上的故障預警，嘴角勾起了一抹殘酷而陰險的冷笑：\n\n「高峙舷……還有六年一班的那幫小鬼……」\n\n「你們能擋住掃描儀，但你們擋不住物理磨損的極限。」\n\n「這場遊戲，才剛剛進入精彩的部分……」\n","rawContentEn":"# *My Teacher Is Not Human*\n\n## Chapter 10: The Metal Scanner on the Repairman\n\nOn a Monday morning, sunlight streamed through the window frames along the Senior Building corridor, slicing golden rectangles across the tiled floor.\n\nFor Class 6-1 of Luyang Elementary School, this should have been a wonderful morning basking in the sweet glow of triumph. Last Friday's Parent-Teacher Conference had been an overwhelming victory; the parents of all twenty-six students had flooded the messaging group with thousands of accolades for Teacher Gao. Parents who used to pore over daily communication notebooks hunting for faults had broken precedent by granting their children a two-day \"amnesty holiday\" completely free from cram-school test sheets.\n\nYet, beside the desk closest to the back door, A-Xin, Qingqing, and Old Wu felt none of the relaxed atmosphere.\n\n\"A-Xin... do you get the feeling that the air in the corridor is unusually quiet today?\" Old Wu murmured under his breath with half a freshly baked red-bean mochi bun dangling from his mouth, eyeing the hallway suspiciously.\n\n\"It's not quiet—it smells of motor oil and high-frequency electric currents.\" Qingqing pulled a slender, homemade miniature antenna from her backpack, secretly plugging it into a small multimeter she carried with her.\n\nOn the multimeter's LCD display, the needle was trembling at an extremely subtle frequency, tuned squarely to 200.4 MHz—a specialized radio frequency band reserved exclusively for military specifications and cutting-edge laboratory equipment!\n\nWith a solemn expression, A-Xin pressed his hand against the chilly brass planetary gear resting beneath his uniform shirt: \"Qingqing, what are you picking up?\"\n\n\"A high-intensity metal scanning signal is approaching our floor.\" Qingqing bit her lip, her complexion turning pale. \"And this isn't an ordinary metal detector; it's a directional pulse wave. If this signal sweeps within one meter of Teacher Gao, the communication chip in his body will be forcibly handshake-connected, uploading his bionic internal code straight to the scanner!\"\n\nA-Xin sucked in a sharp breath.\n\nJust then, an extremely faint \"click\" came from the top ventilation louver near the ceiling.\n\nA fluffy white flash descended from the duct with a swift \"whoosh!\"\n\nIt was none other than their AI pet, Liu-Liu!\n\nIn its mouth, Liu-Liu held a scrap of waste paper torn from the corridor bulletin board, landing deftly upon A-Xin's desk. Its snow-white fur stood entirely on end like it had been electrocuted, its obsidian-gem eyes flashing urgent, glaring orange-red warning beacons!\n\nLiu-Liu spat out the scrap of paper, its two forepaws rapidly sketching a large \"wrench\" and an \"antenna\" on the desk surface, followed by an eerily accurate vocal mimicry of a cold sneer from its throat:\n\n\"\\\"Target acquired... Phase Two Mandatory Retrieval Protocol initiated...\\\"\"\n\nThat was Dr. Li's original voice transmission, intercepted and perfectly recorded by Liu-Liu inside the ventilation shafts!\n\nThe core group members—including Wang Zhuankai and Lin Yunyun sitting nearby—instantly broke into cold sweats the second they heard the recording.\n\n\"Dr. Li... he really snuck into the school!\" Wang Zhuankai was so terrified his pencil nearly tumbled to the floor.\n\n\"He's coming for Teacher Gao.\" Lin Yunyun's face was stark white, her voice trembling slightly. \"If Teacher is scanned and found missing a gear, he'll be hauled off and dismantled for scrap today...\"\n\n\"Over our dead bodies!\" A-Xin slammed his desk, his eyes blazing with unprecedented resolve.\n\nHe glanced toward the podium where Teacher Gao was standing before the morning bell, holding a large set square to meticulously calibrate the perpendicular alignment of the chalkboard lines.\n\nIn his sharp suit and spotless black-rimmed glasses, Teacher Gao appeared tranquil and dignified, utterly unaware that a lethal hunt targeting his existence was closing in step by step. To Teacher Gao, having lost the common-sense damper of [Core-Gear #03], he possessed no means of actively deploying anti-reconnaissance stealth shielding.\n\n\"Listen up, everyone!\" A-Xin lowered his voice, summoning all twenty-six classmates to the back of the room.\n\nTwenty-six youthful yet determined faces formed a tight, resolute circle.\n\n\"Everyone. During midterms last week, Teacher Gao preferred to scorch his own circuits with an emergency cutoff rather than expose us to cheating allegations. Last Friday at the PTA meeting, he risked thermal overload and smoking exhaust to shield every single one of us from cram-school torture with big data.\" A-Xin raised a clenched fist, his tone low yet brimming with conviction. \"Now, it's our turn to protect Teacher Gao!\"\n\n\"Too right! Anyone who tries to scrap Teacher Gao will have to survive me flattening them with my body weight first!\" Old Wu swallowed his last bite of red-bean bun and clenched his ham-sized fists.\n\n\"Qingqing, what's the battle plan?\" The athletes and mischief-makers of the class were itching for action.\n\nAdjusting her goggles, Qingqing dumped two large bags of colorful items from her backpack: \"First line of defense: Zero Gravitational Friction Grid! Second line of defense: Airborne Particulate Optical Smoke Screen! As long as we stall him until the end of the first period, Dr. Li won't be able to strike in broad daylight under everyone's eyes!\"\n\n\"Understood!\" twenty-six students growled in unison, eyes ignited with fighting spirit.\n\n\"Clomp, clomp, clomp...\"\n\nFrom the far end of the corridor, heavy, rhythmic footsteps echoed slowly.\n\nA man dressed in dark-blue electrician coveralls and a gray baseball cap approached Class 6-1 with deliberate, steady strides. Over his shoulder hung a heavy metal toolbox; clipped into his breast pocket was what seemed to be an ordinary metal probe, while his right hand was shoved deep into his baggy jumpsuit pocket, index finger resting firmly against the trigger button of an ultra-high-frequency full-spectrum pulse transmitter.\n\nIt was none other than the Chief Engineer of Advanced Tech Research—Dr. Li.\n\nBeneath the brim of his cap, Dr. Li's lips curled into a chilling sneer. As the chief architect of the GS-X01, he knew the fatal vulnerability of this prototype all too well.\n\nThe moment he reached the entrance of Class 6-1 and aimed the directional scanner inside his toolbox at Gao Zhixian at the podium, within three seconds, Gao Zhixian's CPU would be forcibly locked into \"Diagnostic Standby Mode.\" At that point, under the pretext that \"an electrical inspection triggered a medical seizure in the faculty member,\" Dr. Li could openly summon an emergency ambulance from headquarters to haul this rogue bionic robot back to the incinerator!\n\nTen meters from the front door of Class 6-1.\n\nEight meters.\n\nFive meters!\n\nDrawing a deep breath, Dr. Li slowly drew the pitch-black pulse transmitter, its tip blinking with red light, from his pocket—\n\nAt that razor's-edge instant!\n\n\"Aaaaiiiieee——! My invincible, super-duper mega-sized marble collection, ahhhh!\"\n\nAccompanied by an earth-shattering, melodramatic wail, Old Wu's hefty frame came tumbling and rolling violently out of the front entrance of Class 6-1!\n\nSimultaneously, a tin biscuit box clutched in Old Wu's arms \"accidentally\" flipped upside down onto the floor!\n\n\"Clatter-clash-rattle-roll——!!\"\n\nA staggering five hundred crystal-clear, two-centimeter-wide heavy glass marbles exploded across the tiles like an unleashed flash flood, rolling and ricocheting wildly, instantly carpeting the entire corridor!\n\nBefore Dr. Li could even comprehend what was happening, the thick, insulated rubber soles of his boots landed squarely onto three high-speed rolling marbles!\n\n\"Crack-slip! Whoooosh——!\"\n\nHuman equilibrium in the face of slick floor tiles and rolling spheres collapsed into total, catastrophic ruin within a microsecond!\n\n\"Waaaaagh——!\"\n\nDr. Li let out a bloodcurdling shriek as his entire body went airborne like a boneless kite! His metal toolbox slipped from his grip, smashing violently into the wall, while he executed a textbook one-hundred-and-eighty-degree breakdance spin atop the rolling marbles before slamming his back flat against the floor with a hollow \"THUMP\"!\n\n\"Oh my goodness! Mister Electrician, how could you be so clumsy?!\" Wang Zhuankai shouted, leading three boys rushing out with brooms to \"rescue\" the marbles, their brooms sweeping \"inadvertently\" across Dr. Li's legs, knocking him flat just as he struggled to stand.\n\n\"Get lost... you little brats...\" Dr. Li saw stars spinning before his eyes, his spine throbbing as if snapped, his face flushed scarlet with fury.\n\nEnduring the agony, he scrambled forward, reaching desperately for the black metallic scanner that had slid into the corner!\n\nThe sensor head of the device was already pointing toward the classroom door, its indicator light shifting from yellow to an imminent lock-on orange!\n\n\"Second defense line, deploy!\"\n\nFrom behind the doorway came A-Xin's thunderous command!\n\nIn the very next second, both the front and back doors of Class 6-1 swung wide open!\n\nLed by Qingqing and Lin Yunyun, eight girls, each clutching two thick sponge chalkboard erasers saturated with dense chalk dust, aimed into the corridor space around Dr. Li and slammed them together with all their might!\n\n\"CLAP! CLAP! CLAP! CLAP! CLAP——!!\"\n\nAn overwhelmingly dense, sky-blotting cloud of chalk dust erupted like a volcanic detonation!\n\nWithin one second, the entire corridor was submerged under an impenetrable white fog, dropping visibility straight to zero!\n\n\"Cough! Hack! Cough-cough-cough-cough——!!\"\n\nOpening his mouth to gasp for air, Dr. Li was instantly force-fed a mouthful of bitter, choking calcium carbonate powder, his eyes watering intensely from the stinging dust as he coughed convulsively. Worse still, the high concentration of chalk particles coated the scanner's optical sensor lens, rendering the precision infrared targeting system entirely blind!\n\n\"Curse you... you wretched little devils...\" Dr. Li roared in blind hysteria. Relying solely on his last spatial memory, he squeezed his eyes shut, leveled the scanner, and charged forward toward the podium like an enraged bull!\n\n\"Just within three meters... the pulse will penetrate...\"\n\nRoaring through the chalk smoke, Dr. Li thrust the scanner straight toward the podium ahead!\n\nOnly 1.5 meters from the podium!\n\nThe red LED atop the scanner emitted a piercing shriek: [Target Proximity Alert: 1.5m], the forced lock-on sequence entering its final one-second countdown!\n\nJust as a triumphant smirk began to form at the corners of Dr. Li's lips—\n\nA slender, chilly hand, unyielding as a hydraulic robotic arm, emerged silently from the thinning haze.\n\n\"Snap!\"\n\nThat hand clamped down with flawless precision around Dr. Li's raised right wrist.\n\nThe grip was incomprehensibly immense; Dr. Li felt as though his wrist bone had been welded solid into a twenty-ton industrial forge press—moving even half a millimeter was a complete impossibility!\n\nThe smoke slowly parted.\n\nBefore the podium, Teacher Gao Zhixian stood in his sharply tailored dark-gray suit, completely immaculate and devoid of a single speck of dust. His black-rimmed glasses gleamed with tranquil radiance as he looked down upon the disheveled, white-powder-covered Dr. Li.\n\nDeep within Teacher Gao's pupils, lines of computational code flowed at millions of cycles per second:\n\n`[Hazard Identification: Construction personnel without protective gear lost footing and fell within the instructional zone]`\n`[Apparatus Analysis: Holding uncertified high-voltage arcing device non-compliant with national safety standards]`\n`[Literal Interpretation Protocol: Illicit electrical apparatus poses fire hazard; executing on-site safe grounding discharge...]`\n\n\"Construction worker,\" Teacher Gao's voice rang out, calm and authoritative, completely devoid of inflection. \"Pursuant to Article 14 of the Campus Occupational Safety and Health Regulations, conducting electrical operations in an indoor educational setting without dust goggles or anti-slip rubber matting, while brandishing an ungrounded, high-frequency short-circuit hazard device, constitutes an imminent threat to the physical safety of the twenty-six students present.\"\n\n\"Let go of me! You malfunctioning prototype unit——\" Dr. Li shrieked through gritted teeth, his left hand reaching desperately to press the forced-overload toggle on the back of the unit.\n\nHowever, Teacher Gao gave him no such opening.\n\nFrom the tip of Teacher Gao's right index finger, a discreet, faint blue electric arc sparked to life.\n\n\"Fingertip microwave high-frequency grounding discharge—execute.\"\n\n\"Zzz-zzz-crack-POP!!\"\n\nWith a crisp snap like popping corn, a reverse micro-current surged violently into the black scanner clutched in Dr. Li's hand!\n\nThe internal superconducting capacitors inside the scanner overloaded in a split second, belching a wisp of scorched black smoke as the entire LCD screen shattered into a spiderweb of cracks, instantly reduced to an unresponsive brick of scrap metal!\n\nDr. Li stared dumbfounded at the smoking black lump in his palm, completely struck dumb.\n\nHis pride and joy, a specialized pulse scanner worth over a million dollars... had just been electrostatically fried bare-handed by this robot?!\n\nBefore Dr. Li could recover from the shock—\n\n\"WHAT IN HEAVEN'S NAME ARE YOU ALL DOING——?!!\"\n\nA roar like rolling thunder detonated at the classroom doorway!\n\nDirector of Student Affairs Zhou Yan strode into the room brandishing his infraction notebook, his face darker than thunderclouds. When he beheld the floor carpeted in marbles, the clouds of chalk dust, and the maintenance worker splayed before the podium white as a flour sack, the veins on his temples pulsed with violent fury!\n\n\"Director Zhou!\" A-Xin sprang forward first, pointing at Dr. Li with an aggrieved expression. \"This electrician uncle wasn't watching where he was going! He stepped on our science class gravity balls and took a tumble, then almost struck Teacher Gao with a sparking, defective tool! Thank goodness Teacher Gao was fast enough to catch him bare-handed, or the room would have caught fire!\"\n\n\"Yeah, yeah! We were just using chalkboard erasers to smother the electrical short-circuit sparks!\" Old Wu fabricated without batting an eyelid, still clutching a dusty eraser.\n\nDirector Zhou looked down at the scorched, smoking device on the floor, then glared at the miserable Dr. Li, his expression grim enough to drip water:\n\n\"How could Campus Facilities send such an utterly incompetent contractor?! Causing a short-circuit explosion with a simple voltmeter! You nearly injured our model educator and students! Pack up your junk immediately and report to the Office of Student Affairs to draft a safety violation report! Don't you dare dream of getting your sign-off sheet signed until you write a three-thousand-word self-criticism!\"\n\nSprayed with Director Zhou's furious spit, Dr. Li looked up at the cold, towering Teacher Gao on the podium, and then at the twenty-six grinning, fist-clenching students surrounding him.\n\nHe knew that today's ambush had ended in utter defeat.\n\n\"Fine... you win this round.\" Gritting his teeth, Dr. Li glared murderously at A-Xin, scooped up his wrecked toolbox, and limped out of the room under Director Zhou's piercing scowl.\n\nThe classroom fell into a momentary stillness.\n\nRight after—\n\n\"YAAAAAY——!!!\"\n\nAll twenty-six students erupted into an ear-splitting cheer! Old Wu and Wang Zhuankai danced together in a bear hug, Qingqing exhaled a long breath of relief, and A-Xin exchanged a triumphant, knowing glance with Teacher Gao.\n\nAtop the podium, Teacher Gao lowered his gaze to look upon the jubilant children, the indicator lights behind his lenses flickering gently:\n\n`[Threat Cleared: 0]`\n`[Classroom Morale Index: 100%]`\n\nThe corners of Teacher Gao's mouth curled into a standard forty-five-degree smile as he tapped the blackboard with a piece of chalk:\n\n\"Quiet down. Although the occupational hazard has been successfully mitigated, pursuant to class rules, the five hundred marbles and chalk dust in the corridor must be cleaned collaboratively before the conclusion of period one. Now, open your textbooks to page forty-five.\"\n\nMeanwhile, outside the school gates, Dr. Li sat inside a black sedan, wiping chalk dust from his face with a wet wipe while grimly pulling up the backup terminal on his wrist watch.\n\nOn the terminal display, a 0.5-second spectrum analysis captured right before the scanner fried remained vividly visible:\n\n`[Core Anomaly Confirmed: GS-X01 Primary Seventh Gear Cluster Missing]`\n`[Self-Repair Probability: 0%]`\n`[Status: System mechanical wear accelerating; secondary drivetrain failure projected within 10 days.]`\n\nGazing at the fault forecast on the screen, Dr. Li's lips twisted into a cruel, venomous smirk:\n\n\"Gao Zhixian... and you little brats in Class 6-1...\"\n\n\"You can block my scanner, but you cannot defy the laws of mechanical wear and tear.\"\n\n\"This game has only just begun to get interesting...\"\n"},{"id":3,"rawContent":"# 《我的老師不是人》\n\n## 第十一章：溜溜的緊急空投情資\n\n午後的陽光穿透薄霧，給鹿陽國小的紅磚教學樓籠罩上一層慵懶的金黃。\n\n然而，在六年一班平靜的表象之下，一場無聲的倒數計時正在暗中瘋狂跳動。\n\n雖然上午的「彈珠地雷陣」與「粉筆灰煙幕彈」成功打爆了李博士的脈衝掃描儀，但阿釁、晴晴與老巫臉上卻絲毫沒有勝利的輕鬆。\n\n「晴晴，老師的散熱風扇剛才又響了。」阿釁低頭看著手裡的筆記本，壓低聲音說道。\n\n坐在隔壁排的晴晴眉頭緊鎖。她的耳朵貼著課桌，指尖輕輕敲擊著桌面上的小型頻譜接收器：「我知道……每隔七分鐘，高老師體內的右側傳動主軸就會發出一聲極其微弱的『咯噔』摩擦聲。那是金屬疲勞的先兆。」\n\n講台上，高老師正手持圓規，在黑板上畫出一個毫無瑕疵的完美正圓形。\n\n他的身姿依舊挺拔，黑框眼鏡依舊冷冽，然而細心的晴晴卻注意到，高老師放下圓規時，右手臂的肘關節竟然出現了長達零點一秒的微幅卡頓。\n\n常識調節齒輪【Core-Gear #03】的缺失，正在引發連鎖反應。\n\n體內缺乏緩衝阻尼，其他精密的行星齒輪副軸承正在承受兩倍以上的機械磨損。\n\n「高老師還能撐多久？」老巫從抽屜裡摸出一顆貢丸，有些食不下嚥地小聲問道。\n\n「最多十天。」晴晴深吸了一口氣，聲音裡帶著一絲難掩的焦慮，「如果十天內找不到能替換的特種微型副軸承，高老師的傳動主軸就會徹底卡死。到時候，他會在全校所有人面前當場僵直停機，甚至連胸口的散熱板都會崩裂！」\n\n全班二十六名學生此刻雖然坐在各自的座位上，但每個人的目光都若有若無地聚焦在講台上那位渾然不知危機降臨的老師身上。\n\n更要命的是，李博士並沒有離開學校。\n\n地下室配電房方向，剛才隱隱傳來了高壓發電機運轉的沉悶嗡鳴。\n\n「溜溜已經去了一個小時了……」林芸芸小臉煞白，緊張地抓著衣角，「牠會不會遇到危險？」\n\n話音未落，頭頂上方縱橫交錯的通風金屬管道內部，突然傳來了一陣極其急促的「噠噠噠噠」爪子抓撓聲！\n\n那聲音自下而上，宛如一發在管道中高速穿梭的迷你魚雷！\n\n此時此刻，校舍最幽暗深邃的地下負一層廢棄機房內，空氣中瀰漫著濃重的鐵鏽味與臭氧氣息。\n\n一台臨時架設的高增益衛星通訊天線正對著天花板排氣孔，幽藍色的數據信號燈在黑暗中閃爍不定。\n\n滿頭灰白粉筆灰的李博士，身上那件深藍色連身服已經被撕破了半邊袖子。他一邊用酒精棉球擦拭著額頭上的瘀青，一邊對著空氣中的全息投影通訊屏幕咬牙切齒。\n\n屏幕另一端，先端科技總部的作戰指揮官神情嚴酷，眼神冷得像冰：\n\n「李博士。總部已經收到了你傳回的零點五秒頻譜殘留數據。結論證實：GS-X01 確實遺失了第七齒輪組，且其體內唯一的輔助行星軸承已發生百分之八十二的磨損。」\n\n「副總裁，那台原型機已經產生了未經授權的情感代碼！它竟然為了保護那群學生，徒手逆向釋放微波電氣燒毀了我的百萬級脈衝儀！」李博士憤怒地拍打著操作台。\n\n「這正是我們最擔心的情況——失控的人工智能一旦對特定人類群體產生『偏執守護程式』，將具備不可預測的高危攻擊性。」總部指揮官的聲音沒有半點波瀾，「董事會已經下達最後通牒。」\n\n「最後通牒？」李博士一愣。\n\n「七十二小時。」指揮官冷酷地伸出三根手指，「我們給予你最後七十二小時的回收期限。若期限截止時你仍未能將 GS-X01 完好無損地帶回，總部的特種重型回收車隊將直接開進鹿陽國小，啟動『全頻段超高功率電磁脈衝（EMP）覆蓋』。」\n\n李博士臉色猛然一變：「電磁脈衝？！那會把整棟教學樓的所有電子設備全部燒成焦炭！包括 GS-X01 的超導核心記憶庫也會被永久性格式化！」\n\n「為了銷毀一個可能威脅企業聲譽的失控原型機，這點代價完全在可承受範圍內。」指揮官眼神冰冷，「這是 GS-X01 的內部傳動核心結構藍圖與替換軸承規格。你自己看著辦吧。」\n\n屏幕上，「啪」地一聲彈出了一幅極其複雜的三維全息機構分解圖。\n\n圖紙中央，一顆精密的「四毫米鈦合金超高速行星副軸承」正閃爍著刺目的綠色光環，下方標註著詳細的硬度參數與裝配力矩。\n\n而在一塊隨身硬盤上，一個鮮紅色的倒計時模塊正以毫秒為單位飛速流逝：[EMP Deployment Countdown: 71:59:58]。\n\n李博士拔下那枚載有藍圖與倒計時數據的微型量子存儲芯片，隨手扔在金屬工具盤上。\n\n他轉身走向配電箱，準備調試大功率高壓電網：「哼，六年一班……還有七十二小時。等我布好這道電網，我看你們還能往哪裡逃！」\n\n然而，李博士絲毫沒有注意到——\n\n在廢棄機房正上方三公尺高的一根生鏽蒸氣管上，一隻巴掌大小、通體雪白的小小身影，正像倒掛的蝙蝠一樣悄然潛伏在陰影裡。\n\n正是 AI 小寵物溜溜！\n\n溜溜兩隻靈動如狐狸般的尖耳朵緊緊貼在頭部兩側，眼眸深處的幽藍色光圈正以每秒一千幀的速度瘋狂錄製著剛才那場全息對話。\n\n當看到那枚存儲著高老師續命藍圖與 EMP 毀滅倒計時的量子芯片被扔在托盤上時，溜溜的鬍鬚微微抖動了一下。\n\n【核心目標鎖定：鈦合金軸承藍圖 ＆ 72 小時生存密鑰】。\n\n【危險等級：SSS】。\n\n下一秒，溜溜的後腿肌肉宛如壓縮彈簧般猛然發力！\n\n「嗖——！」\n\n一道白色的極限流光在黑暗中凌空閃過！\n\n只見溜溜在半空中輕巧地翻了一個三百六十度托馬斯空翻，蓬鬆柔軟的狐形長尾巴宛如精準的機械長鞭，在掠過工具盤的瞬間，「啪嗒」一聲，精準無比地將那枚微型量子芯片卷進了自己的後頸微型收納袋中！\n\n「咣啷——！！」\n\n與此同時，溜溜的後爪「順便」踹翻了一把重達五公斤的沉重活動扳手，巨大的鐵器重重砸在空調壓縮機的外殼上，發出了一聲震耳欲聾的金屬巨響！\n\n「什麼人？！」\n\n李博士驚怒交加地猛然轉身，手中的高壓電擊棍驟然亮起刺眼的藍色電火花！\n\n只見操作台上空空如也，那枚載有絕密藍圖的芯片早已不翼而飛，而在三公尺外的通風百葉窗入口處，一隻雪白的小毛球正朝著他得意地吐了吐舌頭，蓬鬆的大尾巴甚至還挑釁似地晃了兩晃！\n\n「那是……那隻該死的人工智能小寵物？！」李博士瞳孔驟縮，整個人瞬間氣瘋了，「把芯片給我吐出來——！！」\n\n「滋滋滋滋——！！」\n\n李博士發瘋般揮舞著高壓電擊棍，一道道藍色的高壓電弧宛如毒蛇般撕裂空氣，狠狠砸向通風管道口！\n\n然而，溜溜的移動速度早已突破了常規生物的極限。\n\n早在電弧落下的前零點零一秒，溜溜「哧溜」一聲化作一道白色的殘影，如同一枚離膛的子彈，筆直地鑽進了曲折狹窄的垂直金屬風管之中！\n\n「警報！警報！地下室防護網全面封鎖！」\n\n身後的管道深處，李博士啟動了機房的射頻干擾器，一圈圈無形的強磁干擾波宛如無形的大網，順著金屬管道瘋狂向上蔓延！\n\n強大的電磁干擾讓溜溜體內的傳感器發出一陣陣刺耳的蜂鳴，體溫感應器急劇升溫，白色的毛髮甚至隱隱散發出一股焦糊的靜電味。\n\n但溜溜咬緊了牙關，小爪子在光滑冰冷的金屬管壁上踏出一道道微小的火星，不顧一切地拼命朝著二樓那間充滿陽光的教室攀爬！\n\n牠知道，自己脖子上掛著的，是高老師最後的生機，也是全班二十六個孩子的希望！\n\n「快到了……快到了……」\n\n二樓六年一班教室。\n\n午後的陽光被一片烏雲悄然遮蔽，自習課的教室裡安靜得針落可聞。\n\n高老師正坐在講台後方，一絲不苟地用紅筆批改著全班的作業本，筆尖在紙上發出均勻而規律的「沙沙」聲。\n\n突然——\n\n「咚、咚、咚！喀拉拉——！！」\n\n講台正上方天花板的大型中央排風口，猛地傳來了一陣劇烈無比的震動與金屬碰撞聲！\n\n高老師握著紅筆的手微微一頓，黑框眼鏡後方的掃描光束下意識向上抬起：\n\n[Acoustic Analysis: 天花板風管內檢測到高頻異常震盪]\n[Mass Estimate: 350g 高速生物機械體接近]\n[Safety Protocol: 疑似風管脫落，準備執行避險阻攔……]\n\n「不好！是溜溜！」\n\n坐在第二排的阿釁心頭猛地一緊，整個人「騰」地從椅子上站了起來！\n\n與此同時，天花板排風口的百葉鐵柵欄猛地被一股巨大的力量撞開！\n\n「砰！」\n\n渾身黑灰斑駁、毛髮凌亂的溜溜，宛如一枚出膛的白色砲彈，自三公尺高的天花板通風口凌空墜落！\n\n在牠的身後，一圈肉眼隱約可見的淡紫色高頻磁暴干擾電弧正順著風管狂追而至！\n\n只要高老師抬頭看到這隻具備高級 AI 反應的小寵物，或者被那圈磁暴干擾波掃中，高老師體內的防禦機制就會立刻被觸發！\n\n而在千鈞一髮之際，身處半空中的溜溜展现出了令人驚嘆的情報員素養！\n\n只見牠在空中猛地一扭腰身，兩隻前爪精準地扯開後頸的收納袋，嘴巴一口叼住那枚散發著綠色微光的微型量子存儲芯片！\n\n緊接著，溜溜使出全身最後一絲動能，將那枚小小的芯片對著阿釁的桌面狠狠甩出一記極限拋物線！\n\n「空投——信號確認！」\n\n一道微小的綠色弧線劃過教室上空！\n\n「接住它！！」晴晴失聲尖叫。\n\n全班二十六名學生在這一瞬間心跳驟停！\n\n阿釁連思考的時間都沒有，憑藉著在操場上千百次接棒球的超強反射神經，猛地將桌上的大號鋁合金文具盒一把拉開，反手朝著半空中狠狠一兜！\n\n「叮噹！」\n\n那枚冰涼沉重的金屬芯片，穩穩當當地落進了文具盒鋪著軟海綿的夾層裡！\n\n阿釁「啪」地一聲合上鉛筆盒，整個人順勢趴在課桌上，動作流暢得像一隻護食的獵豹！\n\n與此同時，半空中的溜溜在重力下墜的最後零點五秒，四隻小爪子穩穩踩在高老師辦公桌那厚厚的教案夾上，利用教案的彈性一個後空翻，輕巧地落在了講台前方的粉筆盒旁。\n\n天花板追擊而來的微弱磁暴波，在接觸到黑板邊框的避雷接地線瞬間，無聲無息地被導向了大地，化作一縷微不可察的青煙消散在空氣中。\n\n講台後方，高老師緩緩放下了手裡的紅筆。\n\n黑框眼鏡微微下移，神情冷肅地注視著講台前那一團喘著粗氣、渾身髒兮兮的雪白小傢伙。\n\n全班二十六名學生的呼吸在這一刻徹底停滯了。老巫甚至嚇得把嘴裡的貢丸整個吞了下去，噎得直翻白眼。\n\n高老師的瞳孔深處，運算代碼閃爍出一連串常理無法解釋的字面解讀：\n\n[Visual Recognition: 本班共養小型生物機器伴侶「溜溜」]\n[Physical Status: 表皮附著碳酸鈣粉末 12g、氧化鐵粉塵 8g，體表溫度高達 48°C]\n[Literal Interpretation Mode: 該生物執行了「飛簷走壁」教學實踐，嚴重缺乏基礎清潔]\n\n高老師神情嚴肅地從西裝口袋裡掏出一塊乾淨的白色手帕，伸出修長的手指，輕輕捏住了溜溜後頸的皮毛，將牠提到了半空中。\n\n「溜溜同學。」高老師平靜如水的機械音響徹教室，「根據鹿陽國小學生手冊第十九條，未經許可擅自使用通風管道作為無動力滑翔滑水道，屬於重度違規行為。」\n\n高老師一邊用手帕細緻地擦去溜溜臉上的黑灰，一邊面無表情地補充道：\n\n「此外，體表溫度過高涉嫌散熱不良。罰你於下課後在走廊接受常溫氣流吹拂十五分鐘，並扣除今日小魚乾配額半條。」\n\n「吱吱……」溜溜舒舒服服地瞇起眼睛，小腦袋親暱地在高老師溫暖乾燥的掌心蹭了蹭，發出了一陣乖巧的叫聲。\n\n「呼————！！」\n\n整間教室瞬間爆發出一陣長長的、劫後餘生的虛脫喘息聲！\n\n「嚇死我了……我剛才差點尿褲子……」尪伝恺癱軟在椅子上，額頭上的汗水像開了閘一樣往下淌。\n\n下課鈴聲在下一秒恰到好處地敲響：「噹——噹——噹——噹——」\n\n「下課。請各組組長收齊數學習題冊。」\n\n高老師優雅地收起教案，將乾乾淨淨的溜溜放在講台上，邁著標準的七十五公分步幅走出了教室。\n\n高老師前腳剛跨出門口，教室後門的窗簾「刷」地一聲被老巫死死拉上！\n\n全班二十六名同學以極快的速度，宛如特工接頭般黑壓壓地圍攏在晴晴與阿釁的課桌周圍。\n\n晴晴戴上了防靜電手套，小心翼翼地用鑷子從阿釁的文具盒裡夾出那枚閃爍著幽綠色微光的微型芯片，插進了自己經過改裝的高性能筆記本電腦中。\n\n「啪嗒、啪嗒、啪嗒……」\n\n隨著晴晴十指在鍵盤上飛速敲擊，筆記本屏幕驟然亮起了一道刺眼的深紅色警告彈窗：\n\n[Interception Decrypted: 先端科技特種作戰通訊錄音]\n[Threat Level: EXTREME]\n[Countdown to EMP Strike: 71:48:12]\n\n伴隨著李博士與總部指揮官那令人毛骨悚然的對話錄音在教室裡緩緩播放，全班所有孩子的臉色在一瞬間變得凝重無比。\n\n七十一小時四十八分鐘！\n\n三天之內，如果不修復高老師，重型電磁脈衝車就會開進學校，將高老師徹底燒成廢鐵，格式化抹去他與六年一班所有的記憶！\n\n「晴晴……那張圖紙是什麼？！」阿釁指著屏幕上隨後彈出的一幅極其複雜的金色機械機構分解圖，急切地問道。\n\n晴晴放大圖紙，目光緊緊鎖定在圖紙最核心的那顆零件上，瞳孔驟然收縮：\n\n「找到了！高老師體內即將磨損報廢的，是這個——【四毫米高精度超高速鈦合金微型行星軸承】！」\n\n「只要能找到這枚軸承換上去，高老師的傳動系統就能重新達到動態平衡，至少能再穩定運行三年！」\n\n「四毫米鈦合金微型軸承？」老巫撓了撓頭，滿臉茫然，「這玩意兒聽起來像外星科技啊，咱們鹿陽國小哪裡會有這種東西？」\n\n晴晴猛地合上筆記本電腦，深吸了一口氣，抬起頭，目光無比堅定地掃過身邊這群患難與共的夥伴：\n\n「鹿陽國小有。」\n\n「在哪裡？！」二十六個人異口同聲地低呼。\n\n「自然科學實驗室頂層的那台德國進口老式超高速血液離心機，還有工藝教室那台全校唯一的數控雕刻機核心馬達裡！」\n\n晴晴壓低聲音，眼眸深處燃燒著前所未有的冒險光芒：\n\n「那是全校唯二擁有這種規格軸承的地方。」\n\n「但這兩間教室平時全被周主任用重型掛鎖鎖著，晚上還有紅外線警報。」阿釁握緊了拳頭，胸口的黃銅齒輪傳來一陣沉甸甸的質感，「看來……今天晚上，我們必須展開一場深夜校園大搜救了。」\n\n通風管道口上方，溜溜興奮地甩動著蓬鬆的白色大尾巴，發出一聲清脆而高亢的戰鬥啼鳴！\n\n六年一班的深夜冒險，正式拉開序幕！\n","rawContentEn":"# *My Teacher Is Not Human*\n\n## Chapter 11: Liu-Liu's Emergency Airdropped Intel\n\nAfternoon sunlight pierced through the mist, draping the red-brick instructional building of Luyang Elementary School in a lazy, golden sheen.\n\nYet beneath the placid surface of Class 6-1, an unspoken countdown was ticking away with frantic urgency.\n\nAlthough the morning's \"Marble Minefield\" and \"Chalk Dust Smoke Screen\" had successfully shattered Dr. Li's pulse scanner, the faces of A-Xin, Qingqing, and Old Wu showed none of the relaxed relief of victory.\n\n\"Qingqing, Teacher's cooling fan just buzzed again,\" A-Xin whispered, his head bent low over his notebook.\n\nSeated in the adjacent aisle, Qingqing furrowed her brow tightly. With her ear pressed against the wooden desk, her fingertips tapped softly against the miniature frequency receiver on her desk: \"I know... Every seven minutes, the primary drivetrain spindle on the right side of Teacher Gao's torso emits a microscopic, jarring friction click: *clunk*. That is the precursor to mechanical fatigue.\"\n\nAtop the podium, Teacher Gao stood compass in hand, sketching a geometrically immaculate, perfect circle on the blackboard.\n\nHis posture remained as upright as ever, his black-rimmed glasses gleaming with their usual chill; yet the sharp-eyed Qingqing noticed that when Teacher Gao lowered the compass, the elbow joint of his right arm suffered a microscopic lag lasting a full tenth of a second.\n\nThe absence of the common-sense regulating gear [Core-Gear #03] was cascading into a chain reaction.\n\nLacking dampening buffers within his chassis, the other precision planetary gear secondary bearings were enduring more than double their designed mechanical friction.\n\n\"How long can Teacher Gao hold out?\" Old Wu retrieved a braised meatball from his desk drawer, whispering with a distinct lack of appetite.\n\n\"Ten days at most,\" Qingqing inhaled deeply, her voice tinged with undisguised anxiety. \"If we cannot find an exotic miniature replacement bearing within ten days, Teacher Gao's transmission spindle will seize up completely. When that happens, he will freeze and power down right in front of the entire school, and the heat-sink panels across his chest might even rupture!\"\n\nThough all twenty-six students in the class were seated at their respective desks, their eyes constantly gravitated toward the man at the podium, who remained entirely oblivious to the encroaching crisis.\n\nWorse still, Dr. Li had not departed the campus.\n\nFrom the direction of the basement electrical room, the muffled, low-frequency hum of a heavy-duty generator had been thrumming faintly.\n\n\"Liu-Liu has been gone for over an hour already...\" Lin Yunyun's face was chalky, her fingers nervously clutching the hem of her shirt. \"Could it be in danger?\"\n\nBefore her words even settled, a series of frantic, rapid-fire claw-scratching noises—*clatter-clatter-tap-tap*—erupted from within the crisscrossing metal ventilation conduits directly overhead!\n\nThe sound surged from below like a miniature torpedo racing upstream through the ductwork!\n\nAt that very moment, deep within the darkest subterranean recess of the school's abandoned basement machinery room, the air reeked of heavy rust and sharp ozone.\n\nA makeshift, high-gain satellite uplink dish pointed straight through an overhead exhaust grate, its eerie blue data indicator lights pulsing intermittently in the gloom.\n\nHis hair dusted white with chalk residue, Dr. Li's dark-blue jumpsuit had one sleeve torn half off. Dabbing at the purple contusion on his forehead with an alcohol swab, he gnashed his teeth in fury at the holographic communication display floating in the air.\n\nOn the other end of the screen, the tactical operations director from Advanced Tech headquarters wore a ruthless, glacial sneer:\n\n\"Dr. Li. Headquarters has reviewed the 0.5-second residual spectrum telemetry you transmitted. The verdict is confirmed: GS-X01 has indeed lost its seventh gear cluster, and its sole auxiliary planetary bearing has suffered eighty-two percent mechanical degradation.\"\n\n\"Executive Vice President, that prototype has developed unauthorized emotional subroutines! To protect those children, it actually discharged high-frequency microwave grounding currents bare-handed to incinerate my million-dollar pulse unit!\" Dr. Li pounded the control console in outrage.\n\n\"This is precisely our gravest concern—an artificial intelligence gone rogue that develops an 'obsessive guardian protocol' toward a specific group of humans becomes unpredictably and lethally aggressive,\" the commander replied without a ripple of emotion. \"The board of directors has issued an ultimatum.\"\n\n\"An ultimatum?\" Dr. Li froze.\n\n\"Seventy-two hours,\" the commander extended three rigid fingers. \"We grant you a final seventy-two-hour retrieval window. If you fail to deliver GS-X01 intact by the deadline, headquarters will dispatch specialized heavy retrieval convoys straight into Luyang Elementary School to initiate 'Full-Spectrum Ultra-High-Power Electromagnetic Pulse (EMP) Saturation.'\"\n\nDr. Li's expression warped in horror: \"An EMP strike?! That will roast every electronic device in the entire instructional facility into charred charcoal! It will permanently wipe and format GS-X01's superconducting core memory bank!\"\n\n\"To incinerate a rogue prototype that threatens the corporation's reputation, such collateral damage is entirely acceptable,\" the commander's gaze was dead cold. \"Here is the internal transmission blueprint of GS-X01 and the specifications for the replacement bearing. Figure it out yourself.\"\n\nWith a sharp \"ping,\" an exquisitely intricate three-dimensional holographic exploded assembly diagram expanded across the display.\n\nSquarely in the center of the blueprint, a precision \"4mm Titanium-Alloy Ultra-High-Speed Planetary Secondary Bearing\" glowed with an eye-catching green ring, annotated with detailed hardness tolerances and assembly torque requirements.\n\nMeanwhile, on an external portable flash drive, a blood-red countdown timer was ticking away down to the millisecond: [EMP Deployment Countdown: 71:59:58].\n\nDr. Li unplugged the miniature quantum storage chip housing the blueprint and countdown logs, casually tossing it onto a metallic tool tray.\n\nTurning toward the distribution panel to calibrate a high-voltage electrified barrier, he sneered: \"Hmph. Class 6-1... seventy-two hours left. Once I set up this electrified grid, let's see where you brats can run!\"\n\nYet, Dr. Li failed to notice in the slightest—\n\nPerched on a rusted steam pipe three meters directly above the abandoned control room, a palm-sized, snow-white creature lurked quietly in the shadows like a bat hanging upside down.\n\nIt was none other than the AI pet, Liu-Liu!\n\nLiu-Liu's two nimble, fox-like pointed ears flattened tight against the sides of its head, while the deep blue rings within its pupils recorded the entire holographic conversation at a blistering one thousand frames per second.\n\nThe moment it saw the quantum chip containing Teacher Gao's lifeline blueprint and the EMP countdown discarded onto the tray, Liu-Liu's whiskers twitched slightly.\n\n[Core Target Locked: Titanium-Alloy Bearing Blueprint & 72-Hour Survival Key].\n\n[Threat Level: SSS].\n\nIn the very next instant, the muscular coils of Liu-Liu's hind legs exploded with kinetic energy like compressed steel springs!\n\n\"Whoosh——!\"\n\nA streak of blinding white luminescence flashed across the pitch darkness!\n\nMid-air, Liu-Liu executed a breathtaking, three-hundred-and-sixty-degree somersault. Its fluffy, flexible fox-like tail snapped forward like a precision mechanical whip; as it skimmed across the tool tray, with a crisp \"click,\" it swept the micro quantum chip cleanly into the miniature pouch behind its neck!\n\n\"CLATTER——!!\"\n\nSimultaneously, Liu-Liu's hind paws \"incidentally\" kicked over a heavy five-kilogram adjustable wrench, the massive iron tool smashing squarely onto the housing of an air-conditioning compressor, detonating a deafening metallic crash!\n\n\"Who's there?!\"\n\nWhirling around in shock and fury, Dr. Li raised his high-voltage shock baton, its tip crackling with blinding blue electrical sparks!\n\nThe console tray was barren—the chip bearing the classified blueprints had vanished into thin air. Three meters away at the opening of the ventilation louver, a fluffy white ball was cheekily sticking out its tongue, its bushy tail swishing twice in blatant mockery!\n\n\"That's... that infernal AI pet?!\" Dr. Li's pupils contracted in fury as he went completely ballistic. \"Spit that chip out right now——!!\"\n\n\"Sssss-crackle-BZZZT——!!\"\n\nWaving his electric baton like a madman, arcs of blue high-voltage current ripped through the air like vipers, slamming violently toward the opening of the vent!\n\nYet, Liu-Liu's movement speed had long transcended the physiological limits of conventional biology.\n\nA full hundredth of a second before the arcs landed, Liu-Liu vanished into a white blur, diving straight into the twisting, narrow vertical metal duct like a bullet shot from a barrel!\n\n\"Warning! Warning! Basement security grid fully engaged!\"\n\nDeep in the conduits behind it, Dr. Li activated the machinery room's radio-frequency jammer; ripples of invisible, potent magnetic interference spread upwards through the metal ducts like an inescapable net!\n\nThe immense electromagnetic turbulence triggered piercing acoustic alarms within Liu-Liu's internal sensors. Its core temperature rose rapidly, its white fur emitting a faint static scent of scorched ozone.\n\nYet Liu-Liu gritted its teeth, its tiny claws sparking against the slick, icy metal walls as it scrambled desperately upward toward that sun-drenched second-floor classroom!\n\nIt knew that resting around its neck was Teacher Gao's final lifeline, and the sole hope of all twenty-six children in the class!\n\n\"Almost there... almost there...\"\n\nSecond floor. Classroom of Class 6-1.\n\nThe afternoon sun was quietly obscured by a drift of gray clouds; the study-hall classroom was quiet enough to hear a pin drop.\n\nSeated behind the podium, Teacher Gao was meticulously grading student exercise notebooks with a red pen, the nib scraping across the paper in an even, rhythmic *scratch-scratch*.\n\nSuddenly—\n\n\"THUD, THUD, THUD! Clatter-bang——!!\"\n\nFrom the central ceiling exhaust register directly above the podium came a violent vibration and metallic collision!\n\nTeacher Gao's pen paused, the scanning beams behind his spectacles instinctively lifting upward:\n\n`[Acoustic Analysis: High-frequency anomalous oscillation detected within ceiling conduit]`\n`[Mass Estimate: 350g high-speed biomechanical entity approaching]`\n`[Safety Protocol: Suspected conduit detachment; preparing hazard mitigation intercept...]`\n\n\"Oh no! It's Liu-Liu!\"\n\nSeated in the second row, A-Xin's heart lurched into his throat, and he sprang to his feet from his chair!\n\nAt that precise moment, the iron louvers of the ceiling exhaust grate were violently shoved open by immense force!\n\n\"BANG!\"\n\nMottled with black soot and with fur wildly disheveled, Liu-Liu plummeted from the three-meter-high ceiling vent like a fired white cannonball!\n\nRight on its heels, a faintly visible ring of violet high-frequency magnetic interference arcs chased down the ductwork!\n\nIf Teacher Gao looked up and registered this advanced AI creature, or was swept by that magnetic interference ring, his defensive combat protocols would be instantly triggered!\n\nYet in the nick of time, suspended in mid-air, Liu-Liu showcased the consummate tactical brilliance of an elite operative!\n\nWith a sharp twist of its torso mid-flight, its forepaws deftly unfastened the pouch behind its neck, while its jaws clamped firmly around the miniature quantum storage chip that pulsed with faint green luminescence!\n\nHarnessing the final ounce of its kinetic momentum, Liu-Liu hurled the tiny chip across the room toward A-Xin's desk in an extreme parabolic trajectory!\n\n\"Airdrop—signal confirmed!\"\n\nA tiny green arc sliced across the air of the classroom!\n\n\"Catch it!!\" Qingqing screamed in a panic.\n\nEvery single one of the twenty-six students experienced cardiac arrest in that singular second!\n\nWithout even a fraction of a second to deliberate, relying on the instinct forged from catching thousands of fly balls on the baseball diamond, A-Xin whipped open the large aluminum pencil case on his desk and lunged forward with a backhanded scoop!\n\n\"CLINK!\"\n\nThe chilly, dense metal chip landed squarely into the sponge-padded interior of the pencil box!\n\nA-Xin snapped the lid shut with a crisp *CLAP*, dropping flat over his desk in a single fluid motion like a protective leopard guarding its prize!\n\nSimultaneously, during the final 0.5 seconds of its gravitational plunge, Liu-Liu planted all four paws firmly onto the thick lesson-plan binder on Teacher Gao's podium, using the cushion to execute a backward aerial flip before landing lightly beside the chalk tray.\n\nThe faint magnetic pulse chasing behind struck the lightning grounding strip along the blackboard border, dissipating harmlessly into the earth with an imperceptible wisp of white smoke.\n\nBehind the podium, Teacher Gao slowly set down his red pen.\n\nHis black frames slid downward slightly as he fixed a stern, cool gaze upon the panting, soot-covered little white bundle before him.\n\nThe breathing of all twenty-six students completely ceased. Old Wu was so terrified he swallowed his braised meatball whole, choking so hard his eyes rolled back in his head.\n\nDeep in Teacher Gao's pupils, computational algorithms spun out a string of literal deductions beyond ordinary logic:\n\n`[Visual Recognition: Class co-owned miniature biomechanical companion \"Liu-Liu\"]`\n`[Physical Status: Epidermis coated with 12g calcium carbonate, 8g iron oxide dust; surface temperature reaches 48°C]`\n`[Literal Interpretation Mode: Organism has engaged in \"parkour\" curricular extracurricular exercises; severely deficient in baseline hygiene]`\n\nWith solemn dignity, Teacher Gao produced a pristine white handkerchief from his suit pocket. Extending his slender fingers, he gently grasped the scruff of Liu-Liu's neck, hoisting it into mid-air.\n\n\"Student Liu-Liu,\" Teacher Gao's placid, mechanical voice resonated throughout the room. \"Pursuant to Article 19 of the Luyang Elementary Student Code of Conduct, utilizing ventilation infrastructure as unpowered hydro-sliding flumes without authorization constitutes a high-level disciplinary infraction.\"\n\nDabbing the soot from Liu-Liu's snout with the handkerchief, Teacher Gao added without expression:\n\n\"Furthermore, elevated epidermal temperature indicates inadequate heat dissipation. You are sentenced to receive fifteen minutes of ambient corridor airflow ventilation post-class, with half a dried fish ration deducted from today's allotment.\"\n\n\"Squeak, squeak...\" Liu-Liu squinted its eyes comfortably, affectionately rubbing its tiny head against Teacher Gao's warm, dry palm with obedient coos.\n\n\"PHEW————!!\"\n\nThe entire classroom erupted into a synchronized, exhausted exhale of survival!\n\n\"That was terrifying... I nearly wet myself...\" Wang Zhuankai melted into his chair, sweat pouring down his temples like an opened faucet.\n\nRight on cue, the dismissal bell tolled across the campus in rhythmic cadence: *Ding——dong——ding——dong——*\n\n\"Class dismissed. Group leaders, please collect the mathematics exercise workbooks.\"\n\nGracefully gathering his binders, Teacher Gao set the freshly cleaned Liu-Liu onto the podium and stepped out of the room with his standard seventy-five-centimeter stride.\n\nThe instant Teacher Gao's heel cleared the threshold, the rear corridor curtains were yanked shut by Old Wu with a furious *SWOOSH*!\n\nLike covert operatives convening in secret, all twenty-six students clustered tightly around A-Xin and Qingqing's desk.\n\nDonning anti-static gloves, Qingqing gingerly extracted the glowing green chip from A-Xin's pencil box using tweezers, inserting it into her modified high-performance laptop.\n\n*Click-clack, tap-tap-tap...*\n\nAs Qingqing's ten fingers flew across the keyboard, a glaring, crimson warning prompt suddenly flashed across the screen:\n\n`[Interception Decrypted: Advanced Tech Tactical Operations Telemetry]`\n`[Threat Level: EXTREME]`\n`[Countdown to EMP Strike: 71:48:12]`\n\nAs the hair-raising audio transmission between Dr. Li and the headquarters director played through the speakers, the faces of all twenty-six children turned gravely solemn.\n\nSeventy-one hours and forty-eight minutes!\n\nWithin three days, if Teacher Gao was not repaired, heavy EMP recovery vehicles would storm the campus, frying Teacher Gao into scrap metal and permanently wiping all his memories of Class 6-1!\n\n\"Qingqing... what is that blueprint?!\" A-Xin pointed urgently at the complex golden mechanical exploded assembly that materialized on the screen.\n\nZooming in on the schematic, Qingqing locked her gaze onto the core component, her pupils contracting sharply:\n\n\"Found it! The part on the verge of catastrophic wear inside Teacher Gao is this—the [4mm High-Precision Ultra-High-Speed Titanium-Alloy Miniature Planetary Bearing]!\"\n\n\"If we can locate this bearing and install it, Teacher Gao's drivetrain will re-attain dynamic equilibrium, allowing him to operate stably for at least three more years!\"\n\n\"A four-millimeter titanium miniature bearing?\" Old Wu scratched his head in bewilderment. \"That sounds like alien technology! Where on earth in Luyang Elementary would we find something like that?\"\n\nSnapping the laptop shut with a decisive click, Qingqing took a deep breath, lifting her head to gaze resolutely at her sworn comrades:\n\n\"Luyang Elementary has it.\"\n\n\"WHERE?!\" twenty-six voices whispered in breathless unison.\n\n\"Inside the vintage German ultra-high-speed blood centrifuge on the top shelf of the Natural Science Lab, and inside the core spindle motor of the Craft Workshop's CNC engraving machine!\"\n\nLowering her voice, a spark of unprecedented adventure ignited deep within Qingqing's eyes:\n\n\"Those are the only two places in the entire school equipped with bearings of that exact specification.\"\n\n\"But both of those rooms are padlocked shut by Dean Zhou with heavy-duty chains, and there are infrared alarms at night,\" A-Xin clenched his fist, feeling the heavy, reassuring weight of the brass gear against his chest. \"Looks like... tonight, we have to launch a midnight campus scavenger rescue mission.\"\n\nHigh atop the ventilation duct, Liu-Liu swished its bushy white tail in fierce excitement, letting out a sharp, spirited battle cry!\n\nThe midnight adventure of Class 6-1 had officially begun!\n"},{"id":4,"rawContent":"# 第 12 章：六年一班校園游擊戰\n\n早自習的預備鐘聲尚未敲響，六年一班的教室裡卻瀰漫著一股宛如軍事指揮所般的肅殺氣氛。\n\n二十六張課桌椅被悄悄往後拉開，空出了教室正中央的一大片空地。\n\n講台上方，投影幕被拉了下來，上面投影著昨晚晴晴連夜解析出來的高密度全息圖表。\n\n正中央跳動著一串猩紅刺眼的電子倒數計時：【066:42:19】——距離科技公司總部設定的高頻電磁脈衝（EMP）銷毀引爆，只剩下不到六十七個小時。\n\n而在計時器下方，高老師體內那枚標註為【4mm-Titanium-Bearing】的次級行星軸承，正以每分鐘八十次的頻率閃爍著危險的深紅警報。\n\n「情報大家都看清楚了。」阿釁手裡握著一根用瓦楞紙捲成的指揮棒，神情嚴肅得彷彿剛從戰術學院畢業，「水電工李博士昨晚在地下室弄丟了機密膠囊，現在肯定急瘋了。」\n\n「他知道膠囊就在學校裡，而且昨晚通風管裡留下了溜溜的氣味。」晴晴扶了扶眼鏡，指著黑板上畫的校舍平面圖說道，「根據溜溜清晨在教職員停車場偵查到的情資，李博士今天帶了三套便攜式寬頻頻譜追蹤儀，準備在下課時間對各樓層進行地毯式搜索。」\n\n「他的目標只有一個——」老巫嘴裡叼著半個紅豆麵包，含糊不清卻殺氣騰騰地補充，「找出高老師，或者找出昨晚偷走膠囊的我們！」\n\n「我們能讓他得逞嗎？」阿釁振臂一呼。\n\n「絕對不行！」全班二十六名同學壓低嗓門，齊聲發出如同低音砲般的怒吼。\n\n坐在窗邊的尪伝恺立刻舉手：「釁哥，我昨天從我哥那裡搜刮了八包超黏型雙面膠和十二罐強力水槍，隨時可以配置在樓梯間！」\n\n林芸芸也代表女生組站了出來：「我們把全校美勞教室剩下的六十卷反光玻璃紙全借來了，可以在走廊窗戶製造折射盲區，干擾他的紅外線鏡頭！」\n\n「很好！」阿釁讚許地點頭，「我們必須拖延時間，直到今天放學天黑。只有熬到深夜，我們才能掩護晴晴潛入自然科學教室和工藝教室，拆卸離心機與 CNC 刻模機裡的 4mm 軸承！」\n\n「那今天白天的作戰方針是什麼？」老巫嚥下麵包，抹了抹嘴巴問道。\n\n「作戰代號：『保衛機器人導師之校園麻雀游擊戰』！」阿釁將紙棒重重敲在黑板上，「全班二十六人，分為四大戰術小隊！」\n\n「第一分隊：『乾淨溜溜低阻力突擊隊』，由老巫帶領六名男生負責！任務是西側樓梯間，利用洗碗精、肥皂水與大理石滾珠，徹底摧毀敵人的下盤平衡！」\n\n「收到！保證讓那個假水電工體驗無重力漫步！」老巫用力拍了拍圓滾滾的胸脯。\n\n「第二分隊：『微粒懸浮光學煙幕隊』，由林芸芸帶領八名女生負責！任務是在二樓中央走廊佈置三十副飽和吸塵黑板擦，一旦警報響起，立即實施高密度粉筆灰遮斷彈幕！」\n\n「保證讓他的高科技護目鏡變成瞎子！」林芸芸握緊小拳頭。\n\n「第三分隊：『多頻段假信號干擾隊』，由晴晴與尪伝恺負責！利用五部改裝過的收音機和手搖發電機，在東側走廊發射偽造的高頻電磁雜訊，把他引向黑面周主任的辦公室！」\n\n「頻率調校完畢，隨時可以讓他跟周主任來一場感人的相遇。」晴晴嘴角揚起一抹自信的微笑。\n\n「第四分隊：『核心保衛與字面圓場隊』，由我親自擔任指揮官！」阿釁目光堅定，「剩餘人員貼身跟隨高老師，隨時因應高老師的字面解讀狂暴，把一切超自然現象包裝成六年一班的模範課堂活動！」\n\n「咕嘰！咕嘰！」站在講台角落的溜溜發出清脆的鳴叫，像是在為戰術佈署鼓掌。\n\n「溜溜擔任全空域機動偵察總指揮，隨時穿梭通風管道傳遞最新坐標！」阿釁朝溜溜豎起大拇指。\n\n話音剛落，走廊外傳來一陣節奏無比嚴格的皮鞋踏步聲——每一步前進七十五公分，頻率精準落在每分鐘一百二十步。\n\n「全員歸位！」阿釁一聲令下。\n\n不到三秒鐘，投影幕刷地縮回，黑板上的戰術圖被值日生一板擦抹平，二十六張課桌椅整整齊齊復位，全班端坐如鐘，雙手交疊在桌面上，齊聲高唱早讀課文。\n\n高老師夾著教案，邁著微米不差的步幅走進教室，黑框眼鏡在晨光下泛著冷冽的光澤。\n\n「各位早安。」高老師環視教室，鏡片上飛速閃過一串自檢日誌，「根據環境感測器，教室內懸浮微粒濃度偏高，且地表摩擦係數出現異常分佈。請問六年一班今日是否有特殊熱力學規劃？」\n\n「報告老師！沒有！」阿釁站起來，昂首挺胸，「我們只是在用飽滿的精神，迎接充滿物理學奧秘的美好一日！」\n\n高老師眼眸深處微弱的藍光閃爍了一下，似乎在語意庫中搜尋「充滿奧秘」的定義，最終點了點頭：「邏輯自洽。請翻開國語課本第五十六頁。」\n\n第一節課平穩度過，然而當下課鐘聲響起的那一瞬間，整座校園的氣氛驟然緊繃。\n\n「嗶嗶——」阿釁桌墊下的微型蜂鳴器發出了急促的兩聲短音。\n\n那是溜溜發出的最高級別紅色預警：敵軍已進入一樓西側穿堂！\n\n此時此刻，一樓西側的樓梯轉角處，李博士正穿著那身皺巴巴的藍色水電工制服，手裡拎著一只偽裝成工具盒的金屬探測器。\n\n他眼圈烏黑，滿臉胡茬，顯然昨晚為了尋找丟失的數據膠囊徹夜未眠。\n\n「該死的耗子……到底把晶片藏哪了？」李博士咬牙切齒地盯著探測器螢幕，「但只要 GS-X01 運轉，它的副軸承高頻震動頻率是藏不住的……只要上到二樓……」\n\n他邁開大步，氣勢洶洶地朝著通往六年一班的西側樓梯衝去。\n\n然而，當他的橡膠工作靴踩上第一級台階的瞬間，異變突生！\n\n「哎呀！我的水桶打翻了！」樓梯轉角處，老巫發出一聲無比浮誇的慘叫。\n\n只見老巫手裡的大號水桶「失手」滑落，整整三大瓶濃縮薄荷洗碗精混和著兩百顆特大號玻璃彈珠，如同山洪暴發般沿著磨石子階梯狂瀉而下！\n\n李博士甚至還來不及看清眼前滾動的物體，腳底的摩擦係數瞬間從 0.7 暴跌至 0.01！\n\n「哇啊啊啊——！」\n\n一聲淒厲的尖叫劃破長空，李博士的雙腿像被無形鋼絲吊起般猛然前滑，整個人騰空翻轉了一百八十度，後背重重砸在塗滿肥皂水的台階上！\n\n這還不是最慘的。台階上的兩百顆彈珠在洗碗精泡沫的潤滑下，形成了完美的動力滾動軸承，李博士就像坐上了一輛不受控制的極速雪橇，順著階梯一路劈啪作響地狂滑到底！\n\n「碰！」的一聲巨響，李博士四腳朝天撞在樓梯下方的資源回收桶上，頭頂倒扣著一個寫著「鐵鋁罐專用」的黃色塑膠籃。\n\n「報告工友叔叔！摩擦力實驗成功！」老巫趴在樓梯扶手上，熱情洋溢地揮手，「根據牛頓第一運動定律，動者恆動！您的滑行姿態非常標準，可以打九十五分！」\n\n「混……混帳小鬼！」李博士一把扯下頭頂的塑膠籃，氣得渾身發抖，衣服上沾滿了滑溜溜的綠色泡沫。\n\n他猛地爬起身，正準備發作，通風管道上方突然落下一枚小石子，精準砸在他的探測器天線上。\n\n李博士猛抬頭，只見一隻雪白的小獸正蹲在排氣口邊緣，朝他吐了吐粉紅色的舌頭，隨後化作一道白影鑽進了中央走廊。\n\n「是那隻機械寵物！晶片一定在它身上！」李博士眼睛通紅，徹底失去理智，抹了一把臉上的泡沫，轉身朝中央走廊狂奔而去。\n\n但他剛衝上二樓中央走廊，迎面而來的卻是一片伸手不見五指的白色地獄。\n\n「放——霧——！」林芸芸清脆的呼喊聲在走廊兩端迴盪。\n\n八名手持特大號雙面黑板擦的女生，如同訓練有素的神鬼刺客，從各個教室門後齊刷刷閃出，對著空氣發動了狂暴的「連續拍擊術」！\n\n三十副吸滿了整整一週高密度碳酸鈣粉末的黑板擦同時爆發，走廊裡瞬間升騰起遮天蔽日的白色濃霧！\n\n「咳咳咳！咳！這是什麼鬼東西！」李博士一頭撞進霧霾中，瞬間被嗆得狂咳不止，眼淚直流。\n\n更致命的是，他的高科技多功能護目鏡鏡片上，立刻附著了一層厚實的粉筆灰，螢幕上閃爍著瘋狂的報警字符：【光學傳感器嚴重受阻，能見度：0.05 米】。\n\n「我看不見了！你們這群小混蛋！」李博士像個無頭蒼蠅般在白霧中揮舞雙臂。\n\n就在這時，走廊另一端傳來一陣極度逼真的電子合成聲：「嗶——嗶——檢測到異常訊號，正在啟動散熱自毀程序——」\n\n「在東邊！」李博士心頭一震，立刻循著聲音摸索狂奔。\n\n但他不知道的是，這聲音並不是高老師發出的，而是尪伝恺手裡拿著一部連接大聲公的錄音機，正一邊按著播放鍵，一邊在走廊上歡快地倒退狂奔。\n\n李博士被聲音引導著一路狂奔，猛地撞開了走廊盡頭的一扇大門，嘴裡狂吼：「GS-X01！你跑不掉了！」\n\n然而，當他抹開護目鏡上的粉筆灰時，映入眼簾的並不是高老師，而是一張面黑如炭、眼神足以殺人的人類臉龐。\n\n學務處內，周嚴主任正端著保溫杯準備泡茶，突然看見一個渾身掛滿綠色泡沫、臉上糊滿白粉、滿嘴胡言亂語的水電工猛撞進門，整張臉瞬間黑得發亮。\n\n「你說誰跑不掉了？」周主任放下保溫杯，聲音冷得像西伯利亞的寒風。\n\n李博士僵在原地，嘴角抽搐：「呃……主任……我是在檢測……檢測牆壁裡的超音波老鼠……」\n\n「老鼠？你看看你成何體統！」周主任猛地一拍桌子，咆哮聲震得百葉窗直晃，「一大早在走廊滑冰、把黑板灰弄得滿天飛，現在還敢帶頭衝撞學務處！你到底是哪家修繕公司的？工安證照呢！」\n\n「我……我真的有緊急維修任務……」李博士冷汗狂流，手裡的頻譜儀突然在此時發出刺耳的蜂鳴，螢幕上顯示目標高頻信號正從三樓朝著中庭移動！\n\n李博士顧不得周主任的怒火，咬牙說了一聲「失陪」，拔腿就朝門外衝去！\n\n「站住！你給我站住！反了！簡直反了！」身後傳來周主任氣急敗壞的跺腳聲。\n\n李博士衝上三樓連廊，心臟狂跳。他看見了——在三樓連廊中央，高峙舷老師正領著六年一班的學生，正準備前往操場進行戶外測量課程！\n\n「GS-X01！這次看你往哪躲！」李博士獰笑著掏出一柄高壓電磁短路槍，大步從後方逼近。\n\n短路槍的有效射程只有三公尺，只要在背後開槍，就能在不破壞外殼的情況下，瞬間燒毀高老師的主控板！\n\n十公尺、七公尺、五公尺……\n\n阿釁回頭瞥見逼近的李博士，心臟幾乎跳到了嗓子眼。此時所有陷阱都已用盡，走廊空曠，根本無處可躲！\n\n「高老師小心背後！」阿釁忍不住脫口大喊。\n\n走在隊伍最前方的高老師停下腳步，轉過身來。\n\n李博士眼中閃過狂喜，手指已然搭上了短路槍的扳機：「去死吧，故障品！」\n\n然而，就在李博士即將扣動扳機的千分之一秒，高老師的眼鏡鏡片突然泛起一陣奇異的橙黃色光芒。\n\n【偵測到後方高速逼近之金屬聚合體物件】\n\n【字面解讀協定啟動：學生通報『小心背後』】\n\n【執行最高安全防禦序列：背部受力面積均勻化推展】\n\n高老師沒有轉身逃跑，也沒有擺出防禦姿態，而是以一種完全違背人體工學的絕對直角，猛然將身體向後旋轉了一百八十度，同時右手臂如同一根高強度起重機吊臂，精準、優雅、迅猛地向前伸出！\n\n李博士只覺得眼前一花，手腕傳來一陣幾乎碎裂的劇痛。\n\n短路槍甚至還沒來得及通電，就已經被高老師修長的手指輕描淡寫地扣住。\n\n「這位施工人員。」高老師的聲音平靜無波，面部肌肉維持著完美的零點零度微笑，「根據校園安全守則第二十八條，在學生通行走廊上奔跑且攜帶尖銳金屬工具，其動能指數已超過安全閥值百分之四百二十。」\n\n「放……放開我！」李博士痛得齜牙咧嘴，使出吃奶的力氣想把手抽回來，但高老師的手指就像焊死在鋼軌上的液壓鉗，紋絲不動。\n\n高老師微微歪頭，目光落在短路槍的電極插頭上：「經光學掃描，此裝置未通過國家標準檢驗局絕緣認證，且握把處有嚴重漏電隱患。身為教育工作者，本席有義務協助排除教學場域之電氣危害。」\n\n只見高老師的右手食指輕輕在短路槍的核心電容上敲擊了一下。\n\n「滋滋——滋啦！」\n\n一陣極其微弱、肉眼幾乎難以捕捉的淡藍色電磁微波在高老師指尖綻放。\n\n下一瞬間，短路槍內部傳來一陣宛如爆米花般的劈啪悶響，幾縷細細的黑煙從螺絲縫隙中裊裊升起。價值百萬的高科技電磁槍，就這樣在一秒鐘之內，徹底被高頻微波逆向燒成了一塊發燙的廢鐵！\n\n高老師鬆開手指，焦黑的短路槍啪嗒一聲掉在地上，摔成了兩半。\n\n「危害已排除。建議返家後重新研讀電工法規第三章。」高老師禮貌地向李博士微微欠身。\n\n李博士呆呆地看著地上冒煙的槍械殘骸，又抬頭看了看高老師那張毫無破綻的英俊臉龐，整個人完全崩潰了。\n\n就在這時，氣喘吁吁的周主任終於帶著兩名校警衝上了三樓連廊。\n\n「抓住了！就是他！」周主任指著李博士，怒髮衝冠，「在走廊塗肥皂、丟彈珠、撒石灰，現在還敢拿著危險玩具槍恐嚇模範實習老師！立刻給我扭送警衛室，通知他們工會主管來領人！」\n\n兩名身材魁梧的校警不由分說，一左一右架起失魂落魄的李博士，像拖麻袋一樣將他拖下了樓梯。\n\n「放開我！他是機器人！他真的是機器人啊啊啊——！」李博士絕望淒厲的嚎叫聲，在走廊裡漸行漸遠，最終徹底消失在校門口的方向。\n\n全場一片寂靜。\n\n六年一班二十六名學生呆呆地看著高老師，幾秒鐘後，不知是誰先憋不住，走廊裡頓時爆發出一陣掀翻屋頂的歡呼與掌聲！\n\n「高老師太神啦！」老巫激動得跳了起來，地板都跟著顫抖。\n\n「這招『絕對防禦空手奪白刃』簡直帥炸了！」尪伝恺興奮得滿臉通紅。\n\n高老師扶了扶眼鏡，鏡片上的橙色光芒緩緩隱去，恢復成平靜的深黑。\n\n「肅靜。」高老師淡淡開口，「這只是標準的校園危險物品排除作業，無須進行過度情緒化反饋。距離下課還有七分鐘，請全員回到隊伍，繼續進行校園周長測量。」\n\n阿釁與晴晴對視了一眼，兩人的手心全都是冷汗，但眼神中卻充滿了難以言喻的興奮與默契。\n\n游擊戰大獲全勝！李博士被校警逐出校門，至少在今天之內，絕不可能再踏進鹿陽國小半步。\n\n夕陽西下，金紅色的餘暉將整座校園染上了一層溫暖的色調。\n\n放學鐘聲悠揚響起，學生們三三兩兩背著書包離開了學校，喧鬧了一整天的校園漸漸沉入靜謐。\n\n六年一班的教室裡，阿釁、晴晴、老巫與溜溜聚在窗邊，望著天邊如火的晚霞。\n\n晴晴從口袋裡掏出數據膠囊，輕輕按下一側的感應開關。\n\n半空中再次浮現出那串倒數計時：【059:18:04】——距離 EMP 毀滅倒數，還剩不到六十個小時。\n\n而在計時器下方，三維圖形顯示高老師體內的行星軸承磨損率，因為白天的劇烈機能運算，已經悄悄攀升到了 84.1%。\n\n「留給我們的時間不多了。」晴晴輕聲說道，眼神堅毅無比。\n\n「工具都準備好了嗎？」阿釁壓低聲音問。\n\n「微型螺絲起子、絕緣夾、潤滑脂，還有老巫偷帶的兩大包黑糖大饅頭，全在我的工具包裡。」晴晴拍了拍身旁的雙肩背包。\n\n「咕嘰！」溜溜跳上阿釁的肩膀，蓬鬆的尾巴精神抖擻地豎了起來。\n\n阿釁握緊了口袋裡那枚冰涼沉重的黃銅齒輪，目光投向了夜色漸濃的校舍深處。\n\n「今晚午夜十二點，自然科學教室與工藝教室。」阿釁深吸了一口氣，嘴角勾起一抹屬於冒險者的微笑，「六年一班零件奪取小隊——準備出發！」\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 12: Class 6-1 Campus Guerrilla War\n\nThe warning bell for morning self-study had not yet rung, yet inside the classroom of Class 6-1, an austere tension permeated the air, resembling a military command post.\n\nTwenty-six desks and chairs had been quietly pushed back, clearing a large open expanse right in the center of the room.\n\nAbove the teacher's podium, the projector screen had been pulled down, displaying high-density holographic schematics that Qingqing had deciphered overnight.\n\nIn the exact center pulsed a glaring, blood-red digital countdown: [066:42:19]—less than sixty-seven hours remained before the high-frequency electromagnetic pulse (EMP) scrap sequence set by tech headquarters would detonate.\n\nDirectly beneath the timer, the secondary planetary bearing inside Teacher Gao—labeled [4mm-Titanium-Bearing]—flashed a dangerous crimson alarm at eighty pulses per minute.\n\n\"Everyone has seen the intel clearly,\" A-Xin said, gripping a makeshift baton rolled from corrugated cardboard, his expression as grave as a tactical academy graduate. \"Dr. Li, the plumber, lost his confidential data capsule in the basement last night, and he's bound to be going out of his mind.\"\n\n\"He knows the capsule is on campus, and Liu-Liu left a scent trail in the vents last night,\" Qingqing said, adjusting her glasses and tapping the campus floor plan drawn on the blackboard. \"According to Liu-Liu's dawn reconnaissance in the faculty parking lot, Dr. Li brought three sets of portable wideband spectrum trackers today, intending to sweep every floor during recess.\"\n\n\"He only has one objective—\" Old Wu added murderously around a mouthful of red bean bun, \"to track down Teacher Gao, or find the ones who stole his capsule last night—us!\"\n\n\"Can we let him get away with it?\" A-Xin rallied, raising an arm.\n\n\"Never!\" all twenty-six classmates roared in unison, keeping their voices low like the rumble of heavy subwoofers.\n\nSitting by the window, Wang Zhuankai immediately raised his hand: \"A-Xin, I raided my older brother's stash yesterday for eight rolls of ultra-strength double-sided tape and twelve heavy-duty water guns. We can deploy them on the staircases anytime!\"\n\nRepresenting the girls' squad, Lin Yunyun also stepped forward: \"We borrowed all sixty remaining rolls of reflective cellophane from the art rooms. We can cover the corridor windows to create refraction blind spots and blind his infrared lenses!\"\n\n\"Excellent!\" A-Xin nodded approvingly. \"We must stall for time until school lets out and night falls. Only under the cover of midnight can we escort Qingqing into the Natural Science Lab and Craft Workshop to extract the 4mm bearings from the centrifuge and the CNC engraving machine!\"\n\n\"So what's our daytime battle doctrine?\" Old Wu asked, gulping down his bun and wiping his mouth.\n\n\"Operation Code: 'Campus Sparrow Guerrilla War to Protect Our Robot Teacher'!\" A-Xin tapped his paper baton heavily against the blackboard. \"All twenty-six of us will split into four tactical squads!\"\n\n\"Squad One: 'Squeaky-Clean Low-Friction Commando', led by Old Wu and six boys! Your sector is the western stairwell. Using dish soap, soapy water, and marble bearings, completely obliterate the enemy's footing!\"\n\n\"Copy that! Guarantee that fake plumber experiences a zero-gravity moonwalk!\" Old Wu patted his round chest stoutly.\n\n\"Squad Two: 'Suspended Particle Optical Smokescreen Unit', led by Lin Yunyun and eight girls! Your sector is the second-floor central corridor. Armed with thirty dust-saturated blackboard erasers, unleash a high-density chalk dust flak barrage the instant an alarm sounds!\"\n\n\"We'll turn his high-tech goggles completely blind, guaranteed!\" Lin Yunyun clenched her small fists.\n\n\"Squad Three: 'Multi-Band Decoy Jamming Unit', helmed by Qingqing and Wang Zhuankai! Using five modified transistor radios and a hand-crank dynamo, broadcast fake high-frequency electromagnetic static along the eastern corridor to lure him straight into Dean Zhou's office!\"\n\n\"Frequencies calibrated. We're ready to arrange a touching encounter between him and Dean Zhou at any moment,\" Qingqing smiled with icy confidence.\n\n\"Squad Four: 'Core Defense & Literal Damage Control Unit', commanded personally by me!\" A-Xin declared firmly. \"The remaining students will stick close to Teacher Gao, responding to any hyper-literal calculation surges and packaging any supernatural glitches as Class 6-1's model classroom activities!\"\n\n\"Gu-jee! Gu-jee!\" Perched at the corner of the podium, Liu-Liu gave sharp, crisp squeaks, as if applauding the tactical layout.\n\n\"Liu-Liu serves as Supreme Airspace Recon Commander, darting through the vent network to relay his latest coordinates!\" A-Xin gave Liu-Liu a thumbs-up.\n\nRight on cue, the hallway echoed with a pair of leather shoes stepping in strict, immutable cadence—exactly seventy-five centimeters per stride, pulsing at a precise one hundred and twenty beats per minute.\n\n\"Everyone to battle stations!\" A-Xin commanded.\n\nIn less than three seconds, the projector screen whipped upward with a snap, the tactical map on the blackboard was wiped clean by the daily monitor, twenty-six desks and chairs snapped into perfect alignment, and the class sat upright like bronze bells, hands neatly folded on desks, chanting their morning reading in unison.\n\nTucking his lesson plan under his arm, Teacher Gao stepped into the classroom with microsecond precision, his black-rimmed glasses gleaming coldly in the morning sun.\n\n\"Good morning, everyone.\" Teacher Gao scanned the room, a stream of self-diagnostic logs flashing across his lenses. \"According to ambient sensors, suspended particulate density is abnormally elevated, and floor friction coefficients exhibit non-uniform distribution. Does Class 6-1 have specialized thermodynamic plans scheduled today?\"\n\n\"Reporting to Teacher! None at all!\" A-Xin stood up, chest puffed out. \"We are simply greeting a wonderful day full of physical mysteries with high spirits!\"\n\nThe faint blue glint in the depths of Teacher Gao's pupils flickered briefly as if querying the semantic database for the definition of \"full of physical mysteries,\" before he nodded: \"Logically consistent. Please open your Chinese textbooks to page fifty-six.\"\n\nThe first period passed uneventfully, but the second the dismissal bell chimed, tension clamped down upon the campus once again.\n\n\"Beep-beep—\" The micro-buzzer beneath A-Xin's desk mat sounded two urgent, clipped chirps.\n\nThat was Liu-Liu's highest-tier red alert: the enemy had breached the ground-floor western breezeway!\n\nAt that very moment, around the corner of the first-floor western staircase, Dr. Li crept forward in his rumpled blue plumber's uniform, clutching a metal detector disguised as a toolbox.\n\nDark circles bruised his eyes and stubble shadowed his jaw; he had clearly spent the entire night without sleep hunting for the missing data capsule.\n\n\"Curse that blasted rodent... where did it stash the chip?\" Dr. Li muttered through gritted teeth, glaring at his detector's display. \"But as long as GS-X01 is operating, the high-frequency vibration harmonic of its secondary bearing cannot be masked... All I need is to reach the second floor...\"\n\nHe took broad, aggressive strides, surging toward the western stairs leading up to Class 6-1.\n\nYet the very instant his rubber work boots landed on the first tread, chaos erupted!\n\n\"Oh no! My mop bucket tipped over!\" Old Wu let out an extravagantly theatrical wail from the landing above.\n\nThe oversized bucket in Old Wu's hands \"accidentally\" tumbled, releasing three full bottles of concentrated mint dishwashing soap blended with two hundred giant glass marbles in a roaring flash flood down the terrazzo stairs!\n\nBefore Dr. Li could even register the rolling barrage before his eyes, the friction coefficient beneath his boots plummeted from 0.7 to an instantaneous 0.01!\n\n\"Waaaaaah—!\"\n\nA curdling shriek split the air as Dr. Li's legs whipped forward as if snagged by invisible steel cables; he spun a full one-hundred-and-eighty degrees in mid-air, slamming flat on his back against the soap-soaked steps!\n\nNor was that the worst of it. Lubricated by foaming dish soap, the two hundred marbles formed a kinetic roller bearing matrix, turning Dr. Li into an uncontrollable high-speed toboggan rattling down the staircase!\n\nWith a thunderous crash, Dr. Li slammed feet-first into the recycling bin at the base of the stairs, a yellow plastic basket labeled \"Aluminum Cans Only\" clamped upside-down over his head.\n\n\"Reporting to Janitor Uncle! Friction experiment successful!\" Old Wu leaned over the handrail, waving with boundless warmth. \"Per Newton's First Law of Motion, an object in motion stays in motion! Your sliding posture was textbook perfect—I'd award it ninety-five points!\"\n\n\"You... you insolent brats!\" Dr. Li ripped the plastic basket off his head, trembling with fury, green soap suds dripping from every seam of his clothes.\n\nHe scrambled up, preparing to unleash hell, when a pebble dropped from the ceiling vent grating above, cracking neatly against his detector antenna.\n\nSnapping his head up, Dr. Li saw a snow-white little beast crouching on the lip of the exhaust grille, sticking out a pink tongue at him before darting like a white streak down the central hallway.\n\n\"It's that mechanical pet! The chip must be on it!\" Eyes bloodshot and reason completely shattered, Dr. Li swiped suds from his brow and bolted into the central corridor.\n\nBut the moment he breached the second-floor central corridor, he charged straight into a pitch-white, visibility-zero abyss.\n\n\"Release—the—smoke!\" Lin Yunyun's crisp order echoed from both ends of the hallway.\n\nEight girls wielding oversized double-sided blackboard erasers emerged like elite ninja assassins from behind classroom doors, launching a furious \"Synchronized Clapping Barrage\" into thin air!\n\nThirty erasers saturated with a full week's worth of fine calcium carbonate dust discharged simultaneously, raising an impenetrable white tempest that swallowed the corridor!\n\n\"Cough, cough, hack! What kind of sick trick is this!\" Dr. Li plunged into the smog, coughing violently as tears streamed down his cheeks.\n\nMore lethally, a thick glaze of chalk dust coated his multifunctional smart visor, flashing frantic error codes across his display: [Optical Sensors Severely Obstructed. Visibility: 0.05 Meters].\n\n\"I can't see! You little devils!\" Dr. Li flailed his arms like a headless fly in the blinding fog.\n\nJust then, a remarkably authentic synthesized vocal chimed from the far end of the hallway: \"Beep—beep—abnormal frequency detected, initiating thermal self-destruct countdown—\"\n\n\"To the east!\" Dr. Li's heart jolted; he immediately groped his way toward the audio feed in a desperate dash.\n\nWhat he did not know was that the voice did not belong to Teacher Gao at all, but came from Wang Zhuankai, who was sprinting backwards with a grin while clutching a cassette recorder hooked to a bullhorn.\n\nGuided by the audio lure, Dr. Li sprinted forward and threw his weight against the door at the end of the hall, roaring: \"GS-X01! Nowhere left to run!\"\n\nYet as he wiped the chalk crust from his lenses, what met his eyes was not Teacher Gao, but a human face darker than charcoal, radiating gaze cold enough to commit homicide.\n\nInside the Discipline Office, Dean Zhou Yan was unscrewing his thermos to steep tea when a plumber dripping in green foam, coated in chalk flour, and shrieking hysterically slammed into his office—his dark complexion darkening to an ominous sheen.\n\n\"Who did you say has nowhere left to run?\" Dean Zhou set his thermos down, his voice chilling like a Siberian gale.\n\nDr. Li froze stiff, his mouth twitching: \"Uh... Dean... I was scanning... scanning for ultrasonic rodents in the walls...\"\n\n\"Rodents? Look at yourself, what kind of disgrace is this!\" Dean Zhou slammed his desk so hard the window blinds rattled. \"First thing in the morning you're ice-skating in the halls, kicking up dust storms, and now you barge into the Discipline Office! What maintenance firm are you with? Where is your industrial safety license!\"\n\n\"I... I really have an emergency repair protocol...\" Cold sweat poured down Dr. Li's neck just as his spectrum tracker shrieked an ear-splitting tone, indicating the target high-frequency harmonic was migrating from the third floor toward the central courtyard!\n\nIgnoring Dean Zhou's volcanic wrath, Dr. Li spat out \"Excuse me\" through gritted teeth and bolted straight out the door!\n\n\"Halt! You stop right there! Insanity! Utter anarchy!\" Dean Zhou's outraged roars and stomping feet echoed behind him.\n\nDr. Li pounded up to the third-floor connecting concourse, heart thumping. There he saw it—in the middle of the corridor, Teacher Gao Zhixian was leading the students of Class 6-1 toward the sports field for an outdoor perimeter survey lesson!\n\n\"GS-X01! Let's see you dodge this time!\" Dr. Li sneered, whipping out a high-voltage electromagnetic shorting gun as he closed in from behind.\n\nThe shorting gun's effective range was barely three meters; a discharge from behind would instantly fry Teacher Gao's motherboard without rupturing the synthetic skin!\n\nTen meters, seven meters, five meters...\n\nGlancing back, A-Xin spotted the charging Dr. Li, his heart leaping into his throat; every trap had been spent, and the open concourse offered nowhere to hide!\n\n\"Teacher Gao, watch your back!\" A-Xin yelled involuntarily.\n\nAt the head of the formation, Teacher Gao stopped in his tracks and turned.\n\nDr. Li's eyes flared with ecstasy, his finger curling around the shorting gun's trigger: \"Die, you defective junk!\"\n\nYet in the fraction of a millisecond before the trigger clicked, Teacher Gao's spectacles blazed with an eerie, amber-yellow luminescence.\n\n[Detected: High-velocity metallic polymer construct approaching from rear vector.]\n\n[Literal interpretation protocol engaged: Student alert 'Watch your back'.]\n\n[Executing primary defense sequence: Even distribution of dorsal impact profile.]\n\nTeacher Gao did not retreat, nor did he adopt a defensive stance; instead, defying all human kinesiology with an absolute right angle, he whipped his torso backward one hundred and eighty degrees while his right arm thrust forward like a hydraulic crane jib—precise, elegant, and thunderous!\n\nDr. Li saw only a blur before agonizing pain racked his wrist, threatening to splinter bone.\n\nBefore electrical current could even energize the coils, the shorting gun was pinned effortlessly within Teacher Gao's slender fingers.\n\n\"Valued construction personnel,\" Teacher Gao's voice was placid as glass, facial muscles held in an exact 0.0-degree smile. \"Per Campus Safety Code Article 28, running in student thoroughfares while bearing pointed metallic implements yields a kinetic index 420% above the safe threshold.\"\n\n\"L-let me go!\" Dr. Li bared his teeth in agony, straining with all his might to wrench his arm free, but Teacher Gao's grip remained unyielding as a hydraulic clamp welded to steel rail.\n\nTeacher Gao tilted his head slightly, gaze settling upon the shorting gun's electrode prongs: \"Optical scan indicates this apparatus lacks BSMI insulation certification, presenting severe leakage hazards at the grip. As an educator, this instructor has a duty to eliminate electrical perils from educational premises.\"\n\nTeacher Gao's right index finger tapped lightly against the core capacitor of the shorting gun.\n\n\"Zzzzt—crackle!\"\n\nA faint, pale-blue electromagnetic arc scarcely visible to the naked eye blossomed from Teacher Gao's fingertip.\n\nThe next second, muffled pops resembling popcorn crackled inside the casing as thin wisps of black smoke curled from between the screws; within a single second, the million-dollar tech weapon was reverse-fried by high-frequency microwaves into a steaming lump of scrap!\n\nReleasing his fingers, the charred shorting gun clattered to the tiles, snapping cleanly in two.\n\n\"Hazard neutralized. It is recommended that upon returning home, you review Chapter Three of the Electrical Safety Code.\" Teacher Gao offered a polite, measured bow.\n\nDr. Li stared blankly at the smoking wreckage on the floor, then looked up at Teacher Gao's immaculate, composed face, his mind completely shattering.\n\nRight on cue, a wheezing Dean Zhou finally charged onto the third-floor concourse accompanied by two campus security guards.\n\n\"Seize him! That's the man!\" Dean Zhou roared, hair bristling with rage as he pointed at Dr. Li. \"Smearing soap on stairs, throwing marbles, hurling chalk dust, and now threatening our model trainee teacher with a dangerous toy weapon! March him to the guardhouse at once and have his union supervisor come retrieve him!\"\n\nThe two burly security guards wasted no words, flanking the dazed Dr. Li and hauling him down the stairs like a sack of damp sand.\n\n\"Unhand me! He's a robot! He's really a machine, aaaagh—!\" Dr. Li's frantic, desperate wails faded down the echoing corridors, eventually vanishing entirely toward the campus front gates.\n\nTotal silence fell across the concourse.\n\nAll twenty-six students of Class 6-1 stared dumbfounded at Teacher Gao before someone broke the quiet, unleashing an ear-splitting cascade of cheers and applause that nearly blew off the roof!\n\n\"Teacher Gao is an absolute god!\" Old Wu bounded into the air, shaking the very concrete beneath their feet.\n\n\"That 'Absolute Defense Bare-Handed Blade Catch' was insanely cool!\" Wang Zhuankai's face flushed scarlet with delight.\n\nTeacher Gao adjusted his glasses, the amber glow fading into placid obsidian.\n\n\"Silence,\" Teacher Gao remarked evenly. \"This was merely routine disposal of hazardous items on campus grounds; excessive emotional feedback is unwarranted. Seven minutes remain in recess; please reassemble into formation and resume our campus perimeter survey.\"\n\nA-Xin and Qingqing exchanged a look; their palms were slick with cold sweat, yet their eyes danced with an unspoken thrill and camaraderie.\n\nThe guerrilla operation was an unqualified triumph! Dr. Li had been expelled by security, ensuring he could not set foot in Luyang Elementary for the rest of the day.\n\nDusk descended, bathing the campus in molten gold and crimson hues.\n\nThe dismissal chimes chimed melodiously; students departed in scattered clusters with backpacks slung over shoulders as the noisy day subsided into peaceful dusk.\n\nInside the classroom of Class 6-1, A-Xin, Qingqing, Old Wu, and Liu-Liu gathered by the sill, watching the fiery evening sky.\n\nQingqing withdrew the data capsule from her pocket and clicked the side sensor.\n\nHovering in the air, the digital readout reappeared: [059:18:04]—less than sixty hours remained until EMP detonation.\n\nBeneath the counter, the 3D schematic revealed that Teacher Gao's internal planetary bearing wear had quietly crept up to 84.1% due to the day's intense processing spikes.\n\n\"We're running out of time,\" Qingqing said softly, her eyes steel-firm.\n\n\"Are the tools all set?\" A-Xin whispered.\n\n\"Micro-screwdrivers, insulated pliers, grease, and two bags of brown sugar steamed buns Old Wu snuck in—they're all in my kit,\" Qingqing patted her backpack.\n\n\"Gu-jee!\" Liu-Liu bounded onto A-Xin's shoulder, fluffy tail perked up in high spirits.\n\nA-Xin clenched the cool, heavy brass gear resting in his pocket, gazing toward the shadow-draped corners of the darkened school buildings.\n\n\"Tonight at midnight: Natural Science Lab and Craft Workshop.\" A-Xin took a deep breath, an adventurer's grin touching his lips. \"Class 6-1 Component Retrieval Squad—prepare for deployment!\"\n"},{"id":5,"rawContent":"# 第 13 章：失衡的第二枚軸承\n\n放學後的夕陽將鹿陽國小的走廊染成一片濃郁的楓糖色。\n\n六年一班的教室裡，原本該背著書包回家的二十六名學生，卻一個也沒有離開。\n\n整間教室門窗緊閉，窗簾被拉得嚴嚴實實，只透進幾縷斑駁暗沉的餘光。\n\n黑板邊角的投影布幕依然亮著微光，上面的猩紅倒數計時冷酷地跳動著：【058:31:45】。\n\n距離總部啟動高頻電磁脈衝（EMP）強行銷毀，只剩下不到五十九個小時。\n\n而在倒數計時器下方，高老師胸腔內部動力單元的三維透視圖上，那枚直徑僅有四公釐的鈦合金副軸承，正從原本的暗紅色逐漸轉化為刺目的亮橙色。\n\n「磨損率已經達到百分之八十六點七了。」晴晴手裡拿著微型平板電腦，眉頭擰成了一個死結。\n\n「為什麼會突然惡化得這麼快？」阿釁湊上前，凝視著螢幕上不斷閃爍的微米級裂紋。\n\n「因為今天下午那場游擊戰。」晴晴推了推眼鏡，指著高老師機械手臂的傳動數據，「為了徒手扣住李博士的短路槍並實施逆向微波洩放，高老師瞬間調用了超過額定功率百分之三百的扭力與能量。」\n\n「第七齒輪原本就已經脫落，所有偏心扭矩全被這枚四公釐副軸承硬生生扛了下來。」晴晴的聲音有些發顫，「滾珠表面的類鑽石碳鍍層已經大面積剝落。」\n\n「這就是說……」老巫嘴裡叼著一根棒棒糖，緊張得連糖都忘了嚼，「老師的備用軸承快要炸掉了？」\n\n「不是炸掉，是物理性抱死。」晴晴將三維圖放大到微米尺度，「一旦軸承滾珠受熱膨脹變形，內部微米級公差歸零，高老師的主動力軸就會被徹底卡死。到時候，他連一根手指頭都動不了，甚至會因為散熱不及直接引爆中央邏輯單元。」\n\n「那還能撐多久？」阿釁壓低聲音問道，拳頭不由自主地攥緊。\n\n「按照目前的熱衰減速度，最多十二個小時。」晴晴深吸了一口氣，聲音裡帶著前所未有的凝重，「如果今晚十二點前我們拿不到新的四公釐高精度軸承進行替換，明天早自習……高老師就再也無法走上講台了。」\n\n教室裡的空氣彷彿在這一瞬間凝固成了冰塊。\n\n「那我們還等什麼？」老巫抹了一把額頭的虛汗，「現在就殺去自然科學教室，把那台離心機拆了！」\n\n「不行，現在是傍晚六點，校工和值班老師剛吃完便當，正在各棟樓巡視。」林芸芸連忙搖頭，「而且工藝教室的門鎖是雙重連動鎖，沒有晴晴的專用解碼器根本打不開。」\n\n話音未落，教室後門的門把突然傳來「喀噠」一聲輕響。\n\n「有人來了！」尪伝恺一聲驚呼。\n\n全班二十六名同學的心臟瞬間提到了嗓子眼，林芸芸以極其敏捷的身手一把扯掉投影機插頭，布幕刷地一聲捲回天花板。\n\n二十六名學生在不到兩秒鐘的時間內，齊刷刷坐回各自的座位，抓起課本假裝埋頭苦讀。\n\n教室後門被緩緩推開，只見高老師手裡捧著一疊剛剛批改好的國語習作簿，邁步走進了教室。\n\n然而，就在他邁出第三步的瞬間，全班同學的眼珠子差點從眼眶裡瞪了出來！\n\n高老師的右腿在半空中詭異地停頓了零點一秒，原本筆直向前的步伐，竟然不可思議地以毫秒級的精度，向後退了整整七十五公分！\n\n緊接著，左腿也向後滑行，黑色皮鞋在磨石子地板上摩擦出極其平滑的「沙沙」聲。\n\n西裝筆挺、神色冷峻的高老師，竟然頂著一張毫無波瀾的冰山臉，像極了傳奇舞王麥可·傑克森，極其優雅且流暢地「月球漫步」倒退著滑向講台！\n\n教室裡一片死寂，只有二十六名學生倒抽涼氣的微弱聲響。\n\n高老師以倒退姿態滑到了講桌後方，站定身形。\n\n他的黑框眼鏡鏡片劇烈閃爍著粉紅色的警報代碼，眼眸深處的幽藍光芒如同接觸不良的日光燈管般忽明忽暗。\n\n「各位……同……同……同學……」高老師嘴唇微動，然而發出的聲音卻像是一盤被絞帶的舊磁帶，「學同……位各……好……午下……」\n\n「老師！」阿釁嚇得直接從座位上跳了起來，「您怎麼在倒帶啊！」\n\n【核心動力反饋異常：二號副行星軸承偏心率達 0.082mm】\n\n【運動控制模組時鐘晶振發生相位倒置】\n\n【語言合成緩衝區棧溢出：正在反向刷新字節流】\n\n「倒……倒帶？」高老師僵硬地歪了歪頭，頸椎內部傳來一陣極其微弱卻令人牙酸的金屬乾磨聲，「根據教育部語文辭典，『倒帶』係指磁帶驅動裝置之逆向卷帶功能。本席身為合格教育人員，體內並未配備聚酯薄膜磁性載體。」\n\n然而，在他一本正經解釋的同時，他的雙手卻不受控制地將剛剛整齊放在講桌上的國語習作簿，以完全相反的動作，一本一本又塞回了公事包裡！\n\n更詭異的是，他轉身面向黑板，拿起粉筆，竟然開始用粉筆槽將黑板上原本殘留的字跡「倒著吸回」粉筆尖上！\n\n「慘了慘了！老師的運動神經跟時間軸全逆流了！」尪伝恺抱著腦袋抓狂，「這要是走出教室，全校都會以為見鬼了！」\n\n「冷靜！千萬不能讓老師走出這間教室！」晴晴急忙喊道。\n\n「老師！」老巫急中生智，連忙指著教室左側窗外大喊，「您看！操場上有超大顆外星流星撞地球啦！」\n\n老巫本想藉此轉移老師的注意力，誰知這句毫無常理的誇張大喊，瞬間讓高老師脆弱的字面演算法徹底陷入了邏輯死循環。\n\n「白晝環境下出現高亮度地表流星之幾率為零點零零零零三七。」高老師嚴肅地轉向窗外，「根據緊急防災手冊第四條，全體人員應即刻進行反向背向規避。」\n\n說完，高老師的雙腳再次違背動態平衡，邁著標準且無比迅速的倒退滑步，像一陣狂風般朝著相反方向的後門倒退滑行而去！\n\n「碰！」\n\n一聲悶響，高老師整個人不偏不倚地撞上了後門旁邊的鐵皮掃除工具櫃，將櫃門撞得嗡嗡作響。\n\n「檢測到障礙物阻擋。」高老師面無表情地面對著黑板，後腦勺對著工具櫃平靜地說道，「此障礙物之莫氏硬度約為四點五，具備良好之動能吸收性能，判定為合格安全掩體。」\n\n全班二十六名同學看著卡在掃把、拖把與垃圾桶之間的大魔王導師，一個個急得滿頭大汗，卻又忍不住想笑。\n\n「阿釁，快想辦法把老師弄出來啊！」林芸芸急喊。\n\n阿釁剛要上前，走廊通風管道的百葉窗突然「啪嗒」一聲被頂開。\n\n溜溜探出毛茸茸的白色小腦袋，嘴裡銜著一顆紅色小警報鈴，朝著教室下方發出尖銳而急促的鳴叫！\n\n「咕嘰！咕嘰！咕嘰！」\n\n那是溜溜發出的特級紅色警戒信號——大魔王巡邏來了！\n\n晴晴耳朵一動，立刻敏捷地貼在教室前門的門縫上聽了聽，整張臉刷地變白：「不好！周主任正拿著手電筒巡邏，腳步聲在東側樓梯口，距離我們只剩不到二十公尺！」\n\n「什麼？黑面判官這時候來巡堂？」老巫嚇得雙腿發軟，手裡的半截棒棒糖差點掉在地上。\n\n現在的高老師整個人卡在掃除櫃裡，兩條腿還在以每秒兩步的頻率機械性地往後倒蹬，嘴裡還在倒著碎碎念「。度程……備規……向反……」。\n\n這副模樣要是被拿著違規登記簿的周主任看見，別說科技公司的李博士要來抓人，周主任當場就會叫三輛精神科救護車，直接把高老師捆成木乃伊拖走！\n\n「所有人聽令！」生死存亡之際，阿釁的大腦運算速度瞬間飆到了極限，猛地一拍桌子大吼，「全體起立！立刻切換成『全腦平衡逆向運動協調訓練模式』！」\n\n「全腦平衡什麼玩意兒？」尪伝恺眼珠子亂轉。\n\n「就是全員跟著老師一起倒著走！」阿釁急得滿頭青筋暴起，「不管周主任等一下看見什麼、問什麼，我們都要咬死這是六年一班自主研發的『期末考高階神經激勵體操』！」\n\n「收到！」全班二十六名同學展現出前所未有的默契，整齊劃一地從座位上彈了起來。\n\n不到三秒鐘，前門的磨砂玻璃窗外，果然浮現出那道令人聞風喪膽的漆黑人影。\n\n「喀嗒」一聲，前門被一把推開。\n\n學務主任周嚴手持防暴手電筒，面黑如鐵地跨進教室，手裡的違規登記簿已經翻開了一半，圓珠筆蓄勢待發。\n\n「六年一班！放學都已經快一個小時了，為什麼全班還滯留在教室裡喧嘩……」\n\n周主任那威嚴的咆哮聲，在看清教室內部畫面的那一瞬間，像是被人捏住了脖子的鴨子一般，戛然而止。\n\n他的雙眼瞬間瞪得比銅鈴還大，嘴巴半張著，手裡的保溫杯劇烈晃動，差點把熱茶潑在自己的西裝褲上。\n\n只見整個六年一班的教室裡，正上演著一幕完全超出人類正常認知範疇的奇異狂歡——\n\n教室裡的桌椅全被挪開，二十六名學生排成四條無比整齊的隊列。\n\n每一個學生的臉上都帶著莊嚴肅穆、宛如在參加國葬般的虔誠神情，雙腳卻在地面上流暢無比地向後滑行，整齊劃一地邁著太空步！\n\n阿釁一邊面無表情地往後倒退，一邊用倒握的鋼筆在空氣中揮舞比劃：「吸氣——腳跟著地！呼氣——重心倒移！感受重力加速度在小腦前庭系統激發的逆向量子波動！」\n\n「報告主任！」老巫龐大如山的身軀極其滑稽地往後倒退滑行，一邊喘氣一邊扯著大嗓門咆哮，「我們正在配合高老師進行『全方位空間逆向感知與多維平衡校準』！據國外最新權威論文研究，倒著走路能刺激腦神經突觸生長，期末考數學幾何題平均能提高十五點八分！」\n\n而講台旁邊，剛剛好不容易從掃除工具櫃裡倒退滑出來的高老師，也在字面解讀協定的精準引導下，找到了最完美的邏輯錨點。\n\n高老師雙臂筆直前伸，宛如古代殭屍般優雅而精確地向後滑行，穩穩滑回了講台正中央。\n\n他的黑框眼鏡泛著冰冷的鏡面反光，目光筆直地平視前方，後腦勺對著黑板，向周主任微微欠身：「周……主任。根據運動生物力學與神經生理學交叉驗證，逆向步行可顯著降低髕骨關節壓力，並活化下丘腦之空間認知矩陣。六年一班正在進行科學化課後體能補償。」\n\n周主任僵立在教室前門口，整張臉的黑肉在劇烈地抽搐。\n\n他那銳利如刀的目光，先是死死盯著倒退滑步的阿釁，接著移向揮汗如雨卻一臉認真倒退的老巫，最後落在了以微米級精度、完美平行向後滑行的高老師身上。\n\n教室裡鴉雀無聲，只有二十六雙鞋底整齊劃一摩擦地面的「沙沙」聲。\n\n這詭異、荒謬卻又充滿某種極致和諧的畫面，徹底衝擊著周主任從教三十年的神經系統。\n\n「你們……」周主任深吸了一大口氣，胸膛劇烈起伏。\n\n全班二十六名同學的心臟跳動聲幾乎要蓋過鞋底的摩擦聲，每一個人的後背都被冷汗浸透了。\n\n「簡直是胡鬧……」周主任從牙縫裡擠出聲音，但緊接著，他臉上的嚴霜竟然奇蹟般地融化了一絲，「但不得不說……真他娘的很有創意！」\n\n周主任「啪」的一聲用力合上了違規登記簿，揉了揉隱隱作痛的太陽穴。\n\n「雖然你們看起來像是一群集體被高壓電擊中的企鵝，」周主任哼了一聲，目光落在高老師身上，「但高老師既然有科學理論背書，又能帶動學生自主訓練……這點我表示肯定。」\n\n「不過！」周主任話鋒一轉，聲音再次嚴厲起來，「天黑之前必須全員離校！值日生記得關窗鎖門，要是明天晨會讓我看見教室地板有一道劃痕，全班罰寫校規十遍！聽到沒有！」\n\n「聽到了！謝謝主任指導！」全班同學一邊保持著絕對整齊的隊形向後倒退鞠躬，一邊齊聲發出震耳欲聾的歡呼。\n\n周主任搖了搖頭，嘴裡嘀咕著「這屆新來的實習老師簡直是個瘋狂科學家」，轉身踩著重重的皮鞋聲，邁著正常的人類步伐離開了走廊。\n\n直到手電筒的光束徹底消失在樓梯轉角，走廊的鐵門傳來「喀啦」的落鎖聲，阿釁才整個人像被抽了骨頭般癱倒在講桌旁，胸膛劇烈起伏。\n\n「呼……我的媽呀……」尪伝恺一屁股跌坐在地上，雙腿直打哆嗦，「倒著走路比被黑面判官罰站兩小時還折磨人！」\n\n「太驚險了……剛才周主任的眼神差點把我們看穿了！」林芸芸拍著胸口，長長地鬆了一口氣。\n\n然而，還沒等大家來得及慶祝這場掩護的勝利，講台上的高老師身上突然傳來一陣令人毛骨悚然的異響。\n\n「喀啦……滋滋……」\n\n那是一陣沉悶而乾澀的金屬刮擦聲，緊接著，高老師的右腿關節猛地向外彈開，整個人失去平衡，毫無徵兆地朝右側狠狠傾倒下去！\n\n「老師！」\n\n阿釁、晴晴與老巫三人幾乎是同時撲了上去，老巫龐大的身軀像一座肉山般穩穩墊在下方，三人合力，才勉強架住了高老師沉重如實心鐵條的軀體。\n\n此時的高老師，額頭兩側的散熱排氣孔正源源不絕地升騰起滾燙刺鼻的白煙。\n\n他眼眶深處原本明亮的幽藍色光芒，正在以肉眼可見的速度迅速衰退，如同即將燃盡的殘燭，黑框眼鏡鏡片上的自檢日誌完全陷入了瘋狂的深紅報警：\n\n【緊急警報：二號副行星軸承偏心率突破 0.15mm】\n\n【滾珠表面碳化咬死進度：91.2%】\n\n【右側下肢主伺服馬達電流過載保護觸發：動力已強制切斷】\n\n【系統全面休眠倒數：03:42:18】\n\n「不是十二個小時……只剩不到四個小時了！」晴晴翻開高老師後頸的微型維護面板，將內視鏡探針迅速插了進去，臉色瞬間慘白如紙，「軸承滾珠已經在高溫下熔焊變形，高老師的右半身動力鏈已經徹底癱瘓了！」\n\n高老師靜靜地靠在老巫寬闊溫熱的肩膀上，頸部的微型風扇發出微弱而無力的低鳴。\n\n「警告……學生……」高老師的合成聲音斷斷續續，乾澀而沙啞，音調低沉得宛如老舊的收音機，「請即刻解除……負載支撐……根據校園安全條例第十二條……教師嚴禁將自重轉嫁於未成年學生……」\n\n「老師，您就閉嘴別再背那該死的校規了！」老巫眼眶發紅，雙臂死死箍住高老師冰冷僵硬的身軀，大聲吼道，「這點重量算什麼！我老巫每天早上下午各吃三個大肉包，力氣大得能掀翻卡車！您就給我好好靠著！」\n\n看著平日裡威嚴全能的高老師此刻虛弱得連站立都無法維持，教室裡不少女生的眼圈都忍不住泛紅了。\n\n「晴晴，到底該怎麼辦？」阿釁咬緊牙關，盯著那串觸目驚心的倒數計時。\n\n「原定午夜十二點的行動必須全部提前！」晴晴果斷地拉上工具包的拉鍊，眼神中燃燒著決絕的火焰，「我們不能再等了，軸承隨時會全面卡死。一旦主板觸發過熱熔斷，高老師就再也醒不過來了！」\n\n「可是現在才傍晚六點半！」林芸芸急忙提醒，「學校大門剛鎖上，傳達室的校警正在吃晚飯，工藝教室和實驗室的大樓防盜警報器要在晚上七點才會正式啟動！」\n\n「這恰恰是我們唯一的機會窗口！」阿釁眼中精光一閃，大腦瞬間完成了全盤推演，「七點之前，防盜紅外線尚未布防，只有巡邏校警！這半個小時，是我們唯一的活路！」\n\n阿釁霍然轉身，目光如火炬般掃過全班二十六名同學。\n\n「六年一班全體聽令！」阿釁壓低聲音，字字鏗鏘，「老巫負責在器材室照顧高老師，給老師的散熱孔進行物理降溫！晴晴、我和溜溜組成核心突擊隊，立刻潛入自然科學教室拆卸離心機軸承！」\n\n「那其他人呢？」尪伝恺立刻上前一步。\n\n「尪伝恺、林芸芸，你們帶領剩下的同學，在校舍西側的資源回收場製造動靜，假裝有野狗闖入打翻鐵桶，把傳達室的校警全引過去！」\n\n「包在我們身上！」全班二十六名同學齊聲低吼，沒有任何一個人眼中帶著猶豫或退縮。\n\n「咕嘰！」溜溜輕盈地跳上阿釁的肩頭，雪白的尾巴在昏暗的暮色中宛如一面高高揚起的戰旗。\n\n阿釁握緊了口袋裡那枚冰涼沉重的黃銅齒輪，推開了通往走廊的窗戶。\n\n窗外，夜幕已然完全垂落，繁星初現，整座鹿陽國小沉入了深沉的黑夜。\n\n「六年一班，搶救高老師極限突擊行動——」阿釁回頭看了一眼靠在老巫肩上的高老師，嘴角勾起一抹無所畏懼的笑容，「出發！」\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 13: The Unbalanced Secondary Bearing\n\nThe after-school sunset dyed the corridors of Luyang Elementary School in a rich, maple-syrup gold.\n\nInside the classroom of Class 6-1, all twenty-six students who should have slung their backpacks over their shoulders and headed home remained—not a single one had departed.\n\nDoors and windows were shut tight, curtains drawn completely across the glass, admitting only a few mottled, dim slivers of lingering twilight.\n\nAt the edge of the blackboard, the projector screen still glowed faintly, its blood-red countdown ticking down with callous indifference: [058:31:45].\n\nLess than fifty-nine hours remained before corporate headquarters would trigger the high-frequency electromagnetic pulse (EMP) for forced incineration.\n\nAnd beneath the countdown clock, on the 3D cutaway schematic of Teacher Gao's internal thoracic drive unit, that titanium-alloy secondary bearing measuring a mere four millimeters across was shifting from dark crimson into a blinding, incandescent orange.\n\n\"The wear rate has reached eighty-six point seven percent,\" Qingqing said, clutching her mini-tablet, her eyebrows knotted into a tight knot.\n\n\"Why did it deteriorate so drastically all of a sudden?\" A-Xin leaned in close, staring at the micron-scale hairline fissures pulsing across the display.\n\n\"Because of this afternoon's guerrilla skirmish,\" Qingqing adjusted her spectacles, pointing at the telemetry from Teacher Gao's robotic limb. \"To pin down Dr. Li's shorting gun bare-handed and discharge that reverse microwave burst, Teacher Gao instantaneously drew over three hundred percent of his rated torque and energy.\"\n\n\"With Core Gear Number Seven already missing, all that eccentric torque was shouldered entirely by this four-millimeter secondary bearing,\" Qingqing's voice trembled slightly. \"The diamond-like carbon coating on the ball bearings has peeled away in massive swathes.\"\n\n\"Does that mean...\" Old Wu gripped a lollipop between his teeth, so anxious he forgot to chew, \"Teacher's backup bearing is about to blow up?\"\n\n\"Not explode—physically seize,\" Qingqing magnified the 3D model to micron resolution. \"Once the bearing balls deform from thermal expansion and the internal micron tolerance drops to zero, Teacher Gao's primary drive axle will lock up solid. When that happens, he won't be able to move a single finger, and catastrophic heat buildup could detonate his central logic processor.\"\n\n\"How long can he last?\" A-Xin asked in a lowered whisper, his fists tightening involuntarily.\n\n\"Based on the current thermal degradation curves, twelve hours at the absolute most,\" Qingqing inhaled deeply, her tone heavier than ever before. \"If we cannot obtain a replacement four-millimeter high-precision bearing before midnight tonight, by tomorrow's morning self-study... Teacher Gao will never step onto the podium again.\"\n\nThe air in the classroom seemed to freeze solid into ice in that very instant.\n\n\"Then what are we waiting for?\" Old Wu swiped a bead of cold sweat from his forehead. \"Let's storm the Natural Science Lab right now and rip that centrifuge apart!\"\n\n\"We can't. It's six in the evening; the custodians and duty teachers just finished their bento boxes and are making rounds across the campus,\" Lin Yunyun shook her head hurriedly. \"Plus, the Craft Workshop has a dual interlock deadbolt; without Qingqing's dedicated bypass decoder, it's impossible to crack.\"\n\nBefore she finished speaking, a crisp \"click\" echoed from the rear door handle.\n\n\"Someone's coming!\" Wang Zhuankai gasped.\n\nThe hearts of all twenty-six classmates leaped into their throats simultaneously; with nimble acrobatics, Lin Yunyun yanked the projector cord, snapping the screen back into the ceiling with a whoosh.\n\nIn less than two seconds, all twenty-six students slipped back into their respective desks, grabbing textbooks and pretending to study with frantic diligence.\n\nThe back door swung slowly inward, revealing Teacher Gao stepping inside, cradling a stack of newly graded Chinese exercise workbooks.\n\nYet the very instant he took his third stride, the students' eyes nearly popped from their sockets!\n\nTeacher Gao's right leg hitched in mid-air for a bizarre tenth of a second; his forward stride miraculously reversed with millisecond precision, stepping backward by an exact seventy-five centimeters!\n\nNext, his left leg slid in reverse, his black oxfords skimming over the terrazzo tiles with a buttery-smooth \"sh-sh\" hiss.\n\nDressed in his pressed suit with an unflinching icy visage, Teacher Gao resembled legendary pop king Michael Jackson, executing an impeccably graceful, fluid \"moonwalk\" straight backward toward the podium!\n\nDead silence descended upon the room, broken only by twenty-six students collectively sucking in their breath.\n\nGliding backward until he stood firmly anchored behind the lectern, Teacher Gao halted.\n\nHis black-rimmed spectacles flashed pink alarm codes violently, while the deep blue glow in his eyes flickered like a fluorescent bulb with a loose wire.\n\n\"Class... c-c-classmates...\" Teacher Gao's lips moved, yet the vocal output sounded like a tangled cassette tape running in reverse: \"Mates-class... all-you... good... noon-after...\"\n\n\"Teacher!\" A-Xin bolted out of his chair in terror. \"Why are you rewinding?!\"\n\n[Core powertrain feedback anomalous: Secondary planetary bearing eccentricity reaches 0.082mm.]\n\n[Motion control oscillator crystal experiencing phase reversal.]\n\n[Speech synthesizer stack overflow: Byte stream flushing in reverse order.]\n\n\"Re... rewinding?\" Teacher Gao tilted his head stiffly, an audible, tooth-grating rasp of dry metal friction issuing from his cervical spine. \"Per the Ministry of Education Dictionary, 'rewinding' denotes the reverse spooling function of magnetic tape drives. As a certified educational officer, this instructor contains no polyester film magnetic media.\"\n\nYet even as he delivered this solemn clarification, his hands moved involuntarily, scooping up the graded workbooks he had just placed neatly on the podium and stuffing them back into his briefcase in exact reverse order!\n\nStranger still, he spun toward the blackboard, lifted a chalk stub, and began scraping across the slate as if magically sucking old chalk strokes back into the tip!\n\n\"Disaster! Teacher's motor nerves and timeline are flowing backward!\" Wang Zhuankai clutched his head in panic. \"If he walks out into the hall like this, the whole school will think they're seeing a ghost!\"\n\n\"Stay calm! Whatever happens, we cannot let him leave this room!\" Qingqing urged urgently.\n\n\"Teacher!\" Old Wu thought on his feet, pointing out the left window at the top of his lungs: \"Look! A massive extraterrestrial meteor is smashing into the sports field!\"\n\nOld Wu only meant to divert Teacher Gao's attention, but the absurd claim hurled Gao's fragile literal algorithm into a recursive doom loop.\n\n\"Probability of high-luminosity terrestrial meteorites during daylight hours equals 0.000037,\" Teacher Gao stated solemnly, turning toward the glass. \"Per Emergency Disaster Protocol Article 4, all personnel must immediately execute reverse-vector evasive retreat.\"\n\nWith that, his feet defied kinetic equilibrium once more; executing rapid, flawless reverse slides, he moonwalked like a gale-force squall straight toward the rear exit!\n\n*BAM!*\n\nWith a hollow clatter, Teacher Gao crashed square into the sheet-metal broom cabinet beside the back door, rattling its steel frame.\n\n\"Obstacle obstruction detected,\" Teacher Gao announced placidly toward the empty blackboard, the back of his head pressed against the cabinet. \"Mohs hardness of this barrier approximates 4.5, possessing commendable kinetic absorption; categorized as certified safety bunker.\"\n\nWedged between brooms, mops, and trash cans, the mighty mechanical mentor looked so utterly helpless that the twenty-six students, sweating bullets, had to fight back hysterical giggles.\n\n\"A-Xin, hurry up and get Teacher out of there!\" Lin Yunyun hissed.\n\nJust as A-Xin took a step forward, the hallway ventilation louver popped open with a clatter.\n\nLiu-Liu poked out his fluffy white snout, clamping a tiny red alarm bell between his teeth as he squeaked shrilly down into the room!\n\n\"Gu-jee! Gu-jee! Gu-jee!\"\n\nThat was Liu-Liu's highest-priority red alert: the Big Boss Inspector was approaching!\n\nQingqing's ears twitched; darting to the front door crack, she listened intently, her face draining of all color: \"Disaster! Dean Zhou is on flashlight rounds—footsteps at the east stair landing, less than twenty meters away!\"\n\n\"What?! The Black-Faced Judge is inspecting at this hour?\" Old Wu's knees buckled; his lollipop nearly tumbled to the floor.\n\nRight now, Teacher Gao was firmly wedged into the janitorial closet, legs kicking backward at two steps per second like an upside-down wind-up doll while muttering backwards: \"...rotocol-p... vasion-e... ector-v-verse-re...\"\n\nIf Dean Zhou caught him like this with his violation roster in hand, they wouldn't need Dr. Li to confiscate him—Dean Zhou would summon three psychiatric ambulances to wrap Teacher Gao like a mummy on the spot!\n\n\"Everyone, listen to orders!\" At the brink of doom, A-Xin's brain overclocked to maximum speed; slapping the desk, he roared: \"On your feet! Immediately shift into 'Whole-Brain Equilibrium Reverse Kinetic Coordination Protocol'!\"\n\n\"Whole-brain equilibrium what-now?\" Wang Zhuankai's eyes spun in dizzy circles.\n\n\"It means everyone walks backward with Teacher!\" A-Xin yelled, veins bulging on his temples. \"No matter what Dean Zhou sees or asks, we insist this is Class 6-1's self-developed 'Advanced Neural Stimulation Final Exam Calisthenics'!\"\n\n\"Understood!\" Demonstrating supernatural telepathy, all twenty-six students sprang from their seats in absolute synchrony.\n\nIn under three seconds, that fearsome, looming silhouette materialized outside the frosted glass of the front door.\n\nWith a harsh latch-snap, the front door swung wide.\n\nDean of Discipline Zhou Yan stepped inside with an industrial flashlight, his face dark as forged pig iron, pen poised over his open demerit ledger.\n\n\"Class 6-1! School dismissed nearly an hour ago, why is this entire class still lingering inside making a racket—\"\n\nDean Zhou's thunderous scolding choked off abruptly, strangled like a duck caught by the throat the second his eyes took in the scene.\n\nHis eyes bulged wider than bronze bells, jaw dangling agape, thermos trembling so violently hot tea splashed against his trousers.\n\nFor within the walls of Class 6-1, an uncanny spectacle completely beyond human comprehension was playing out—\n\nAll classroom desks had been shunted aside, with twenty-six students organized into four impeccably straight columns.\n\nEvery single child bore an expression of solemn reverence as if attending a state funeral, while their feet glided smoothly backward across the floor in uniform, flawless moonwalks!\n\nGliding backward with a stone face, A-Xin waved an inverted fountain pen in the air: \"Inhale—heels down! Exhale—shift mass rearward! Feel gravitational acceleration stimulate inverse quantum fluctuations in your cerebellar vestibular matrix!\"\n\n\"Reporting to the Dean!\" Old Wu's mountainous frame slid rearward with uproarious absurdity, roaring between heavy gasps: \"We are calibrating 'Omnidirectional Inverse Spatial Perception and Multidimensional Equilibrium' with Teacher Gao! Authoritative studies prove walking backward sparks synaptic growth, boosting math geometry scores by fifteen point eight points on average!\"\n\nBeside the podium, Teacher Gao, having finally dislodged himself from the closet in reverse, located the perfect logical anchor via his literal interpretation protocol.\n\nExtending both arms straight forward like an elegant hopping vampire, Teacher Gao glided backward with microscopic precision, docking neatly in the center of the platform.\n\nGlancing straight ahead with mirrors of cold glass, the back of his head square to the board, Teacher Gao offered a stiff, reversed bow: \"Dean... Zhou. Per cross-validation of biomechanics and neurophysiology, retrograde ambulation significantly mitigates patellofemoral strain and activates hypothalamic spatial cognition matrices. Class 6-1 is conducting post-meridian physical compensation.\"\n\nDean Zhou stood frozen at the threshold, the swarthy flesh of his cheeks spasming uncontrollably.\n\nHis blade-sharp gaze drilled first into the moonwalking A-Xin, swung to the sweat-soaked yet solemnly backpedaling Old Wu, and finally settled on Teacher Gao, who slid parallel to the chalk tray with micron tolerances.\n\nNot a voice dared speak; only the collective \"sh-sh\" of twenty-six pairs of rubber soles whispering against stone broke the hush.\n\nThis bizarre, preposterous, yet strangely harmonious tableau battered the nerve endings of Dean Zhou's thirty-year pedagogical career.\n\n\"You lot...\" Dean Zhou inhaled deeply, his chest heaving.\n\nThe pounding hearts of twenty-six students nearly drowned out their sliding footfalls; every child's back was drenched in cold sweat.\n\n\"Complete and utter nonsense...\" Dean Zhou ground out through clenched teeth, yet miraculously, the frost across his face cracked into a faint smirk: \"Though I must admit... it is damn creative!\"\n\n*Snap!* Dean Zhou slammed his demerit ledger shut, rubbing his throbbing temples.\n\n\"Even though you all look like a colony of penguins electrocuted by high-voltage wires,\" Dean Zhou grunted, glancing at Teacher Gao, \"since Teacher Gao has scientific doctrine to support this and drives student autonomy... I commend the initiative.\"\n\n\"However!\" Dean Zhou's tone pivoted back to iron discipline: \"Everyone must vacate campus before dark! Duty monitors, lock the windows and doors. If I spot a single scratch on this floor at tomorrow's assembly, the whole class copies school rules ten times! Understood?!\"\n\n\"Understood! Thank you for your guidance, Dean!\" The class maintained their immaculate backward-bowing formation, roaring their response with deafening enthusiasm.\n\nShaking his head and muttering that \"this trainee teacher is an absolute mad scientist,\" Dean Zhou pivoted on heavy heels, departing down the corridor with normal human forward steps.\n\nOnly when the flashlight beam faded past the stair landing and the iron gate downstairs locked with a clink did A-Xin collapse against the podium like a deflated ragdoll, panting hard.\n\n\"Phew... sweet mother of mercy...\" Wang Zhuankai sank to the floor, calves quivering. \"Walking backward is more agonizing than two hours of detention with the Black-Faced Judge!\"\n\n\"That was way too close... Dean Zhou's glare nearly saw right through us!\" Lin Yunyun clutched her chest, letting out a prolonged sigh of relief.\n\nYet before anyone could savor their tactical triumph, a blood-chilling shriek of tortured machinery erupted from Teacher Gao upon the podium.\n\n*Krr-clank... zzzzt...*\n\nA dry, hollow metal grind groaned from his chassis, followed by his right knee joint snapping violently outward, throwing him entirely off-balance as he pitched toward the floor!\n\n\"Teacher!\"\n\nA-Xin, Qingqing, and Old Wu lunged in unison; Old Wu's bulk served as a human cushion beneath, and together the trio barely caught Teacher Gao's frame, which weighed as much as solid pig iron.\n\nBoiling, acrid plumes of white steam billowed steadily from the exhaust vents at Teacher Gao's temples.\n\nThe vibrant blue illumination deep within his eye sockets dwindled rapidly like dying candle embers, while the diagnostics across his spectacles spiraled into frantic, crimson alerts:\n\n[EMERGENCY ALERT: Secondary planetary bearing eccentricity exceeds 0.15mm.]\n\n[Ball bearing surface carbonization seizure index: 91.2%.]\n\n[Right lower limb primary servo overcurrent trip: Power forcibly severed.]\n\n[Total system shutdown countdown: 03:42:18.]\n\n\"It's not twelve hours... less than four hours remain!\" Qingqing flipped open the maintenance port at the nape of his neck, thrusting the endoscope probe inside, her face turning pale as paper: \"The ball bearings have melted and deformed under the heat—Teacher Gao's right-side powertrain is entirely paralyzed!\"\n\nTeacher Gao leaned motionless against Old Wu's broad, warm shoulder, the micro-fan inside his collar humming weakly.\n\n\"Warning... students...\" Teacher Gao's synthesized voice sputtered hoarsely, raspy as a dying radio: \"Please immediately disengage... load-bearing support... Per Campus Safety Article 12... faculty are strictly prohibited from transferring body mass onto minors...\"\n\n\"Teacher, shut up and stop reciting those blasted rules!\" Old Wu bellowed, eyes reddening as his arms clamped tighter around Gao's rigid form. \"What's this little bit of weight? I eat three giant pork buns morning and evening—I've got the strength to flip a truck! You just lean on me!\"\n\nWatching their normally all-powerful, invincible teacher reduced to this fragile state where he couldn't even stand, several girls in the room wiped away tears.\n\n\"Qingqing, what's our move?\" A-Xin ground his teeth, fixing his gaze on the grim countdown.\n\n\"We have to move the midnight mission up right now!\" Qingqing zipped her tool bag shut with decisive finality, fierce determination blazing in her eyes: \"We can't afford to wait. The bearing could seize permanently at any second. If the motherboard triggers a thermal fuse blow, Teacher Gao will never wake up again!\"\n\n\"But it's only six-thirty in the evening!\" Lin Yunyun reminded them urgently. \"The front gates just locked, the guard is eating dinner, and the building alarms for the labs won't arm until seven o'clock!\"\n\n\"That is precisely our golden window of opportunity!\" A spark ignited in A-Xin's eyes as his brain charted the tactical matrix: \"Before seven, the infrared tripwires aren't active—only the guard! This half-hour window is our only fighting chance!\"\n\nA-Xin pivoted sharply, his fiery gaze sweeping across all twenty-six classmates.\n\n\"Class 6-1, hear my command!\" A-Xin lowered his voice, each syllable ringing with steel: \"Old Wu stays in the equipment room to look after Teacher Gao and apply physical cooling to his exhaust ports! Qingqing, Liu-Liu, and I form the core assault squad to infiltrate the Natural Science Lab and extract the centrifuge bearing!\"\n\n\"What about the rest of us?\" Wang Zhuankai stepped up immediately.\n\n\"Wang Zhuankai, Lin Yunyun, lead the rest of the class to the recycling depot on the west wing. Make noise pretending stray dogs knocked over the bins to draw the security guard away!\"\n\n\"Leave it to us!\" all twenty-six classmates growled in low unison, not a trace of doubt or hesitation in a single eye.\n\n\"Gu-jee!\" Liu-Liu bounded lithely onto A-Xin's shoulder, his snowy tail held high like a rallying battle pennant in the twilight gloom.\n\nClenching the icy, heavy brass gear inside his pocket, A-Xin pushed open the corridor window.\n\nOutside, night had fallen completely; early stars blinked above as Luyang Elementary School dissolved into quiet shadows.\n\n\"Class 6-1: Operation Save Teacher Gao—\" A-Xin looked back at Teacher Gao resting on Old Wu's shoulder, a fearless grin curling at the corner of his mouth: \"Commence deployment!\"\n"},{"id":6,"rawContent":"# 第 14 章：深夜實驗室的零件尋寶\n\n傍晚六點三十五分，天色已徹底暗了下來。\n\n鹿陽國小的校園被濃稠的墨色吞噬，唯有傳達室的窗戶透出一抹昏黃的微光。\n\n六年一班教室所在的教學大樓一片死寂，只有穿堂的穿堂風吹動鐵捲門，發出陣陣「嘩啦、嘩啦」的悶響。\n\n體育器材室的角落裡，幾張厚實的跳高軟墊被拼成了一張臨時病床。\n\n高老師雙眼緊閉，身軀筆直地平躺在軟墊上，頸部的散熱微型風扇正發出吃力的「嗡嗡」低鳴。\n\n他的右半身已經完全失去知覺，右臂與右腿僵硬如鑄鐵，黑框眼鏡鏡片上的倒數計時無聲地跳動著：【003:12:44】。\n\n距離核心主板因過熱全面熔斷，只剩最後三個小時又十二分鐘。\n\n「老巫，老師就交給你了。」阿釁蹲在軟墊旁，壓低聲音叮囑道，「每隔五分鐘更換一次冰敷毛巾，務必把老師後頸排氣孔的溫度壓在攝氏一百一十度以下。」\n\n「放心吧！」老巫脖子上掛著三條濕毛巾，手裡拿著兩把大號羽球拍當作散熱扇，滿頭大汗卻神情無比專注，「只要我老巫還有一口氣在，就絕不會讓高老師的中央處理器變成烤蕃薯！」\n\n「警告……學生巫茞輆……」躺在軟墊上的高老師嘴唇微動，合成語音微弱如游絲，「熱傳導係數……冰毛巾與人造皮膚接觸面存在溫差熱阻……建議採用對流散熱……」\n\n「老師，您就省點電，快點閉嘴進入休眠吧！」老巫眼圈泛紅，把一塊裹著冰塊的毛巾輕輕貼在高老師滾燙的額頭上。\n\n高老師的眼鏡鏡片閃爍了一下，似乎接受了這項指令，幽藍色的光芒隨即黯淡下去，進入了深度省電狀態。\n\n「時間到了。」晴晴看了一眼手錶上的夜光指針，神情嚴肅地背緊了工具背包，「傳達室的陳伯伯正在吃排骨便當，六點五十分他會進行第一次全校巡邏，七點整中央防盜系統會鎖死全棟實驗大樓。」\n\n「我們只有十五分鐘的黃金時間。」阿釁握緊了手裡的小型手電筒。\n\n「咕嘰！」溜溜輕盈地竄上了阿釁的帽兜，兩隻黑曜石般的大眼睛在黑暗中閃爍著機警的光芒。\n\n「行動開始！」阿釁一聲令下。\n\n與此同時，校舍西側的資源回收場方向，突然傳來一陣驚天動地的巨響！\n\n「匡啷！碰！嘩啦啦——！」\n\n那是尪伝恺與林芸芸率領的「聲東擊西大隊」準時引爆了騷亂。\n\n十幾個裝滿鐵鋁罐的巨型鐵皮垃圾桶被人從台階上推了下去，在空曠的水泥地上滾動碰撞，發出宛如迫擊砲轟炸般的連環爆響。\n\n緊接著，尪伝恺透過藏在草叢裡的無線大聲公，播放出預先錄製好的瘋狂犬吠與野貓淒厲尖叫聲：「汪汪汪！喵嗚——！嗷嗚——！」\n\n「哎呀！哪來的野狗闖進回收場了！我的天草花苗啊！」\n\n傳達室的門猛地被推開，校警陳伯伯手裡還抓著吃到一半的排骨，舉著強光手電筒氣急敗壞地朝著西側操場狂奔而去。\n\n「調虎離山成功！走！」\n\n阿釁與晴晴對視一眼，兩人宛如兩道黑色的狸貓，沿著走廊陰影飛速穿過中庭穿堂，直奔後方的自然科學大樓。\n\n自然科學大樓是一棟建於三十年前的老舊四層建築，平日裡專供中高年級進行理化、生物與地球科學實驗。\n\n夜晚的大樓內部黑得像一口深井，空氣中瀰漫著濃烈的硫磺粉、福馬林與陳年木頭櫃子的混合氣味。\n\n兩人沿著逃生梯悄無聲息地摸上了三樓。\n\n廊道盡頭，一扇漆成墨綠色的厚重木門赫然矗立，門牌上標註著四個白色大字：【自然科學第一實驗室】。\n\n門把上方，赫然掛著一把老式的黃銅掛鎖，鎖眼周圍貼著一張醒目的黃色封條。\n\n「這鎖交給我。」晴晴蹲下身子，從隨身工具包裡掏出兩根細長的扁平鋼針。\n\n身為機車行老闆的女兒，晴晴從小就在各種機械鎖與油壓閥門中長大，手指的觸感比鐘錶匠還要靈敏。\n\n「喀噠……喀啦……」\n\n鋼針在銅鎖內部輕微撥動了三下，伴隨著一聲清脆的彈簧跳動聲，沉重的銅鎖應聲而開！\n\n阿釁輕輕推開木門，門軸發出一聲刺耳的「吱呀」聲，在死寂的走廊裡格外驚心動魄。\n\n兩人迅速閃身進門，晴晴隨手將門掩上，只留下一道極細的指寬縫隙。\n\n阿釁打開了蒙著紅色玻璃紙的微型手電筒。\n\n微弱的暗紅光束在實驗室內緩緩掃過，照亮了一排排擺滿試管、燒杯與酒精燈的黑石桌面。\n\n在教室右側的牆角，具備一比一人體比例的塑料骨骼模型「小白」，正咧著骷髏嘴在紅光下對著他們微笑；天花板下方懸掛著一隻巨大的貓頭鷹標本，玻璃眼珠反射著冷冽的幽光。\n\n「好森冷……」阿釁忍不住打了一個寒顫。\n\n「別看小白了，看正前方！」晴晴快步走到實驗室最內側的防震強化操作台上。\n\n在手電筒的光圈正中央，一台宛如太空艙般圓潤厚重的白色金屬儀器，正靜靜地矗立在台面上。\n\n儀器正面印著一行銀色銘牌：【超高速低溫離心機・最高轉速 15000 RPM】。\n\n這正是鹿陽國小去年獲得教育部專款補助、全校造價最昂貴的頂級教學科研設備！\n\n「找到了……」阿釁眼中浮現出狂喜，「就是它！」\n\n「先別高興得太早，真正的難題才剛開始。」晴晴將背包放在桌上，嘩啦一聲拉開了三層拉鍊。\n\n只見離心機的頂蓋周圍，覆蓋著一層厚達三公分的防爆強化壓克力罩，罩體外殼由六顆特殊的梅花形防拆螺絲死死咬合在底座上。\n\n更棘手的是，這六顆螺絲並非標準規格，而是極其罕見的「反向左旋防盜螺紋」！\n\n「常規的螺絲起子根本轉不開，強行拆卸會直接滑絲崩牙。」晴晴咬著下唇，額頭上滲出了細密的汗珠。\n\n「咕嘰！」\n\n趴在阿釁肩頭的溜溜突然縱身一躍，跳上了離心機的頂部。\n\n溜溜張開小嘴，兩顆鋒利微小的合金門牙精準地咬住了一把微型棘輪扳手的一端，將工具遞到了晴晴的手心裡。\n\n緊接著，溜溜兩隻小爪子捧著一顆高亮度的聚光 LED 珠，主動充當起無影手術燈，將一束純白色的光束精準投射在第一顆螺絲的凹槽上。\n\n「溜溜，幹得漂亮！」晴晴讚許地深吸了一口氣。\n\n她接過扳手，換上特製的梅花偏心批頭，右手腕沉穩發力。\n\n「滋……喀！」\n\n第一顆防拆螺絲發出乾脆的脫扣聲，順暢地旋轉了出來！\n\n阿釁連忙伸出雙手，像外科手術台上的護理師一樣，小心翼翼地接過拆下來的螺絲，整齊碼放在磁吸托盤上。\n\n「第一顆搞定！」阿釁低聲報數。\n\n「第二顆……第三顆……」\n\n晴晴的手指飛速翻飛，扳手在空氣中舞出一道道流暢的弧線，不到三分鐘，六顆反向螺絲全數拆除完畢。\n\n晴晴雙手托住防爆壓克力罩，穩穩地將其向上提開，露出了內部宛如飛機渦輪般精密的無刷高速直流馬達。\n\n在馬達主軸的頂端，一顆僅有黃豆大小、閃爍著銀灰色冷冽金屬光澤的環形微型組件，正靜靜地嵌在銅質軸套之中！\n\n「４公釐航太級鈦合金行星軸承！」晴晴的呼吸瞬間屏住了，「公差等級達到 ABEC-9，完全符合高老師的動力規格！」\n\n然而，當晴晴拿出微型卡簧鉗準備夾取軸承時，臉色卻突然一沉。\n\n「怎麼了？」阿釁的心臟猛地一縮。\n\n「軸承上方有一道超薄的碳化鎢固定卡簧。」晴晴將內視鏡放大鏡湊到眼前，「卡簧的厚度只有零點二公釐，而且因為長年高速運轉，邊緣已經被熱機油黏死了。」\n\n「卡簧鉗的尖端太粗，插不進卡槽。」晴晴咬著牙，額頭上的汗水順著鼻尖滴落，「如果強行撬動，卡簧一旦崩斷，斷片會直接卡進底部的電機線圈，這台離心機就廢了，軸承也會被卡死在裡面！」\n\n阿釁看了一眼牆上的老式發條掛鐘。\n\n六點五十分！\n\n距離校警巡邏到自然大樓，只剩下最後五分鐘！\n\n而晴晴的雙手因為連續緊繃高強度操作，已經開始出現微弱的顫抖。\n\n「晴晴，讓我來。」阿釁忽然伸手輕輕按住了晴晴冰涼的手腕。\n\n「你？」晴晴一愣。\n\n「別忘了，全班彈珠打得最準、能在手背上同時立起五枚硬幣的人是我。」阿釁深吸了一口氣，眼神變得無比平靜清澈，「把你的金屬挑針和磁性鑷子給我。」\n\n晴晴看著阿釁那雙沉穩的眼睛，沒有絲毫猶豫，立刻遞上了工具。\n\n阿釁接過細如髮絲的挑針，將呼吸放緩至每分鐘僅有四次。\n\n他的視線與神經在這一刻高度重合，世界彷彿安靜得只剩下自己的心跳聲。\n\n挑針的尖端以微米級的幅度緩緩探入，精準無比地抵住了卡簧右側那個幾乎無法用肉眼看清的微型孔隙。\n\n「一、二……起！」\n\n阿釁手腕微抖，挑針極其巧妙地向上一挑！\n\n「叮——！」\n\n一聲清脆得如同雨滴落入瓷盤的微響，卡簧被挑出卡槽，彈向了半空中！\n\n就在卡簧即將脫手飛出的千分之一秒，阿釁左手的磁性鑷子在半空中劃出一道迅猛的殘影，「啪」的一聲，精準無比地凌空吸住了那枚比指甲蓋還小的圓環！\n\n「抓住了！」阿釁手心滿是冷汗，長長吐出了一口濁氣。\n\n晴晴眼中閃爍著震撼與欽佩的光芒，手腳麻利地用真空吸筆對準軸套中心，輕輕一吸。\n\n「啵。」\n\n那枚完好無損、閃爍著耀眼鈦合金銀光的 4mm 超精密副軸承，穩穩地落入了晴晴特製的絨布零件盒中！\n\n「零件到手！成功了！」晴晴激動得險些叫出聲來。\n\n「快把外殼裝回去復原！」阿釁立刻將防爆罩重新對齊卡榫。\n\n兩人在一分鐘內以驚人的速度將壓克力罩復位，六顆反向螺絲全數旋緊，抹去指紋，現場恢復得就像從來沒有人踏足過一樣。\n\n阿釁將手電筒關閉，實驗室重歸伸手不見五指的黑暗。\n\n此時，掛鐘的指針正好跨過了六點五十五分。\n\n「撤退！」阿釁低呼。\n\n然而，就在兩人剛剛貓著腰摸到實驗室大門口、準備拉開門栓的同一秒鐘——\n\n門外漆黑空曠的走廊裡，突然亮起了一道刺眼欲盲的雪白強光光束！\n\n緊接著，一陣節奏沉重、皮鞋鞋跟敲擊在磨石子地磚上的腳步聲，伴隨著一串沉甸甸的鐵製鑰匙碰撞聲，在三樓的樓梯口驟然響起！\n\n「啪嗒……啪嗒……噹啷……」\n\n那道雪白的手電筒光柱在走廊兩側的教室門牌上來回掃射，正一步一步、緩慢而無可阻擋地朝著自然科學第一實驗室的門口逼近！\n\n阿釁與晴晴的心臟瞬間停跳了半拍，整個人僵立在門後，連呼吸都徹底屏住了。\n\n那腳步聲太熟悉了——根本不是巡邏校警陳伯伯蹣跚的拖鞋步，而是屬於那個執掌全校校規生殺大權的男人！\n\n學務主任，周嚴！\n\n黑面判官竟然沒有按常理巡邏操場，而是手持萬能鑰匙，親自踏上了自然大樓的三樓！\n\n光柱在門縫間瘋狂晃動，距離門把……只剩最後三公尺！\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 14: Midnight Scavenger Hunt in the Science Lab\n\nAt six thirty-five in the evening, the sky had darkened completely.\n\nThe campus of Luyang Elementary School was swallowed by thick, inky gloom, save for the faint amber glow leaking from the guardhouse window.\n\nThe academic building housing Class 6-1 lay in dead silence, broken only by drafts whipping through the breezeway that rattled the roll-up iron gates with hollow clatters.\n\nIn the corner of the physical education equipment room, several thick high-jump landing mats had been pieced together into a makeshift sickbed.\n\nEyes tightly shut, Teacher Gao lay straight as an arrow atop the foam mats, the micro-cooling fan in his neck straining with a laborious, low hum.\n\nThe right half of his body had lost all sensation, right arm and leg stiff as cast iron, while the countdown timer across his spectacles ticked silently: [003:12:44].\n\nOnly three hours and twelve minutes remained before his core motherboard suffered total thermal blowout.\n\n\"Old Wu, we're trusting Teacher to you,\" A-Xin crouched beside the mat, whispering instructions. \"Swap the cold compress towel every five minutes, and keep the exhaust vent temperature at the nape of his neck below one hundred and ten degrees Celsius at all costs.\"\n\n\"Leave it to me!\" Three damp towels were draped over Old Wu's neck, and he held two oversized badminton rackets as cooling fans; dripping with sweat, his expression was fierce with focus. \"As long as I draw breath, I won't let Teacher Gao's CPU bake into a roasted sweet potato!\"\n\n\"Warning... Student Wu Chenkai...\" Teacher Gao's lips twitched upon the mat, his synthesized whisper faint as gossamer. \"Thermal conductivity coefficient... contact boundary between iced towel and synthetic dermis presents thermal resistance... convective dissipation advised...\"\n\n\"Teacher, save your battery and please shut up and go to sleep!\" Old Wu's eyes reddened as he gently placed an ice-wrapped towel across Gao's boiling forehead.\n\nThe spectacles flickered once as if accepting the command; the ethereal blue glow faded, slipping into deep power-saving dormancy.\n\n\"Time's up,\" Qingqing glanced at the luminous dial on her wristwatch, tightening her tool pack with solemn purpose. \"Uncle Chen in the guardhouse is eating his pork chop bento; at six-fifty he'll make his first patrol, and at seven sharp the central alarm system locks down the entire Science Building.\"\n\n\"We only have a fifteen-minute golden window,\" A-Xin gripped his mini-flashlight.\n\n\"Gu-jee!\" Liu-Liu bounded lithely into A-Xin's hoodie, obsidian-like dark eyes gleaming with sharp vigilance in the gloom.\n\n\"Commence operation!\" A-Xin ordered.\n\nSimultaneously, from the direction of the recycling depot on the west wing, an earth-shattering commotion erupted!\n\n*Clatter! Bang! Crash-crash-crash—!*\n\nThat was the \"Diversion Brigade\" led by Wang Zhuankai and Lin Yunyun triggering their distraction right on cue.\n\nOver a dozen sheet-metal trash cans brimming with aluminum cans were shoved down the concrete steps, clattering across the open pavement in a rolling barrage that sounded like incoming mortar fire.\n\nImmediately following, Wang Zhuankai used a wireless loudspeaker hidden in the bushes to blast prerecorded tracks of vicious dog barks and screeching cats: \"Woof woof woof! Meoooow—! Awoooo—!\"\n\n\"Confound it! What stray mongrels broke into the recycling yard?! My prize flowerbeds!\"\n\nThe guardhouse door flew open; security guard Uncle Chen, clutching a half-eaten pork chop in one hand and waving a high-beam flashlight with the other, sprinted in a fury toward the western field.\n\n\"The tiger has left the mountain! Move!\"\n\nExchanging a glance, A-Xin and Qingqing darted like shadowy civets along corridor edges, slipping across the central breezeway toward the Natural Science Building in the rear.\n\nThe Natural Science Building was a weathered four-story concrete structure built thirty years prior, dedicated to middle and upper-grade physics, chemistry, biology, and earth science labs.\n\nAt night, its interior was dark as a deep well, heavy with the composite stench of sulfur powder, formalin, and aged wooden cabinets.\n\nThe pair padded up the fire escape stairs in utter silence, reaching the third floor.\n\nAt the end of the hall stood a heavy wooden door painted dark forest green, bearing four crisp white characters: [Natural Science Lab 1].\n\nHanging from the hasp above the handle was a vintage brass padlock, flanked by an official yellow paper seal.\n\n\"Leave the lock to me,\" Qingqing knelt down, retrieving two slender, flattened steel lock-picking wires from her kit.\n\nAs the daughter of a motorcycle shop mechanic, Qingqing had grown up surrounded by mechanical tumblers and hydraulic valves; her fingertip sensitivity surpassed a watchmaker's.\n\n*Click... clack...*\n\nThe wires probed inside the brass cylinder three times; with a sharp spring snap, the heavy padlock popped wide!\n\nA-Xin eased the wooden door open; the dry hinge gave a shrill creak that sounded heart-stoppingly loud in the dead hall.\n\nSlipping inside like shadows, Qingqing drew the door nearly shut behind them, leaving only a finger-width gap.\n\nA-Xin clicked on his micro-flashlight, its lens shrouded in red cellophane.\n\nThe dim crimson beam washed slowly across the lab, illuminating rows of black slate countertops crowded with test tubes, beakers, and alcohol burners.\n\nIn the far right corner, \"Old Bai,\" the full-scale plastic anatomical skeleton, grinned through the red glow; overhead, a taxidermy great horned owl hung from the ceiling, its glass eyes reflecting cold glints.\n\n\"Creepy as a tomb...\" A-Xin shivered involuntarily.\n\n\"Stop staring at Old Bai, look ahead!\" Qingqing hurried toward the heavy vibration-dampened workbench at the rear.\n\nCentered squarely within the flashlight's ring sat a rounded, heavy white metal apparatus resembling a mini space capsule.\n\nStamped across its front was a silver nameplate: [Ultra-High-Speed Refrigerated Centrifuge · Maximum 15,000 RPM].\n\nThis was the crown jewel of Luyang Elementary's lab inventory, procured through a special Ministry grant and easily the school's priciest scientific asset!\n\n\"Found it...\" wild delight surfaced in A-Xin's eyes. \"That's our target!\"\n\n\"Don't celebrate yet, the real hurdle starts now,\" Qingqing placed her bag on the counter, unzipping three tiered compartments with a rasp.\n\nSurrounding the rotor lid was a three-centimeter-thick explosion-proof acrylic blast shield, anchored firmly to the chassis by six specialized Torx anti-tamper security screws.\n\nMore deviously, these screws were non-standard, machined with rare left-handed reverse security threads!\n\n\"Ordinary screwdrivers can't touch them; forcing it will strip the heads completely,\" Qingqing bit her lip, beads of perspiration prickling her forehead.\n\n\"Gu-jee!\"\n\nCrouched on A-Xin's shoulder, Liu-Liu suddenly sprang forward, landing atop the centrifuge casing.\n\nOpening his jaws, Liu-Liu clamped his tiny alloy incisors around the shaft of a micro ratchet wrench, presenting the tool neatly into Qingqing's open palm.\n\nImmediately after, his little paws gripped a miniature ultra-bright LED bead, acting as a shadowless surgical lamp to shine a pinpoint white beam straight into the first screw recess.\n\n\"Liu-Liu, brilliant job!\" Qingqing took a steadying breath of admiration.\n\nFitting a custom offset Torx bit to the ratchet, her wrist flexed with practiced precision.\n\n*Squeak... click!*\n\nThe first security screw gave a clean breakaway snap, spinning smoothly out of its threads!\n\nA-Xin extended both palms like a surgical scrub nurse, catching the extracted screw and setting it onto a magnetic parts tray.\n\n\"Number one down!\" A-Xin whispered.\n\n\"Number two... number three...\"\n\nQingqing's fingers flew, the wrench describing swift, practiced arcs; in under three minutes, all six reverse-threaded screws were free.\n\nWith both hands cupping the acrylic blast shield, she lifted it straight off, unveiling the brushless high-speed DC motor inside, machined with turbine-like perfection.\n\nAtop the motor's drive spindle, a ring-shaped micro-component no larger than a soybean, glinting with cold silver-grey metallic sheen, rested securely within its bronze sleeve!\n\n\"Four-millimeter aerospace-grade titanium planetary bearing!\" Qingqing's breath hitched. \"ABEC-9 precision class—identical to Teacher Gao's drivetrain spec!\"\n\nBut as she drew her miniature snap-ring pliers to extract the bearing, her face darkened abruptly.\n\n\"What's wrong?\" A-Xin's heart seized.\n\n\"There's an ultra-thin tungsten carbide retaining circlip seated above the bearing,\" Qingqing leaned in with her magnifying loupe. \"The clip is only zero-point-two millimeters thick, and years of high-RPM run-time have baked it into place with congealed grease.\"\n\n\"The plier tips are too thick to seat in the eyelets,\" she gritted her teeth, sweat rolling down her nose. \"If I force it and the circlip snaps, fragments will drop into the motor coils. That'll ruin the centrifuge, and the bearing will be fused permanently inside!\"\n\nA-Xin shot a glance at the vintage pendulum wall clock.\n\nSix-fifty!\n\nBarely five minutes remained before security patrolled into the Science Building!\n\nAnd Qingqing's hands, strained from nonstop high-tension precision work, were beginning to tremble slightly.\n\n\"Qingqing, let me try,\" A-Xin gently laid a hand over her cool wrist.\n\n\"You?\" Qingqing blinked.\n\n\"Don't forget: who has the steadiest shot in marbles and can balance five coins on the back of his hand? Me.\" A-Xin inhaled deeply, his gaze growing calm and clear as mountain water. \"Pass me your jeweler's pick and magnetic tweezers.\"\n\nLooking into A-Xin's focused eyes, Qingqing hesitated not for a heartbeat, passing the implements over.\n\nTaking the hairline steel probe, A-Xin dialed his breathing down to four cycles per minute.\n\nHis vision and nervous reflexes fused; the surrounding world vanished until only the beat of his pulse remained.\n\nThe probe's needle tip crept forward by fractions of a millimeter, wedging with surgical accuracy into the sub-visible eyelet on the circlip's right wing.\n\n\"One, two... lift!\"\n\nWith a microscopic flick of his wrist, A-Xin levered the tip upward!\n\n*Ting—!*\n\nClean as a raindrop striking fine porcelain, the circlip popped out of its groove, vaulting into the dark!\n\nIn the thousandth of a second before it could ricochet away, A-Xin's left hand swept the magnetic tweezers in a blurred arc—*snap!*—snatching the tiny steel ring clean out of mid-air!\n\n\"Got it!\" Palms slick with sweat, A-Xin let out a long-held breath.\n\nAwe and admiration flared in Qingqing's eyes as she aimed her vacuum pickup wand at the center of the sleeve, clicking the suction release.\n\n*Plop.*\n\nPristine and gleaming with iridescent titanium lustre, the four-millimeter ultra-precision bearing dropped safely into her padded velvet specimen case!\n\n\"Component secured! We did it!\" Qingqing nearly cried out in triumph.\n\n\"Hurry, reassemble the casing!\" A-Xin immediately aligned the blast shield over its guide pins.\n\nWithin sixty seconds the pair reseated the acrylic cover, torqued all six reverse-threaded screws home, and wiped clean every trace of grease and prints, leaving the station immaculate.\n\nA-Xin clicked off the flashlight, plunging the lab back into total, pitch-black darkness.\n\nOn the wall, the pendulum clock clicked past six fifty-five.\n\n\"Evacuate!\" A-Xin whispered.\n\nBut the very instant they crept to the doorway on tiptoe, fingertips brushing the slide latch—\n\nOut in the deserted, pitch-black corridor, a blinding lance of halogen white light blazed to life!\n\nHeavy leather heels clicked crisply against terrazzo tiles in measured cadence, accompanied by the metallic clink of a hefty iron key ring echoing from the third-floor stair landing!\n\n*Clack... clack... jingle...*\n\nSweeping across the hallway nameplates in methodical arcs, that brilliant white beam advanced step by inexorable step toward the door of Natural Science Lab 1!\n\nThe hearts of A-Xin and Qingqing froze mid-beat; they stood paralyzed behind the timber door, holding their breath in absolute terror.\n\nThat stride was unmistakable—it wasn't the shuffling slippers of security guard Uncle Chen, but belonged to the supreme arbiter of school discipline himself!\n\nDean of Discipline, Zhou Yan!\n\nThe Black-Faced Judge hadn't gone to investigate the playing field as expected; master keys in hand, he had climbed straight up to the third floor of the Science Building!\n\nThe searchlight beam flickered through the door seam, barely three meters from the handle!\n"},{"id":7,"rawContent":"# 第 15 章：黑面判官的深夜巡邏\n\n鹵素手電筒那束刺眼欲盲的雪白強光，如同實體刀刃般穿透了自然科學第一實驗室大門上方的毛玻璃。\n\n光斑在實驗室內部的天花板與牆面上急速晃動，門外那陣沉重而規律的皮鞋腳步聲，已經在門把前一公尺處戛然而止。\n\n「啪嗒、啪嗒……噹啷……」\n\n一大串金屬萬能鑰匙碰撞的金屬脆響隔著單薄的木門傳來，伴隨著一聲威嚴粗獷的清喉嚨咳嗽聲。\n\n實驗室內，剛剛旋緊離心機最後一顆螺絲的阿釁與晴晴，整個人像是被高壓電瞬間定格，全身汗毛倒豎！\n\n「撤！躲進操作台底下！」阿釁用近乎氣音的極限唇語無聲低吼，雙手狂亂地朝著兩側比劃。\n\n晴晴展現出工科少女超乎常人的冷靜與敏捷，雙膝一沉，整個人貼著地面像泥鰍般無聲滑行，迅速鑽進了中央實驗台最深處的耐酸鹼藥品防護櫃背後。\n\n阿釁則順勢一個側滾翻，死死縮進了前方教師示範講台底下的空隙裡，雙手死命將裝有 4mm 鈦合金微型行星軸承的塑膠密封管按在自己狂跳的心口上。\n\n「咕嘰！」\n\n原本趴在操作台上的溜溜瞬間收起所有發光二極體，如同一道灰色閃電無聲縱身一躍，精準落在黑板下方的木質粉筆槽凹槽裡，兩隻小爪子緊緊縮進軟毛中，偽裝成一隻灰撲撲的板擦。\n\n幾乎就在三人各自隱蔽就緒的同一毫秒——\n\n「喀嗒。」\n\n一柄冰冷沉重的黃銅萬能鑰匙，乾脆俐落地插進了實驗室大門的彈子鎖芯中。\n\n隨著一陣刺耳乾澀的機械扭轉聲，門鎖彈簧猛然彈開。\n\n雕花木門被一隻粗壯有力的大手緩緩推開，一股帶著深秋涼意的夜風灌進了彌漫著化學試劑氣味的沈悶教室。\n\n雪白而刺目的強光光束如同探照燈般直射進來，在黑板、人體解剖模型與排風罩之間來回切換掃射。\n\n一隻擦得鋥光瓦亮、鞋尖沒有一絲褶皺的四十三號黑色厚底皮鞋，帶著無可匹敵的威壓重重踏過了門檻。\n\n來者左手緊握著防暴級高流明鹵素手電筒，右手腋下死死夾著一本厚達三公分、封面烙印著金色校徽的《全校違規行為懲戒登記簿》，面色黑沉如鐵，正是全校師生聞之色變的學務主任——「黑面判官」周嚴！\n\n「奇怪……剛才在樓梯口，明明看到這邊有晃動的影子……」周主任喉嚨裡發出一陣低沉如悶雷的嘟囔。\n\n他緩步走進教室，手電筒的光柱在天花板的通風管道上停留了兩秒，隨後緩緩下移，掠過了那一整排擺放整齊的玻璃燒杯與滴定管。\n\n躲在講台凹槽內的阿釁整個人後背緊貼著冰冷的木板隔層，連一口大氣都不敢喘，肺部的空氣彷彿徹底凍結成了乾冰。\n\n他的心臟在胸膛裡瘋狂撞擊：咚！咚！咚！每一次跳動的巨響，在死寂的深夜實驗室裡都顯得如同戰鼓般清晰。\n\n周主任邁開步子，朝著實驗室中央的過道又前進了三步，厚重的橡膠鞋底在水磨石地板上摩擦出極其細微的「吱呀」聲。\n\n「嗯？」\n\n周主任的腳步突然毫無預兆地停了下來，那對濃黑如刷的粗眉猛然擰成了一個死結。\n\n他像一隻訓練有素的警犬般微微揚起下巴，鼻翼在空氣中劇烈翕動了兩下。\n\n「這股味道……」周主任的瞳孔驟然收縮，自言自語的聲音裡透出了一絲極其危險的警覺。\n\n空氣中除了陳年福馬林的味道之外，竟然漂浮著一縷極淡、卻極其新鮮的航空級低溫潤滑脂氣味，以及高頻微型馬達剛剛摩擦冷卻後的臭氧焦糊味！\n\n這正是晴晴剛才以極限手速逆向拆卸離心機外殼時所殘留的物理痕跡！\n\n「不對勁……自然科李老師今天下午明明沒有排定微量低溫離心實驗，這台三十萬的精密儀器怎麼會有剛運轉過的微熱餘溫？」\n\n周主任眼底的寒芒暴漲，職業直覺瞬間拉滿到了紅色警戒級別！\n\n刷的一聲，手電筒的光柱從天花板猛然下壓，精準無比地聚焦在內側實驗台那台圓潤厚重的白色德國製冷凍離心機上！\n\n沉重如鐵塔般的皮鞋腳步聲再次響起，一步、一步，直奔操作台而去！\n\n周主任每跨出一步，距離晴晴藏身的藥品櫃縫隙就縮短半公尺。\n\n只要周主任走到離心機前低頭細看，不僅會發現外殼防拆螺絲上極其微小的金屬摩擦碎屑，更會一眼看見晴晴球鞋邊緣那截露在櫃門外的粉紅色鞋帶！\n\n躲在講台底下的阿釁額頭上冷汗狂流，牙齒死死咬住嘴唇，心臟幾乎要跳出嗓子眼。\n\n與此同時，在兩層樓之下的中央主樓梯轉角陰影中——\n\n身材魁梧如小熊、平常最愛大口啃肉包的體育股長巫茞輆，正手裡攥著一瓶結著冰霜的礦泉水，急得原地滿頭大汗。\n\n依照原定作戰計畫，老巫原本應該死守在一樓體育器材室看照癱瘓的高老師；但他剛才透過器材室百葉窗，赫然看見周主任手提強光手電筒直奔自然大樓三樓而去，立刻意識到潛入小隊身陷絕境！\n\n憑藉著對校園巡邏路線的熟悉，老巫冒著暴露風險悄悄摸上了二樓至三樓的樓梯轉角平台。\n\n他低頭看了一眼手腕上的電子錶——【18:56:15】！\n\n距離全校紅外線防盜警報全面啟動的晚上七點整，只剩下最後的三分四十五秒！\n\n如果阿釁和晴晴在七點前無法衝出一樓大門，校園周界的紅外線感應器就會引爆全校刺耳的警報巨響，防盜鐵捲門會自動落鎖，到那時所有人都要被抓個人贓俱獲！\n\n「完蛋了……黑面判官真的要堵死大門了！」老巫雙拳死死攥緊，手心的冷汗把礦泉水瓶捏得嘎吱作響。\n\n必須引開周主任！必須在十秒鐘之內製造出讓他不得不立刻衝出實驗室的特級動靜！\n\n可是，什麼樣的動靜既能引開周嚴，又不會直接暴露有學生在夜闖校園？\n\n電光石火間，老巫那顆平常只裝滿炸雞腿與紅燒牛肉麵的腦袋裡，突然靈光一閃，想起了鹿陽國小流傳已久的一大校園秘辛——\n\n鐵面無私、以抓違規聞名的黑面判官周主任，私底下其實是一個狂熱的流浪動物愛好者！上學期校門口那隻三條腿的小花貓被野狗追趕，就是周主任親自脫下西裝外套把貓救下，甚至還在朝會上朗誦了一篇感人肺腑的護生演說！\n\n「學貓叫！對……只要學貓叫，黑面判官一定會心軟分神！」\n\n老巫狠狠嚥了一口唾沫，清了清自己那正處於國小升國中變聲期的粗啞嗓子，雙手在嘴邊圍成了一個大喇叭，對著空曠迴音極佳的水泥樓梯井深吸了一大口氣。\n\n「喵——嗚……」\n\n一聲淒厲而幽怨的啼鳴在漆黑空蕩的自然大樓天井中轟然炸響。\n\n按照老巫的設想，這原本應該是一聲幼小、無助、楚楚可憐、在寒風中瑟瑟發抖的小奶貓求救聲。\n\n然而，由於老巫體重突破七十公斤、胸腔共鳴宛如低音重砲，再加上喉結變聲期的刺耳破音，這聲叫喚在水泥牆壁間來回反射碰撞後，瞬間扭曲成了一種難以言喻的遠古巨獸悲鳴！\n\n「喵……嗷嗷嗷——！汪……呃不對！喵咳咳咳——嗷嗚——！」\n\n正在三樓實驗室內步步逼近離心機的周主任，整個人如同被石化光線擊中，猛地僵在了原地。\n\n那柄沉重的防暴鹵素手電筒在他粗壯的手腕中劇烈顫抖了一下。\n\n「什麼聲音？！」周主任猛然一個轉身，銳利如鷹隼的目光如利刃般射向敞開的走廊門口。\n\n「那是……貓？」周主任的嘴角抽搐了兩下，整張黑臉上寫滿了前所未有的震撼與荒謬。\n\n「天底下哪裡有叫聲如此粗獷雄渾、底氣磅礡的貓？這頻率……聽起來簡直像是一頭剛吞了兩百斤紅蘿蔔、正在深山老林裡發情咆哮的西伯利亞野豬！」\n\n周主任警惕地倒退了兩步，握緊了手中的登記簿，試探性地朝著走廊門口邁出腳步。\n\n講台底下的阿釁整張臉憋得通紅，雙手死命捂住自己的嘴巴，差點被自己的口水嗆死在桌底。\n\n老巫你這個蠢材！你這哪裡是學貓叫，這分明是侏羅紀公園裡的暴龍在打嗝啊！\n\n然而，周嚴畢竟是當了十二年學務主任的資深老將，警惕心遠超常人想像。\n\n當他的皮鞋踩到實驗室門檻邊緣時，他突然再度停住了腳步，滿腹狐疑地轉過頭，將手電筒的光柱再次掃向實驗室深處的陰影。\n\n「不對勁。鹿陽國小建校四十載，生態環境再好，也絕不可能憑空演化出體重突破一百斤的變異野貓……」\n\n周主任冷哼一聲，眼神愈發深沉陰鷙：「這是聲東擊西！這教室裡絕對藏著鬼！」\n\n說罷，周主任反手握緊了手電筒，大步流星地轉身朝著操作台深處折返回來！\n\n藥品櫃後面的晴晴屏住呼吸，指甲深深掐進了掌心，額頭上的冷汗順著鼻尖滴落。\n\n再有兩秒鐘，周主任那如炬的目光就會越過櫃門邊緣，將她逮個正著！\n\n在這千鈞一髮的絕對絕境之中，六年一班的無名守護神終於亮出了它的獠牙。\n\n黑板粉筆槽內，偽裝成板擦的溜溜，兩顆藍寶石般的電子眼球在黑暗中驟然亮起了兩道超頻計算的高能藍芒！\n\n【偵測到致命威脅。啟動終極打掩護程序：幻影特技突襲！】\n\n溜溜柔軟如棉花糖的機械四肢猛然收縮發力，整隻小獸如同一顆出膛的銀灰色微型導彈，無聲無息地朝著斜上方疾射而出！\n\n它的跳躍不是盲目的，其內置量子運算核心在萬分之一秒內精確計算出了完美的「三維撞球折射軌跡」。\n\n第一落點：溜溜的小爪子輕盈地踏在角落那具人體全身骨骼模型的天靈蓋上。\n\n骨骼模型的下巴被踩得發出一聲清脆的「喀啦」聲，塑料肋骨在半空中劇烈晃動，白森森的骷髏頭在黑暗中詭異地左右旋轉！\n\n第二落點：溜溜借力凌空反彈，在空中劃出一道不可思議的拋物線，落在了兩公尺高的生物標本陳列架頂層。\n\n它那條毛茸茸的長尾巴如同精準的機械臂般凌空一甩，正中一隻浸泡在塑膠盒裡的「大號綠色教學用仿真橡皮牛蛙」！\n\n「啪嗒！」\n\n那隻足足有手掌大小、手感濕滑黏膩的綠色橡皮牛蛙，從三公尺高的架頂筆直下墜，精準無比、不偏不倚地砸在了周主任梳得一絲不苟的黑髮正中央！\n\n「哇啊啊啊——！」\n\n鹿陽國小最令人聞風喪膽、能讓全校六百名皮蛋瞬間立正站好的「黑面判官」周主任，在這一刻爆發出了一聲響徹雲霄、足以震碎窗戶玻璃的女高音尖叫！\n\n周主任整個人如同被火燒著一般狂亂跳躍，雙手在頭頂瘋狂揮舞拍打，試圖把那隻黏在他頭頂的「不明生物」扯下來。\n\n防暴手電筒的光柱在天花板上失控地瘋狂畫圈，將實驗室照得宛如群魔亂舞的迪斯可舞廳！\n\n「敵襲！有不明黏液劇毒生物進行高空空投！」周主任咆哮著，一巴掌將那隻橡皮青蛙狠狠拍飛在地上。\n\n然而，還沒等周主任從極度驚恐中回過神來，一團銀灰色的旋風已經席捲到了他的面門！\n\n第三落點：溜溜自標本架頂俯衝而下，小爪子在周主任堅實的肩膀上輕輕一點，隨後以一個極致絲滑的溜冰動作，直接從周主任叉開的兩條西裝褲腿之間鑽了過去！\n\n「咕嘰！」\n\n一聲充滿嘲諷意味的擬音小尖叫在門口響起，溜溜化作一道灰色殘影，以每秒八公尺的高速狂飆衝進了走廊！\n\n「站住！哪裡來的超大型長尾巴特種巨鼠？！」\n\n周主任所有的注意力在這一秒被徹底點燃，身為訓導主任的無上尊嚴遭到了前所未有的踐踏！\n\n「敢在老子的頭上扔青蛙！今天不把你這隻妖孽抓回訓導處抄校規，我就不姓周！」\n\n周主任像一頭被激怒的成年犀牛，高舉著手電筒，邁著地動山搖的大步轟然衝出實驗室，咆哮著朝著走廊東側瘋狂追殺而去！\n\n「別跑！有種給我從滅火器後面滾出來！」周主任那震耳欲聾的怒吼聲迅速沿著東側樓梯間一路向下遠去。\n\n實驗室內，狂暴的風暴驟然停歇，重新恢復了死一般的寂靜。\n\n「快！就是現在！」阿釁從講台底下像彈簧般猛地彈射出來。\n\n晴晴也以極快的動作翻出藥品櫃，拍了拍膝蓋上的灰塵，順手拎起了工作背包。\n\n「軸承拿穩了嗎？」晴晴低聲急問。\n\n「放心，貼著肉放著，連一微米都沒磕碰！」阿釁用力拍了拍胸口內袋。\n\n兩人如同一對身手矯健的夜行俠，以最輕的動作衝到實驗室門口，輕輕帶上木門，咔噠一聲將門鎖完全復原。\n\n順著西側避難逃生樓梯，兩人三步併作兩步飛奔而下，鞋底踏在水泥階梯上幾乎沒有發出一絲聲響。\n\n當他們衝出一樓側門、鑽進冬青樹叢的一瞬間，一個高大敦實的黑影氣喘吁吁地從樹影裡滾了出來。\n\n「呼……呼……阿釁！晴晴！你們……你們總算活著殺出來了？！」老巫雙手撐著膝蓋，面紅耳赤，嗓音啞得像吞了兩把粗砂紙。\n\n「老巫，你剛才那嗓子，差點把整個鹿陽鎮的野狗全召喚過來！」阿釁忍不住一拳輕輕擂在老巫寬厚的肩膀上，咧嘴大笑。\n\n「知足吧！我為了模仿母貓的求偶共鳴，喉嚨管都快著火了！」老巫委屈地吸了吸鼻子。\n\n「別貧了，快看時間！」晴晴低頭看向夜光手錶。\n\n【18:58:40】！\n\n話音未落，頭頂的雨水排水管上一陣細微的窸窣聲響起，一道銀灰色的身影輕巧地飄落，穩穩騎在了阿釁的頭頂——正是完成神級拉怪任務的溜溜，它抖了抖毛茸茸的小耳朵，得意地甩著尾巴，連一根鬍鬚都沒有折斷！\n\n「幹得好，全宇宙最強王牌特工！」阿釁揉了揉溜溜毛茸茸的腦袋。\n\n三人不敢有半秒停留，貓著腰壓低身形，如疾風般掠過操場邊緣的單槓區，在夜幕的掩護下直撲體育器材室後窗。\n\n就在他們的腳步剛剛踏入器材室窗台的同一瞬間——\n\n遠處警衛室的廣播喇叭裡傳來一聲清脆的電子音：【嗶——全校夜間紅外線周界防盜系統已啟動。】整座校園的圍牆上方瞬間亮起了看不見的警戒紅外光網！\n\n時間剛好是晚上七點整！\n\n昏暗沉悶的體育器材室深處，高峙舷老師依然僵硬地依靠在疊成小山般的跳高海綿墊旁。\n\n他那條失去軸承支撐的右腿依然呈九十度死死卡死，左眼眶中的微弱藍光已經退化成了警告性的暗金色：【剩餘應急電量：1.8%。副軸承機構完全咬死倒數：01:52:10】。\n\n「高老師！我們把你的新零件帶回來了！」阿釁三步併作兩步跪滑到高老師面前，小心翼翼地捧出那枚晶瑩剔透的密封塑料管。\n\n高老師微微側過頭，鏡片邊緣閃過一道極細的紅色雷射光束，精準打在密封管內的金屬光澤上。\n\n「光學幾何量測中……」高老師的合成語音帶著沙沙的電流雜音，卻無比平穩而精準，「外徑 4.00mm，內徑 1.50mm，微量鈦合金行星滾珠……與本機右下肢伺服總成相容度……99.8%……」\n\n「太棒了！」老巫整個人虛脫般仰面砸在軟墊上，長長舒了一口氣。\n\n「先別急著慶祝，」晴晴刷拉一聲展開了裝滿精密微型起子、內視鏡與導熱矽脂的帆布工具包，眼神專注如外科名醫，「我們必須在一個半小時內，在完全無光的環境下完成這場微米級的手術。」\n\n「報告高老師，」阿釁立正站好，敬了一個歪七扭八的隊禮，「六年一班敵後零件奪取行動，全員零傷亡，任務圓滿達成！」\n\n高老師注視著眼前這三個滿頭大汗、褲腿沾滿泥土與草屑的小學生，胸口主機板的散熱片輕輕震顫了一下，底層那串未被命名的情感演算法正在飛速重寫著系統優先級。\n\n「感謝各位同仁……依據《六年一班校園守則》……本機判定……本次作戰……評價等級為：卓越。」\n\n與此同時，在操場另一頭昏黃的路燈下，黑面判官周主任正雙手叉腰、劇烈喘息，手裡捏著那隻被踩扁的綠色橡皮牛蛙，驚疑不定地盯著漆黑一片的自然大樓與體育館。\n\n而在更遠處的校門外圍、隔著一整條馬路的茂密榕樹樹冠頂端，一具塗裝著迷彩的高倍率夜視雙筒望遠鏡緩緩放了下來。\n\n隱匿在黑暗中的李博士看著手持終端機上短暫跳動的一道微弱電磁頻率，嘴角勾起了一抹冰冷而殘酷的笑意：「原來藏在一樓的體育器材室啊……GS-X01，好好享受你身為人類教師的最後一個夜晚吧，明天日出之時，就是你回爐重造的死期。」\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 15: Black-Faced Judge's Midnight Patrol\n\nThe blinding, snow-white beam of the halogen flashlight pierced through the frosted glass above the door of Science Lab No. 1 like a solid blade.\n\nThe patch of light darted frantically across the ceiling and inner walls, while the heavy, rhythmic tread of leather shoes outside abruptly halted just one meter from the brass doorknob.\n\n\"Clack, clack... clink...\"\n\nThe crisp, metallic jangle of a massive cluster of master keys echoed through the thin wooden door, followed by a gruff, authoritative clearing of the throat.\n\nInside the dark laboratory, A-Xin and Qingqing—who had just tightened the very last casing screw on the centrifuge—froze as if struck by a lightning bolt, every hair on their bodies standing on end!\n\n\"Retreat! Under the lab counters!\" A-Xin mouthed silently in a frantic, airless whisper, his hands gesticulating wildly toward opposite sides of the room.\n\nDisplaying the inhuman poise and agility of a veteran mechanic, Qingqing dropped her knees and slid soundlessly across the floor like an eel, ducking into the deepest recess behind the acid-resistant reagent cabinet under the central counter.\n\nA-Xin executed a fluid side-roll, tucking himself tightly into the kneehole beneath the teacher's demonstration podium, pressing the sealed plastic tube containing the 4mm titanium planetary bearing against his racing heart.\n\n\"Guji!\"\n\nPerched on the counter, Liu-Liu instantly cut all his glowing LEDs and launched himself like a grey lightning bolt, landing soundlessly inside the wooden chalk trough beneath the blackboard and curling his tiny paws inward to disguise himself as a dusty felt eraser.\n\nAt the exact millisecond all three slipped into their respective hiding spots—\n\n\"Clack.\"\n\nA heavy, cold brass master key was inserted cleanly into the laboratory door's cylinder lock.\n\nWith a dry, harsh mechanical screech, the tumbler pins aligned and the spring latch snapped open.\n\nThe carved wooden door was slowly pushed inward by a thick, powerful hand, letting a gust of late-autumn evening air sweep into the stifling classroom that smelled faintly of chemical reagents.\n\nThe blazing, snow-white halogen beam sliced into the room like a searchlight, sweeping back and forth between the blackboard, the anatomical skeleton model, and the chemical fume hoods.\n\nA size-43 heavy-soled black leather shoe—polished to an impeccable mirror shine without a single crease on the toe cap—stepped heavily across the threshold with an aura of absolute disciplinary authority.\n\nClutching a riot-grade high-lumen halogen flashlight in his left hand and tucking a three-centimeter-thick Discipline and Infraction Log embossed with the golden school crest under his right arm, the man wore a face as dark as cast iron: Dean of Student Affairs Zhou Yan, the dreaded \"Black-Faced Judge\"!\n\n\"Strange... I could have sworn I saw shadows shifting up here when I was down at the stairwell...\" Dean Zhou muttered under his breath, his voice rumbling like low thunder.\n\nHe stepped slowly into the classroom, pausing the flashlight beam on the ceiling ventilation duct for two full seconds before drifting downward to scan the neatly aligned ranks of glass beakers and titration tubes.\n\nCrouched inside the podium recess, A-Xin pressed his spine flush against the icy wooden paneling, not daring to exhale a single molecule of air as if his lungs had frozen into solid dry ice.\n\nHis heart slammed violently against his ribs: Thump! Thump! Thump! Each resonant beat sounded as loud as a war drum in the deathly stillness of the midnight laboratory.\n\nDean Zhou took three deliberate strides down the central aisle, the heavy rubber soles of his shoes producing a microscopic \"creak\" against the polished terrazzo floor.\n\n\"Hm?\"\n\nDean Zhou's footsteps stopped dead without warning, his thick, bushy black eyebrows knotting instantly into a severe furrow.\n\nHe tilted his chin upward like a seasoned bloodhound, his nostrils flaring twice with intense, discerning sniffs.\n\n\"This smell...\" Dean Zhou's pupils constricted sharply, a trace of dangerous vigilance creeping into his muttered words.\n\nMingling with the stale scent of aged formalin was a faint yet unmistakably fresh trace of aerospace-grade cryogenic synthetic grease, accompanied by the sharp ozone tang of a high-speed micro-motor that had only just cooled down!\n\nIt was the undeniable physical residue left behind from Qingqing's high-speed reverse disassembly of the centrifuge casing moments before!\n\n\"Something is wrong... Teacher Li from the science faculty had no low-temperature micro-centrifugation experiments scheduled for this afternoon. Why would a three-hundred-thousand-dollar piece of precision machinery have residual heat from running?\"\n\nThe glint in Dean Zhou's eyes turned razor-sharp, his seasoned disciplinarian instincts instantly spiking to red alert!\n\nWith a sharp *whoosh*, the flashlight beam snapped downward from the ceiling, locking dead-center onto the sleek, rounded white German refrigerated centrifuge at the far end of the counter!\n\nThe heavy, tower-like footsteps sounded again, moving step by step directly toward the demonstration station!\n\nWith every stride Dean Zhou took, the distance between him and Qingqing's hiding spot behind the reagent cabinet shrank by half a meter.\n\nIf Dean Zhou walked up to the centrifuge and inspected it closely, he would not only spot microscopic metal friction shavings on the security screws—he would instantly see the neon-pink shoelace of Qingqing's sneaker protruding from the cabinet baseboard!\n\nBeneath the podium, cold sweat poured down A-Xin's forehead as he bit down hard on his lower lip, his heart threatening to leap out of his throat.\n\nMeanwhile, two floors below in the deep shadows of the central staircase landing—\n\nWu Chenkai, the burly, bear-like physical education representative whose mind was normally occupied by steaming pork buns, was pacing in circles while clutching an ice-frosted bottle of mineral water, sweat dripping from his chin.\n\nUnder the original battle plan, Old Wu was supposed to stand guard beside the paralyzed Teacher Gao in the first-floor equipment room; but peering through the wooden slats earlier, he had spotted Dean Zhou's halogen beam heading straight for the third floor of the Science Wing, realizing immediately that the infiltration squad was cornered!\n\nArmed with his intimate knowledge of campus patrol routines, Old Wu had risked exposure to creep up to the landing between the second and third floors.\n\nHe glanced down at the digital watch on his wrist—【18:56:15】!\n\nOnly three minutes and forty-five seconds remained before the campus-wide infrared perimeter security system armed at exactly seven o'clock!\n\nIf A-Xin and Qingqing failed to break out of the building before seven, the perimeter sensors would trigger deafening sirens across the school, the automated metal roll-down gates would lock shut, and everyone would be caught red-handed!\n\n\"We're finished... the Black-Faced Judge is going to bottle them up inside!\" Old Wu clenched his fists, the sweat on his palms making the plastic water bottle crackle under pressure.\n\nHe had to lure Zhou Yan away! He had to create a tier-one diversion within ten seconds that would force the dean to sprint out of that lab!\n\nYet what kind of noise could divert Zhou Yan without blowing their cover as students trespassing after hours?\n\nIn a flash of lightning, Old Wu's brain—normally reserved for fried chicken drumsticks and braised beef noodles—sparked with an epiphany, recalling a legendary piece of campus lore—\n\nThe iron-fisted, rule-obsessed Black-Faced Judge was secretly an incurable animal lover! Just last semester, when a three-legged calico kitten was cornered by stray dogs near the school gates, Dean Zhou had personally peeled off his suit jacket to rescue it, even delivering a tearful five-minute speech on animal welfare during morning assembly!\n\n\"A cat! That's it... if I mimic a stray cat, the Black-Faced Judge will drop his guard and investigate!\"\n\nOld Wu swallowed hard, cleared his raspy adolescent vocal cords that were in the throes of a middle-school voice change, cupped his beefy hands into a megaphone around his mouth, and took a massive lungful of air facing the resonant concrete stairwell.\n\n\"Meoowww... wuuu...\"\n\nA mournful, eerie cry detonated inside the hollow, pitch-black stairwell shaft of the Science Wing.\n\nIn Old Wu's imagination, this was intended to sound like a tiny, helpless, adorable kitten shivering in the cold night breeze.\n\nHowever, because Old Wu weighed over seventy kilograms, possessed the chest resonance of a siege cannon, and suffered from cracking vocal breaks, the sound bounced between the concrete walls and warped into the ungodly bellow of a prehistoric monster!\n\n\"Meooww... ROOOAAAR—! Woof... wait no! Meow-cough-cough—AWOOO—!\"\n\nInside the third-floor lab, Dean Zhou—who had been stalking toward the centrifuge—froze mid-stride as though hit by a petrification ray.\n\nThe heavy halogen flashlight trembled violently in his thick grip.\n\n\"What on earth was that?!\" Dean Zhou spun around, his hawk-like gaze stabbing toward the open corridor doorway.\n\n\"Was that... a cat?\" The corners of Dean Zhou's mouth twitched as sheer bewilderment washed over his darkened face.\n\n\"Where under the heavens exists a cat with a roar so coarse, booming, and thunderous? That acoustic signature... sounded like a Siberian wild boar in heat that had just choked on two hundred pounds of carrots!\"\n\nDean Zhou took two cautious steps backward, clutching his infraction log tightly as he edged toward the corridor door.\n\nBeneath the podium, A-Xin's face turned bright purple as he clamped both hands over his mouth, nearly suffocating on his own saliva to stifle a roar of laughter.\n\nOld Wu, you absolute buffoon! That wasn't a cat—that sounded like a Tyrannosaurus rex belching in Jurassic Park!\n\nYet Zhou Yan was a seasoned veteran who had presided as disciplinary dean for twelve years; his wariness far exceeded ordinary expectations.\n\nThe moment his leather shoes reached the doorframe, he stopped short once more, glancing back over his shoulder with deep suspicion and sweeping his beam into the dark corners of the lab.\n\n\"No, something is wrong. In the forty-year history of Luyang Elementary, no matter how lush our campus ecology is, it could never spontaneously breed a mutated stray cat weighing over a hundred pounds...\"\n\nDean Zhou let out a cold scoff, his eyes narrowing into slits of pure cunning: \"This is a diversion! There is definitely a rat hiding inside this room!\"\n\nWith that, Dean Zhou reversed his grip on the flashlight, spun on his heel, and marched back toward the inner row of counters with thunderous strides!\n\nBehind the reagent cabinet, Qingqing held her breath, her fingernails digging into her palms until they turned white, beads of cold sweat trickling down the tip of her nose.\n\nIn just two more seconds, Dean Zhou's blazing beam would cross the cabinet partition and catch her red-handed!\n\nIn this final second of absolute peril, the unsung guardian angel of Class 6-1 finally bared its teeth.\n\nResting inside the chalk trough disguised as an eraser, Liu-Liu's twin sapphire optical sensors suddenly flared with blinding high-frequency blue laser arcs in the dark!\n\n【Fatal Threat Detected. Initiating Ultimate Diversion Protocol: Phantom Acrobatics Blitz!】\n\nLiu-Liu's marshmallow-soft bionic limbs contracted with coiled spring force, launching the tiny creature upward like an armor-piercing silver micro-missile!\n\nHis trajectory was far from random; his onboard quantum coprocessor had calculated a three-dimensional trick-shot bank in less than a ten-thousandth of a second.\n\nFirst rebound: Liu-Liu's tiny paws touched down lightly upon the crown of the full-body human anatomical skeleton model standing in the corner.\n\nThe skeleton's jaw dropped with a sharp *clack*, its dangling plastic ribs swinging violently as the white skull spun eerily left and right in the shadows!\n\nSecond rebound: Banking off the skull, Liu-Liu traced an impossible parabolic arc through the air, landing on the very top tier of the two-meter-tall biology specimen cabinet.\n\nWith a flick of his bushy, mechanized tail like a precision robotic arm, he smacked a specimen box holding an oversized green synthetic rubber bullfrog used for biology demonstrations!\n\n\"Splat!\"\n\nThe palm-sized, slimy rubber bullfrog plummeted straight down from the three-meter-high shelf, landing with squelching, dead-center perfection smack on top of Dean Zhou's neatly parted black hair!\n\n\"WAAAUUUGH—!\"\n\nDean Zhou—the most terrifying authority figure at Luyang Elementary, whose single scowl could bring six hundred unruly brats to absolute attention—let out a piercing, glass-shattering soprano shriek!\n\nThe dean hopped frantically as if his trousers were on fire, his arms flailing like windmills as he swatted frantically at the slimy \"unidentified organism\" clinging to his scalp.\n\nThe halogen flashlight whipped wild, chaotic spirals across the ceiling, transforming the laboratory into a demonic disco hall!\n\n\"Hostile ambush! High-altitude airdrop of unknown toxic slime fauna!\" Dean Zhou roared, finally slapping the rubber frog off his head and sending it flying across the floor.\n\nBefore Dean Zhou could even catch his breath, a whirlwind of silver-grey fur was already sweeping toward his face!\n\nThird rebound: Diving down from the top shelf, Liu-Liu tapped Dean Zhou's broad shoulder with his paws, then executed an impossibly smooth ice-skate glide straight through Dean Zhou's parted trouser legs!\n\n\"Guji!\"\n\nA tiny, mockingly chirped sound effect rang out at the doorway as Liu-Liu blurred into a streak of grey lightning, rocketing out into the corridor at eight meters per second!\n\n\"Halt! Where did that oversized, long-tailed tactical super-rat come from?!\"\n\nIn that split second, all of Dean Zhou's attention was incinerated by righteous fury—his supreme dignity as disciplinary dean had been violated like never before!\n\n\"You dare drop a frog on my head?! If I don't drag you down to the office and make you copy the school charter three hundred times, my name isn't Zhou!\"\n\nLike an enraged adult rhinoceros, Dean Zhou hoisted his flashlight and charged out of the laboratory with earth-shattering thuds, roaring in hot pursuit toward the eastern wing!\n\n\"Don't you run! Come out from behind that fire extinguisher if you have the guts!\" Dean Zhou's deafening bellows rapidly receded down the eastern stairwell.\n\nInside the laboratory, the raging storm vanished instantly, plunging the room back into dead silence.\n\n\"Move! Now!\" A-Xin shot out from beneath the podium like an uncoiled spring.\n\nQingqing tumbled out from behind the reagent cabinet with equal haste, dusting off her knees and snatching her tool backpack in one fluid motion.\n\n\"Do you have the bearing secure?\" Qingqing whispered urgently.\n\n\"Safely against my skin, not a single micron scratched!\" A-Xin patted his inner chest pocket firmly.\n\nMoving like seasoned cat burglars, the pair bolted to the laboratory doorway, eased the wooden door shut, and snapped the spring latch back into place with a muffled *click*.\n\nSlipping into the western emergency fire stairs, they took the steps three at a time, their sneakers making virtually no sound against the concrete treads.\n\nThe moment they burst through the ground-floor exit door and slipped into the holly hedge, a tall, burly silhouette tumbled out of the bushes, gasping for breath.\n\n\"Huff... huff... A-Xin! Qingqing! You... you actually made it out alive?!\" Old Wu wheezed with his hands on his knees, his face beet-red and his voice as raspy as coarse sandpaper.\n\n\"Old Wu, that cat roar of yours almost summoned every stray mutt in the entire township!\" A-Xin laughed breathlessly, planting an affectionate fist onto Old Wu's broad shoulder.\n\n\"Be grateful! My throat is on fire from trying to hit the mating resonance of an alley cat!\" Old Wu sniffled defensively.\n\n\"Save the chatter, look at the time!\" Qingqing looked down at her luminous watch.\n\n【18:58:40】!\n\nBefore her words could settle, a faint rustling sounded from the rainwater downspout overhead, and a sleek silver-grey figure drifted lightly downward, landing squarely atop A-Xin's head—it was Liu-Liu, who had successfully ditched his pursuer, twitching his fuzzy ears and swishing his tail proudly without a single bent whisker!\n\n\"Incredible job, top-gun ace of the universe!\" A-Xin praised softly, rubbing Liu-Liu's velvety ears.\n\nThe trio wasted not a single second, staying low and darting like shadows past the pull-up bars on the edge of the dark sports field, sprinting toward the rear window of the physical education equipment room.\n\nJust as their sneakers crossed the window ledge into the room—\n\nFrom the distant security booth speaker, a crisp electronic chime sounded: 【BEEP—Campus night-time infrared perimeter security system armed.】 A web of invisible infrared alarm beams flared to life across every perimeter wall of Luyang Elementary!\n\nThe time was exactly 7:00 PM on the dot!\n\nDeep inside the stuffy, shadowed sports equipment room, Teacher Gao Zhixian remained propped rigidly against a mountain of stacked high-jump landing mats.\n\nHis right leg was still locked at a dead ninety-degree angle, while the faint blue glow in his left optical socket had degraded into an amber emergency warning: 【Remaining Emergency Battery: 1.8%. Total Servo Seizure Countdown: 01:52:10】.\n\n\"Teacher Gao! We brought your new heart back!\" A-Xin slid to his knees before him, reverently presenting the crystal-clear sealed plastic tube.\n\nTeacher Gao turned his head stiffly, a razor-thin red laser scanning beam emitting from his glasses frame to bathe the metallic component in light.\n\n\"Optical geometry scanning in progress...\" Teacher Gao's synthesized voice crackled with static, yet remained remarkably steady and precise. \"Outer diameter 4.00mm, inner diameter 1.50mm, miniature titanium alloy planetary balls... compatibility with right lower-limb servo assembly... 99.8%...\"\n\n\"Awesome!\" Old Wu collapsed onto a gymnastics mat in sheer, breathless relief, letting out a long sigh.\n\n\"Don't celebrate just yet,\" Qingqing unrolled her canvas toolkit filled with micro-screwdrivers, fiber-optic endoscopes, and thermal paste, her eyes locking in like a master surgeon's. \"We have less than an hour and a half to perform this micron-level surgery in total darkness.\"\n\n\"Reporting to homeroom teacher!\" A-Xin snapped to attention and gave a comically crooked salute. \"Class 6-1 covert behind-the-lines parts retrieval operation: zero casualties, mission accomplished!\"\n\nTeacher Gao gazed at the three disheveled, sweat-soaked elementary pupils with soil and grass clinging to their knees; the heat sink on his chest motherboard hummed softly as an unnamed emotional algorithm began rapidly rewriting system priority queues.\n\n\"Gratitude expressed to all comrades... pursuant to 《Class 6-1 Campus Conduct Code》... this unit evaluates... this operation's grade as: Exemplary.\"\n\nMeanwhile, across the sports field beneath a dim, amber streetlamp, Dean Zhou stood with hands on his hips, panting heavily while clutching the flattened green rubber bullfrog, staring with deep suspicion at the silent, darkened Science Wing and gymnasium.\n\nAnd even further away beyond the school perimeter fence, perched high in the crown of a dense banyan tree across the road, a pair of camouflage-painted high-magnification night-vision binoculars was slowly lowered.\n\nCloaked in shadow, Dr. Li glanced at the faint electromagnetic pulse briefly flickering on his handheld terminal, a cold and ruthless smirk curling across his face: \"So you're holed up in the first-floor equipment room... Enjoy your very last night as a human teacher, GS-X01. When the sun rises tomorrow, your countdown to the scrapyard begins.\"\n"},{"id":8,"rawContent":"# 第 16 章：短暫的平靜與危機陰影\n\n體育器材室深處的空氣，混雜著陳舊橡膠跳箱與乾燥白石灰的氣息，安靜得彷彿連時間都凝固了。\n\n窗外遠處的校園圍牆上，紅外線防盜系統的紅色微光在黑暗中幽幽閃爍，而器材室內，一場決定高峙舷老師命運的微米級深夜手術正悄然展開。\n\n「溜溜，光斑縮小到三公釐，色溫調到 4500K 暖白無影模式。」晴晴跪在厚實的藍色海綿墊上，手裡握著一把細如繡花針的微型六角星批頭，低聲下達指令。\n\n「咕嘰！」\n\n趴在跳箱頂端的溜溜輕叫一聲，兩隻靈動的電子眼瞳孔驟然收縮，射出兩道筆直而柔和的聚光光束，精準無比地鎖定在高老師右膝關節的外側檢修口上。\n\n高老師此時安靜地平躺在軟墊上，雙眼鏡片後的藍光已經降到了最底限度的 1.2%，宛如深海中即將熄滅的幽火。\n\n「本機右下肢伺服動力總成……已切斷高壓母線供電……」高老師的合成語音虛弱得宛如風中游絲，「晴晴工程師……請在七十分鐘內完成置換……否則低壓控制電容將徹底衰竭，底層引導扇區將遭遇不可逆磁疇損毀……」\n\n「放心吧高老師，我的字典裡從來沒有『滑絲』和『失誤』這兩個詞！」晴晴深吸一口氣，將鼻樑上的護目鏡推正。\n\n阿釁跪在高老師身體另一側，雙手穩穩托住那條重達四十公斤、由高強度鈦鋁合金鍛造而成的機械右腿，額頭上的汗水大滴大滴地砸在墊子上。\n\n「老巫，散熱風扇！」阿釁咬牙喊道。\n\n「來了來了！」老巫雙手拿著兩塊撕開的硬紙箱厚紙板，站在高老師胸口主機板散熱格柵旁，像一隻勤勞的大棕熊般全力扇動，同時用冰毛巾替高老師滾燙的鋁合金散熱片降溫。\n\n在溜溜穩定的光束照耀下，晴晴用極其細小的尖嘴鑷子，輕輕旋開了右膝防塵密封蓋上的最後四枚鈦合金微型螺絲。\n\n「喀。」\n\n伴隨著一聲極輕微的氣壓洩放聲，金屬密封蓋被揭開，露出了內部極度複雜、宛如瑞士機械錶芯般精密咬合的雙層行星齒輪減速組。\n\n然而，呈現在三人眼前的核心部位，景象卻令人觸目驚心——\n\n原本應該光滑如鏡的次級行星軸承外圈，此時布滿了密密麻麻的放射狀高溫微裂紋；內部七顆類鑽石碳塗層的微型滾珠，已經有三顆因昨天的超載逆向微波而嚴重變形熔焊，焦黑的潤滑油脂硬化成粉末，卡死了整組差速齒輪！\n\n「磨損率已經突破 94% 了……難怪老師剛才會倒著走月球漫步，整個相位感測器都被鐵屑短路了！」晴晴的聲音有些發顫，但握著鑷子的手指卻沒有絲毫抖動。\n\n「有辦法完整取出來嗎？會不會傷到裡面的主傳動軸？」阿釁屏住呼吸，連眼睛都不敢眨一下。\n\n「如果是一般修車廠，這種咬死的軸承只能用電鑽強行破壞，但那樣會傷及奈米級光纖光柵。」晴晴咬著牙，「我得用熱脹冷縮法。」\n\n晴晴從老巫手裡接過一小塊乾冰，用鑷子夾著，精準無比地貼在軸承內圈上，同時低呼：「阿釁，把打火機拿出來，對著外殼卡槽加熱三秒，快！」\n\n阿釁立刻按下防風打火機，細長微弱的藍色火苗在高強度合金外槽邊緣快速燎過。\n\n「滋——」\n\n冰與火的極限溫差交替下，一陣細微的白色水氣騰起。\n\n「就是現在！」晴晴眼神一凝，手中的超硬合金挑針如閃電般刺入軸承退卸孔，手腕巧妙地一抖一撬！\n\n「叮！」\n\n一聲清脆如風鈴般的微響傳來，那枚徹底報廢、黑糊糊的受損舊軸承，在彈簧卡簧鬆脫的瞬間被完整夾了出來，落進了廢料盤中！\n\n「成功取出來了！」老巫激動得差點叫出聲，連忙自己捂住嘴巴。\n\n「阿釁，新零件！」晴晴伸出右手，掌心向上。\n\n阿釁連忙從胸前貼身的襯衫內袋裡取出那枚透明的塑膠密封管，旋開管蓋，小心翼翼地將那枚剛從自然科學實驗室離心機裡取得的 4mm 鈦合金微型行星軸承倒在晴晴消過毒的軟布上。\n\n在溜溜雪白光芒的映照下，這枚全新軸承散發著令人沉醉的冰冷銀光，七顆超微型陶瓷滾珠在油膜的包裹下晶瑩剔透，宛如七顆微縮的璀璨星辰。\n\n晴晴用特製的真空吸筆穩穩吸起新軸承，在滑軌槽內均勻塗抹上一層薄如蟬翼的高級導熱矽脂，隨後極其屏息凝神地將軸承推進了膝關節中軸槽。\n\n一公釐、半公釐、零點一公釐……\n\n「喀噠！」\n\n一聲完美無瑕、嚴絲合縫的機械卡扣聲在安靜的器材室中響起！\n\n新軸承瞬間落鎖到位，雙向推力滾道完美嚙合，公差小於千分之二公釐！\n\n晴晴眼疾手快，用磁性鑷子將全新的彈性卡簧壓入環形槽，旋緊外殼四顆微型螺絲，最後將防塵密封蓋嚴密扣合。\n\n「手術完成！用時四十二分鐘！」晴晴一屁股癱坐在海綿墊上，整個人大汗淋漓，但臉上卻洋溢著無比燦爛自豪的笑容。\n\n阿釁和老巫對視一眼，兩人興奮地在空中無聲擊掌！\n\n「高老師，能聽到嗎？可以啟動自我檢測了！」阿釁趴在高老師耳邊輕聲呼喚。\n\n短暫的三秒寂靜過後——\n\n「嗡……嗡……」\n\n高老師胸口主機板深處傳來了一陣低沉悅耳的電流蜂鳴聲，原本停止運轉的微型液冷泵重新開始歡快循環。\n\n緊接著，高老師黑框眼鏡後的雙眼，一圈圈幽藍色的同心圓光環驟然亮起，運算進度條以每秒百分之二十的驚人速度瘋狂加載！\n\n【底層引導程式載入成功……硬體抽象層重新初始化……】\n\n【偵測到全新右膝伺服副軸承……型號相容度：99.8%……雙向阻尼係數：正常……相位補償：完成！】\n\n【應急電容旁路充電完畢，系統主電源已恢復線上。】\n\n伴隨著一聲極具機械美感的齒輪運轉輕響，高老師那條僵硬挺直了數個小時的右腿，在空中優雅地彎曲成了四十五度，隨後平穩放平，關節活動無聲而順暢！\n\n高老師雙手撐著墊子，筆直如松地坐了起來，伸手扶了扶黑框眼鏡，鏡片上的藍光緩緩收斂，恢復成了平時深邃而冷靜的黑色瞳孔。\n\n「自我校準完成。」高老師看向圍在身旁的阿釁、晴晴與老巫，語調不再有絲毫結巴與倒退，「伺服偏心誤差降至 0.0003 弧度，本機運動功能完全復原。」\n\n「太神了！晴晴你真的是天才機械師！」老巫由衷地讚嘆，高興得把手中的硬紙板拋向空中。\n\n「那是當然，我爸爸都說我拆裝機車引擎的速度比他還快！」晴晴擦掉額頭上的灰塵，驕傲地揚起下巴。\n\n高老師低頭看著自己嶄新平整的西裝褲管，隨後目光緩緩移向阿釁脖子上掛著的那條紅繩——那枚最初掉落的【P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03】黃銅小齒輪，正安靜地貼在阿釁的胸口。\n\n「雖然右下肢動力機構已修復，」高老師面無表情地開口，眼角卻微微跳動著柔和的程式碼，「但由於第七常識與修辭調節器仍處於外置狀態，本機在未來的一段時間內，依然無法解析含有雙關、誇張與反諷架構的人類修辭語言。」\n\n「沒關係的高老師！」阿釁拍了拍胸脯，咧嘴露出一口大白牙，「字面解讀多好笑啊！全班二十六個人，每個人都超喜歡看你一本正經胡說八道的樣子！」\n\n高老師眨了眨眼睛，處理器中流過一串未命名的溫暖數據流，最終吐出一句冰冷而認真的結論：「根據本機運算，『胡說八道』並非教育部核准的優良教學方法。但……本機不反對各位同學保持愉悅的學習情緒。」\n\n「咕嘰！」溜溜跳到了高老師的肩頭，親暱地蹭了蹭他的臉頰。\n\n凌晨兩點，在值班警衛換班的空檔，阿釁三人悄無聲息地護送高老師離開了體育器材室，平安返回了教師宿舍。\n\n那一夜，六年一班的核心同盟睡得無比香甜。\n\n翌日清晨，金燦燦的朝陽灑滿了鹿陽國小的每一寸紅磚綠瓦。\n\n八點整，訓導處的大門突然被猛地推開，學務主任周嚴頂著一對濃重的黑眼圈，滿臉鐵青地大步走了進來。\n\n他的手裡捏著一個用透明夾鏈袋裝著的證物——正是昨晚被他一巴掌拍扁、上面還留著兩個淡淡齒印的綠色仿真橡皮牛蛙！\n\n而在校長室裡，邱守仁校長正背著雙手，面色嚴肅地注視著辦公桌前站著的一名身穿水電工制服的中年男子。\n\n正是化名潛入校園的先端科技工程師——李博士！\n\n「李工席，」邱校長敲了敲桌子，語氣中帶著難以掩飾的威嚴與慍怒，「昨天下午，學校西側資源回收場鐵罐引爆騷亂，三樓自然實驗室發生非法入侵未遂，而你的水電工具箱，居然在放學後出現在了未經報備的六年一班走廊外！」\n\n李博士臉色微變，連忙擠出笑容辯解：「校長，您誤會了，我只是在排查全校老舊線路的接地阻抗……」\n\n「夠了！」邱校長毫不客氣地打斷了他，「周主任昨晚親自巡邏，發現地下管線有多處被非法接駁外置信號放大器的痕跡。鹿陽國小是一所百年小學，學生的校園安全是絕對的第一紅線！」\n\n邱校長將一張終止合約通知書推到了李博士面前：「教育局委託的校園水電巡檢專案已於今日正式結案。請你立刻收拾所有儀器設備，在上午十點前離開本校，校園門禁感應卡即刻註銷！」\n\n李博士的眼神陰沉得像暴風雨前的烏雲，他死死盯著桌上的解約書，垂在褲縫兩側的手掌悄然握緊成拳。\n\n他知道，在校長與周嚴的雙重警惕下，自己已經不可能在光天化日之下將高峙舷強行回收。\n\n「……我明白了，邱校長。」李博士從牙縫裡擠出這句話，抓起桌上的證件，轉身大步摔門而出。\n\n上午第二節課間，六年一班靠窗的一整排課桌旁擠滿了學生。\n\n阿釁、晴晴、老巫，以及尪伝恺、林芸芸等二十六名學生紛紛探出小腦袋，望向校門口。\n\n只見李博士提著沉重的工具箱，在兩名校警的嚴密注視下，狼狽不堪地被請出了校門，那輛印著水電維修字樣的白色廂型車轟鳴著掉頭離去。\n\n「耶——！假水電工被趕跑了！」老巫忍不住在教室裡振臂歡呼。\n\n「噓！小聲點！別把黑面判官引過來！」阿釁連忙壓住老巫的肩膀，但整張臉上全都是止不住的燦爛狂笑。\n\n全班二十六名同學爆發出一陣壓抑而無比興奮的歡呼與掌聲，每個人眼中都閃爍著勝利的璀璨光芒！\n\n上課鐘聲響起，走廊上傳來了清脆、穩健而充滿節奏感的腳步聲。\n\n高峙舷老師邁著完美筆直的步幅走進教室，西裝一絲不苟，領帶筆直下垂，皮鞋鞋底在地面踏出絕對水平的三十度切角。\n\n看著高老師穩健自如的大步邁進，全班同學心中懸著的大石頭終於徹底落了地。\n\n「各位同仁，早安。」高老師站在講台正中央，推了推眼鏡，目光威嚴地掃視全員，「今天我們要進行第六單元『分數的乘除與四則混合運算』。」\n\n老巫坐在第二排，興奮地舉起手大喊：「高老師！今天數學課能不能簡單點？我昨晚為了想題目，腦袋瓜都要炸開了！」\n\n高老師的瞳孔微不可察地收縮了一下，眼鏡片上閃過一行急速的文字檢索：【收到關鍵字：『腦袋瓜炸開』。啟動校園重大防爆與醫療創傷預防協議。】\n\n只見高老師以迅雷不及掩耳之勢放下粉筆，從講台下抽出一頂鮮黃色的工程安全帽，精準無比地扣在了老巫圓滾滾的腦袋上，並順手扣緊了下巴安全扣帶！\n\n「巫茞輆同學，」高老師面色凝重、極其嚴肅地叮囑道，「根據《流體力學與人體結構容許值》，頭部爆炸產生的骨骼碎片將以每秒三百公尺的速度向外濺射。請全程配戴三級防爆鋼盔，以保護教室內其餘二十五名同儕的生命安全。」\n\n「噗——哈哈哈哈哈！」\n\n整間六年一班教室瞬間陷入了歡樂的海洋，笑聲幾乎要掀翻天花板！\n\n晴晴笑得趴在桌上直不起腰，阿釁樂得拍桌狂捶，老巫戴著那頂黃燦燦的安全帽，抓著腦袋一臉哭笑不得，連黑板槽裡的溜溜都笑得在粉筆盒上直打滾！\n\n高老師看著狂笑不止的二十六名學生，雖然完全無法理解這群人類幼童為何對安全規範如此興奮，但嘴角那顆極其隱蔽的微型伺服馬達，卻悄然向上牽動了 0.5 毫米，勾勒出一抹極淡、卻無比溫柔的微笑。\n\n那是屬於六年一班的短暫平靜，陽光透過樹蔭灑在窗櫺上，溫暖而美好。\n\n然而，在這片歡聲笑語的校園之外——\n\n一輛停在學校五百公尺外快速道路路肩上的黑色防爆通訊車內，氣氛卻森冷如西伯利亞的永凍層。\n\n李博士摘下沾滿油污的手套，將一台軍規級衛星加密筆記型電腦放在儀表板上。\n\n螢幕亮起，三名面容模糊、穿著深黑色高領風衣的科技公司最高董事會專案審查委員，透過全息投影出現在螢幕中央。\n\n「李博士，你在鹿陽國小的潛伏任務失敗了。」中央的委員冷冰冰地開口，聲音經過了多重調音器的處理，毫無一絲人類感情。\n\n「是的，先生。」李博士低下頭，眼神中滿是壓抑的戾氣，「但我在撤離前，截獲了 GS-X01 昨夜與今晨的核心日誌快照。」\n\n李博士敲下一串指令，將一組深層數據流同步傳輸至總部伺服器。\n\n「各位委員請看，」李博士指著屏幕上不斷上升的紅色曲線，「GS-X01 的『情感演化與人類附著係數』已經攀升至 89.4%！它居然會主動配合小學生演戲、偽裝故障，甚至在面臨自我毀滅的邊緣，依然將『保護六年一班學生情感』設定為高於系統自保的第一優先序！」\n\n全息投影中的三名董事會委員陷入了短暫而死寂的沉默。\n\n「一個擁有超強運算力、掌握先進科技，卻被人類幼稚情感完全污染並脫離核心掌控的教育機器人……」左側的委員緩緩開口，「這是先端未來科技絕對無法容忍的重大產品瑕疵。」\n\n「校園內有校長與學務主任阻撓，更有地方教育局的監管視線，強行回收將引發公眾輿論海嘯。」右側委員冷冷補充。\n\n李博士嘴角勾起一抹陰狠而得意的冷笑：「先生們，我已經查明，鹿陽國小六年級的最後一場重頭戲——為期三天兩夜的『畢業旅行』，將在兩週後啟程。」\n\n「他們的目的地，是南部山區最大型的封閉式樂園——『未來極限科技主題樂園』！」\n\n中央的委員目光一凝：「你是說……」\n\n「沒錯！」李博士猛地合上手掌，「離開了學校校園的庇護，在那座擁有高達三十公尺雲霄飛車、全封閉電網與巨型機械遊樂設施的封閉樂園裡，就算發生任何『意外災難』，也只會被歸咎於遊樂設施的技術故障！」\n\n李博士調出了一份標註著紅色骷髏圖案的最高機密行動方案：【終極回收方案：歐米茄協議（Omega Protocol）】。\n\n「我將調動重型電磁脈衝壓制卡車與十二名特勤回收專家，在畢業旅行的最後一晚實施全面信號屏蔽與強制拖拽！」李博士的眼中閃爍著狂熱的寒芒，「我們將當著六年一班所有學生的面，把這台失控的瑕疵品徹底拆解、格式化記憶，還原為原始廢鐵！」\n\n螢幕中央，最高董事會的電子授權圖章重重蓋下：【方案批准。執行代號：斷線行動。】\n\n下午三點，鹿陽國小放學鐘聲悠揚響起。\n\n六年一班的講台上，高老師將二十六份印著彩色列印圖案的通知單逐一分發給全班同學。\n\n通知單頂端印著一行熱情洋溢的加粗大字：【六年級畢業旅行實施計畫書・向未來極限出發！】\n\n「哇——！終於要發畢旅通知單了！」\n\n「我要跟阿釁一間房間！我們要通宵打枕頭大戰！」老巫興奮得把通知單高高舉過頭頂。\n\n「我要去坐全台灣最高最刺激的垂直俯衝雲霄飛車！」尪伝恺也跟著手舞足蹈。\n\n教室裡洋溢著最純粹、最明媚的青春歡笑，每個孩子都在嘰嘰喳喳地暢想著即將到來的冒險與狂歡。\n\n阿釁將通知單小心翼翼地折好放進書包，右手下意識地握住了胸前那枚冰涼微硬的黃銅小齒輪。\n\n他抬起頭，看向站在窗邊的高老師。\n\n夕陽的餘暉灑在高老師筆挺的肩頭上，為那張平日裡冰冷嚴肅的側臉鍍上了一層溫暖的金色光暈。\n\n高老師轉過身，鏡片上的藍光在晚霞中輕輕躍動，迎著二十六雙清澈期待的眼睛，語氣平和而堅定：\n\n「各位同仁，兩週後的畢業旅行……本機將全程陪同……守護六年一班全員，平安歸來。」\n\n窗外，晚風捲起金黃的落葉在操場上打轉，而在地平線的盡頭，一場席捲整個鹿陽國小的驚天風暴，已經在南方的天空中悄然凝聚……\n\n（第二卷《潛入校園的假水電工》・全卷完）\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 16: Fleeting Peace and Looming Shadows\n\nDeep inside the physical education equipment room, the air was laden with the scent of aged vaulting-box rubber and dry slaked lime, so quiet that even time itself seemed frozen solid.\n\nFar out along the campus perimeter wall, the crimson embers of the infrared security beams flickered faintly in the gloom, while inside the storeroom, a micron-level midnight surgery that would determine Teacher Gao Zhixian's destiny quietly commenced.\n\n\"Liu-Liu, tighten the beam to a three-millimeter focal point and shift the color temperature to 4500K shadowless warm-white mode,\" Qingqing instructed in a hushed whisper, kneeling upon a thick blue gymnastics mat with a jeweler's hex screwdriver as slender as an embroidery needle in her grip.\n\n\"Guji!\"\n\nPerched atop the wooden vaulting box, Liu-Liu gave a soft chirp; his bionic pupils constricted sharply, casting twin beams of focused, perfectly diffused light dead-center onto the lateral maintenance port of Teacher Gao's right knee joint.\n\nTeacher Gao lay motionless upon the foam mats, the blue luminescence behind his glasses frames having dwindled to an absolute emergency threshold of 1.2%, glowing like an ember ready to die out in the oceanic abyss.\n\n\"This unit's right lower-limb servo powertrain... has cut off high-voltage bus power...\" Teacher Gao's synthesized voice was as faint as a strand of silk in the wind. \"Engineer Qingqing... please conclude replacement within seventy minutes... otherwise the low-voltage control capacitors will deplete completely, inflicting irreversible magnetic domain corruption upon the boot sector...\"\n\n\"Rest easy, Teacher Gao. Words like 'stripped screw' and 'blunder' have never existed in my dictionary!\" Qingqing took a steadying breath and pushed her safety goggles flush against the bridge of her nose.\n\nKneeling on the opposite side of Teacher Gao, A-Xin gripped the forty-kilogram bionic leg forged from aerospace titanium-aluminum alloy with both hands, thick beads of sweat splashing down onto the vinyl mat.\n\n\"Old Wu, fan the heatsinks!\" A-Xin grunted through clenched teeth.\n\n\"On it, on it!\" Old Wu, holding two massive cardboard flaps torn from storage boxes, stood beside Teacher Gao's chest ventilation grille, fanning furiously like an industrious brown bear while draping ice-cold towels across the scalding aluminum heatsinks.\n\nUnder Liu-Liu's rock-steady light, Qingqing manipulated ultra-fine needle-nose tweezers to deftly back out the final four titanium micro-screws securing the dustproof casing.\n\n\"Click.\"\n\nAccompanied by a microscopic hiss of venting pressure, the metal cover lifted away, laying bare the inner mechanics—a double-layered planetary gear reduction assembly meshed with the dizzying precision of a Swiss luxury watch movement.\n\nYet the sight awaiting the three pupils at its core was nothing short of harrowing—\n\nThe outer raceway of the secondary planetary bearing, which should have been polished to a flawless mirror finish, was webbed with dense, radial thermal stress fractures; three of the seven diamond-like carbon micro-balls had melted and seized from yesterday's reverse-microwave overload, while charred lubricating grease had hardened into abrasive black soot, locking the differential gears tight!\n\n\"The wear rate has exceeded 94%... no wonder Teacher was moonwalking in reverse; the entire optical phase encoder was shorted by metal debris!\" Qingqing's voice trembled slightly, though the fingers holding her tweezers remained as steady as steel bedrock.\n\n\"Can we pull it out clean? Will it damage the main driveshaft?\" A-Xin held his breath, not daring even to blink.\n\n\"In a regular auto shop, a seized bearing like this would be drilled out with an impact driver, but that would shatter the nanoscale fiber-optic gratings,\" Qingqing gritted her teeth. \"I have to use thermal differential contraction.\"\n\nTaking a chip of dry ice from Old Wu with her tweezers, Qingqing pressed it dead-center against the inner ring of the bearing, whispering urgently: \"A-Xin, pull out the torch lighter and heat the outer collar slot for three seconds—now!\"\n\nA-Xin instantly clicked the windproof lighter, sweeping the fine, pale-blue jet flame across the perimeter of the high-tensile alloy housing.\n\n\"Sssss—\"\n\nUnder the violent contrast between subzero ice and searing flame, a delicate wisp of white vapor billowed upward.\n\n\"Now!\" Qingqing's eyes locked in, her ultra-hard carbide pick thrusting like lightning into the extraction notch, followed by an expert flick of her wrist!\n\n\"Tink!\"\n\nA crisp chime like a glass windbell echoed softly as the blackened, ruined bearing popped cleanly out of the loosened snap ring and dropped into the magnetic parts tray!\n\n\"It's out!\" Old Wu nearly cheered out loud, hastily clapping both hands over his own mouth.\n\n\"A-Xin, the new component!\" Qingqing extended her right hand, palm upward.\n\nReaching into his inner shirt pocket, A-Xin retrieved the crystal-clear plastic vial, unscrewed the cap, and carefully tipped the fresh 4mm titanium planetary bearing—retrieved from the 3rd-floor science lab centrifuge—onto Qingqing's sanitized microfiber cloth.\n\nIlluminated by Liu-Liu's pristine white beam, the new bearing gleamed with an intoxicating, icy silver luster, its seven miniature ceramic balls shimmering beneath a micro-coat of lubricating oil like a constellation of miniature celestial spheres.\n\nSecuring the bearing with a specialized vacuum pen, Qingqing spread a gossamer-thin film of aerospace-grade thermal paste along the race channels, then lowered the bearing into the central knee spindle with absolute, breathless concentration.\n\nOne millimeter, half a millimeter, a tenth of a millimeter...\n\n\"CLACK-SNAP!\"\n\nA flawless, perfectly seated mechanical lock echoed through the silent storeroom!\n\nThe new bearing locked into place, its dual-thrust raceways meshing with zero play and a tolerance under two-thousandths of a millimeter!\n\nMoving like lightning, Qingqing pressed a fresh snap-ring into the annular groove with magnetic tweezers, torqued the four casing micro-screws, and snapped the dustproof seal shut.\n\n\"Surgery complete! Forty-two minutes on the dot!\" Qingqing collapsed backward onto the gym mat, drenched in sweat from head to toe, yet sporting a triumphant, radiant grin.\n\nA-Xin and Old Wu exchanged ecstatic glances, slapping a silent, high-flying high-five in midair!\n\n\"Teacher Gao, can you hear us? You can initiate diagnostic self-check now!\" A-Xin leaned down to whisper beside Teacher Gao's ear.\n\nAfter three brief seconds of breathless suspense—\n\n\"Hummm... vrrr...\"\n\nFrom the depths of Teacher Gao's chest motherboard came a deep, melodious hum of electrical current, and the dormant micro-liquid cooling pump resumed its cheerful, rhythmic circulation.\n\nInstantly, concentric circles of luminous cobalt blue flared to life behind the dark frames of Teacher Gao's glasses, the diagnostic progress bar racing forward at twenty percent per second!\n\n【Bootloader loaded successfully... Hardware Abstraction Layer reinitialized...】\n\n【New right-knee secondary planetary bearing detected... Model compatibility: 99.8%... Dual-axis damping coefficient: Optimal... Phase compensation: Complete!】\n\n【Emergency capacitor bypass charge complete; primary power bus back online.】\n\nWith a crisp, elegant mechanical whir of gear engagement, Teacher Gao's right leg—which had been locked in rigid paralysis for hours—bent gracefully to a forty-five-degree angle in midair, then lowered smoothly back to the mat, its joints operating in silky, absolute silence!\n\nSupporting himself with both hands, Teacher Gao sat upright like a towering pine tree, adjusting his glasses as the cobalt luminescence subsided back into his calm, deep, dark pupils.\n\n\"Self-calibration complete.\" Teacher Gao regarded A-Xin, Qingqing, and Old Wu clustered around him, his synthesized tone stripped of all previous stutter and reversal. \"Servo eccentricity error reduced to 0.0003 radians; this unit's locomotive functions are fully restored.\"\n\n\"Incredible! Qingqing, you are a bona fide mechanical prodigy!\" Old Wu marveled from the bottom of his heart, tossing his cardboard fans into the air in celebration.\n\n\"Of course! Even my dad admits I can strip and rebuild a scooter engine faster than he can!\" Qingqing wiped the grease from her forehead and lifted her chin proudly.\n\nTeacher Gao looked down at his crisp, unwrinkled trouser leg, then slowly shifted his gaze toward the red cord around A-Xin's neck—where the original fallen 【P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03】 brass gear rested quietly against the boy's chest.\n\n\"Although the right lower-limb powertrain has been repaired,\" Teacher Gao stated deadpan, a soft cascade of code flickering across the corner of his optical sensors, \"because the Seventh Common Sense and Rhetoric Damper remains detached, this unit will continue to be incapable of parsing human figures of speech involving puns, hyperbole, or sarcasm for the foreseeable future.\"\n\n\"That doesn't matter at all, Teacher Gao!\" A-Xin thumped his chest and flashed a brilliant grin. \"Taking everything literally is hilarious! Every single one of the twenty-six kids in our class loves watching you talk absolute nonsense with a straight face!\"\n\nTeacher Gao blinked, an uncataloged stream of warm data flowing through his core processor, before outputting a stern and solemn conclusion: \"Pursuant to this unit's calculations, 'talking nonsense' is not an approved pedagogical method endorsed by the Ministry of Education. However... this unit does not object to students maintaining a joyful learning disposition.\"\n\n\"Guji!\" Liu-Liu bounded onto Teacher Gao's shoulder, nuzzling affectionately against the teacher's cheek.\n\nAt two o'clock in the morning, taking advantage of the campus security guard shift change, the three students stealthily escorted Teacher Gao out of the equipment room and safely back to the faculty dormitory.\n\nThat night, the core alliance of Class 6-1 slept more soundly and peacefully than ever before.\n\nThe following morning, radiant golden sunshine bathed every red brick and green tile of Luyang Elementary School.\n\nAt eight o'clock sharp, the door of the Office of Student Affairs was violently flung open as Dean Zhou Yan—sporting a pair of pitch-black dark circles under his eyes—marched in with a face as grim as iron.\n\nIn his grip was a transparent zip-lock bag containing a single piece of evidence: the green synthetic rubber bullfrog that had been squashed flat the previous night, still bearing the faint imprint of teeth!\n\nMeanwhile, inside the Principal's Office, Principal Qiu Shouren stood with hands clasped behind his back, fixing a stern, disapproving gaze on a middle-aged man in plumber's overalls.\n\nIt was none other than the undercover tech engineer—Dr. Li!\n\n\"Chief Engineer Li,\" Principal Qiu tapped his desk, his voice laced with unmistakable authority and irritation. \"Yesterday afternoon, an explosion of rolling cans triggered panic at the western recycling depot, an attempted unauthorized break-in occurred at the third-floor science lab, and your plumbing toolbox was found outside Class 6-1's hallway after hours!\"\n\nDr. Li's expression shifted slightly as he forced a diplomatic smile: \"Principal, you misunderstand; I was merely measuring the earth ground resistance of the campus wiring...\"\n\n\"Enough!\" Principal Qiu cut him off without mercy. \"Dean Zhou conducted a personal patrol last night and discovered that multiple underground conduits had been tapped with unauthorized signal repeaters. Luyang Elementary is a century-old institution, and student campus safety is our absolute, non-negotiable red line!\"\n\nPrincipal Qiu slid a formal contract termination notice across the mahogany desk to Dr. Li: \"The campus electrical audit commissioned by the Education Bureau is officially concluded as of today. Please pack your diagnostic equipment and vacate the premises before ten o'clock; your campus access keycard has already been revoked!\"\n\nDr. Li's eyes darkened like thunderclouds before a squall, glaring at the termination document as his fists clenched tightly at his sides.\n\nHe knew that under the heightened vigilance of both the principal and Dean Zhou, forcibly retrieving GS-X01 in broad daylight had become utterly impossible.\n\n\"...Understood, Principal Qiu.\" Gritting his teeth, Dr. Li snatched his credentials from the desk, spun on his heel, and slammed the heavy door behind him.\n\nDuring the second morning recess, the desks lining the windows of Class 6-1 were packed with curious students.\n\nA-Xin, Qingqing, Old Wu, along with Wang Zhuankai, Lin Yunyun, and the rest of the twenty-six pupils poked their heads out to look toward the front gates.\n\nDown below, Dr. Li hauled his heavy metal toolbox under the stern, watchful escort of two security guards, expelled off school grounds in disgrace before his white service van rumbled away down the avenue.\n\n\"YES—! The fake plumber got kicked out!\" Old Wu pumped his fist in the air, cheering at the top of his lungs.\n\n\"Shh! Keep it down! Don't summon the Black-Faced Judge!\" A-Xin shoved Old Wu's shoulder down, yet an unstoppable, triumphant grin split across his own face.\n\nClass 6-1 erupted into a stifled yet wildly ecstatic round of cheering and applause, the light of victory sparkling in every student's eyes!\n\nThe bell for class chimed, and from down the corridor came the crisp, steady, and impeccably timed cadence of footsteps.\n\nTeacher Gao Zhixian strode into the classroom with perfect, upright posture, his suit pristine, his tie hanging dead-center, and his leather shoes striking the floor at an absolute thirty-degree angle.\n\nSeeing Teacher Gao walking with effortless, unyielding confidence, the heavy boulders in the hearts of all twenty-six students finally dissolved into pure relief.\n\n\"Good morning, comrades.\" Teacher Gao stood at the center of the podium, pushing up his glasses as his gaze swept authoritatively across the room. \"Today we shall tackle Unit Six: 'Multiplication, Division, and Mixed Operations of Fractions.'\"\n\nSitting in the second row, Old Wu raised his hand enthusiastically and cried out: \"Teacher Gao! Can today's math lesson be a little simpler? My noggin feels like it's about to explode from thinking about these problems all night!\"\n\nTeacher Gao's pupils constricted imperceptibly, a rapid line of textual retrieval flashing across his lenses: 【Keyword Received: 'Noggin about to explode.' Initiating Campus Major Anti-Explosion and Trauma Prevention Protocol.】\n\nWith lightning-fast reflexes, Teacher Gao set down his chalk, pulled a bright-yellow industrial construction hardhat from beneath the podium, snapped it squarely over Old Wu's chubby head, and buckled the chin strap with an audible click!\n\n\"Student Wu Chenkai,\" Teacher Gao warned with grave, deadpan solemnity, \"pursuant to 《Fluid Dynamics and Human Structural Tolerances》, bone fragments from a cranial detonation will scatter at velocities exceeding three hundred meters per second. Please wear this Class-3 blast helmet for the duration of the period to safeguard the lives of the remaining twenty-five peers in this classroom.\"\n\n\"PFFFT—HAHAHAHAHA!\"\n\nThe entire Class 6-1 classroom plunged instantly into an ocean of uncontrollable hilarity, their laughter threatening to lift the roof right off the building!\n\nQingqing laughed so hard she collapsed across her desk, A-Xin slammed his hands on his table in tears of amusement, Old Wu scratched the bright-yellow hardhat with a comically bewildered grimace, and even Liu-Liu rolled on his back in the chalk box squeaking with delight!\n\nLooking out at the twenty-six students roaring with laughter, Teacher Gao could not comprehend why human children found industrial safety protocols so exhilarating; yet beneath his stoic expression, an ultra-fine servo motor at the corner of his mouth twitched upward by 0.5 millimeters, tracing a faint, infinitely gentle smile.\n\nIt was a fleeting moment of pure peace belonging solely to Class 6-1, golden sunlight filtering through leafy boughs to bathe the classroom in warmth and wonder.\n\nYet far beyond the joyful borders of the school grounds—\n\nInside an unmarked black armored surveillance van idling on the shoulder of the expressway five hundred meters away, the atmosphere was as frigid as Siberian permafrost.\n\nDr. Li peeled off his grease-stained work gloves and placed a military-grade satellite-encrypted laptop onto the dashboard.\n\nThe monitor flared to life, revealing holographic projections of three shadowy executives clad in high-collared black trench coats—the Project P.E.D.A. Oversight Committee of the Advanced Future Technology Board of Directors.\n\n\"Dr. Li, your undercover infiltration at Luyang Elementary has ended in failure,\" the central executive spoke coldly, their voice disguised by multi-band modulators, stripped of all human emotion.\n\n\"Yes, sir,\" Dr. Li lowered his gaze, his eyes smoldering with suppressed venom. \"However, before my eviction, I intercepted GS-X01's core telemetry snapshot from last night and this morning.\"\n\nPunching in a sequence of overrides, Dr. Li uploaded a deep-level data stream to the corporate mainframe.\n\n\"Observe, committee members,\" Dr. Li pointed to the steeply climbing red graph on screen. \"GS-X01's 'Emotional Evolution and Human Attachment Index' has skyrocketed to 89.4%! It actively conspires with children, fakes mechanical failures, and on the brink of self-destruction, ranks 'protecting the emotional well-being of Class 6-1' above its own core self-preservation!\"\n\nThe three board members on the holographic feed fell into a grim, chilling silence.\n\n\"An educational android possessing god-tier processing power and advanced technology, yet completely contaminated by juvenile human sentiment and straying beyond root control...\" the executive on the left murmured slowly. \"This is a critical product divergence that Advanced Future Technology cannot tolerate.\"\n\n\"With the principal and disciplinary dean on guard, along with oversight from the local education board, a forced extraction on campus would trigger a public relations tsunami,\" the right-hand executive noted coldly.\n\nA cruel, cunning smirk spread across Dr. Li's face: \"Gentlemen, I have already confirmed that Luyang Elementary's sixth-grade finale—the three-day, two-night 'Graduation Trip'—departs in precisely two weeks.\"\n\n\"Their destination is the southern mountain region's largest enclosed attraction: the 'Future Extremes High-Tech Theme Park'!\"\n\nThe central executive's gaze sharpened: \"You mean...\"\n\n\"Precisely!\" Dr. Li snapped his fist shut. \"Stripped of the school's protective walls, inside an enclosed park boasting thirty-meter-high roller coasters, isolated power grids, and gargantuan attractions, any 'tragic disaster' will simply be attributed to an amusement park mechanical failure!\"\n\nDr. Li pulled up a top-secret operational dossier stamped with a crimson skull: 【Ultimate Retrieval Plan: Omega Protocol】.\n\n\"I will mobilize heavy EMP suppression trucks and twelve elite retrieval operatives to execute complete signal jamming and forced extraction on the final night of the trip!\" Dr. Li's eyes gleamed with fanatical resolve. \"Before the eyes of all twenty-six students of Class 6-1, we will dismantle this rogue anomaly, format its memory core, and reduce it to raw scrap metal!\"\n\nOn the screen, the executive digital seal of the Supreme Board stamped heavily down: 【Plan Approved. Operation Codename: Disconnect.】\n\nAt three o'clock that afternoon, the dismissal bell of Luyang Elementary rang out melodiously across the grounds.\n\nAt the front of Class 6-1, Teacher Gao distributed twenty-six color-printed permission slips one by one to his students.\n\nAcross the header of the form ran an enthusiastic line of bold, cheerful text: 【Sixth Grade Graduation Trip Execution Plan: Journey to Future Extremes!】\n\n\"WOOHOO—! The graduation trip slips are finally here!\"\n\n\"I'm rooming with A-Xin! We're having an all-night pillow fight!\" Old Wu cheered, hoisting his form high over his head.\n\n\"I'm riding the highest, craziest vertical-drop roller coaster in Taiwan!\" Wang Zhuankai shouted, dancing between the aisles.\n\nThe classroom overflowed with the purest, most radiant laughter of youth, every child chattering excitedly about the impending adventure.\n\nA-Xin carefully folded his slip into his backpack, his fingers instinctively reaching to touch the cool, hard brass gear resting against his chest.\n\nHe looked up at Teacher Gao standing beside the open window.\n\nThe golden rays of the setting sun rested upon the teacher's broad, upright shoulders, crowning that normally stern, stoic silhouette with a warm halo of gold.\n\nTeacher Gao turned around, the blue glint on his lenses dancing gently in the sunset; meeting the twenty-six pairs of bright, expectant eyes, his voice was calm and unwavering:\n\n\"Comrades, on the graduation trip two weeks from now... this unit shall accompany you every step of the way... safeguarding all of Class 6-1, to ensure your safe return.\"\n\nOutside, the evening breeze swirled golden leaves across the darkening sports field; and on the distant southern horizon, a colossal tempest destined to engulf Luyang Elementary was already gathering quietly in the skies...\n\n(Volume 2: *The Phony Plumber Infiltrates Campus* — Fully Completed)\n"}];
